 a pack of wild dogs were to appear at this moment, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,4,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,4,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the odds of scaling a tree before they attacked are not in my favor. I should get up, move around, and work the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,4,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,4,3,0","type":4,"elements":"stiffness from my limbs. But instead I sit, as motionless as the rock beneath me, while the dawn begins to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,4,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,4,4,0","type":4,"elements":"lighten the woods. I can't fight the sun. I can only watch helplessly as it drags me into a day that I've been ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,4,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,4,5,0","type":4,"elements":"dreading for months. By noon they will all be at my new house in the Victor's Village. The reporters, the camera ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,4,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,4,6,0","type":4,"elements":"crews, even Effie Trinket, my old escort, will have","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,5","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,5,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,5,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,6","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,6,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,6,0,0","type":4,"elements":"made their way to District 12 from the Capitol. I wonder if Effie will still be wearing that silly pink wig, or if she'll ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,6,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,6,1,0","type":4,"elements":"be sporting some other unnatural color especially for the Victory Tour. There will be others waiting, too. A staff to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,6,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,6,2,0","type":4,"elements":"cater to my every need on the long train trip. A prep team to beautify me for public appearances. My stylist and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,6,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,6,3,0","type":4,"elements":"friend, Cinna, who designed the gorgeous outfits that first made the audience take notice of me in the Hunger ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,6,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,6,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Games. If it were up to me, I would try to forget the Hunger Games entirely. Never speak of them. Pretend they ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,6,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,6,5,0","type":4,"elements":"were nothing but a bad dream. But the Victory Tour makes that impossible. Strategically placed almost midway ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,6,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,6,6,0","type":4,"elements":"between the annual Games, it is the Capitol's way of keeping the horror fresh and immediate. Not only are we ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,6,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,6,7,0","type":4,"elements":"in the districts forced to remember the iron grip of the Capitol's power each year, we are forced to celebrate it. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,6,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,6,8,0","type":4,"elements":"And this year, I am one of the stars","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,7","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,7,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,7,0,0","type":4,"elements":"of the show. I will have to travel from district to district, to stand before the cheering crowds who secretly loathe ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,7,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,7,1,0","type":4,"elements":"me, to look down into the faces of the families whose children I have killed... The sun persists in rising, so I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,7,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,7,2,0","type":4,"elements":"make myself stand. All my joints complain and my left leg has been asleep for so long that it takes several ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,7,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,7,3,0","type":4,"elements":"minutes of pacing to bring the feeling back into it. I've been in the woods three hours, but as I've made no real ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,7,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,7,4,0","type":4,"elements":"attempt at hunting, I have nothing to show for it. It doesn't matter for my mother and little sister, Prim, anymore. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,7,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,7,5,0","type":4,"elements":"They can afford to buy butcher meat in town, although none of us likes it any better than fresh game. But my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,7,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,7,6,0","type":4,"elements":"best friend, Gale Hawthorne, and his family will be depending on today's haul and I can't let them down. I start ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,7,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,7,7,0","type":4,"elements":"the hour-and-a-half trek it will take to cover our snare line. Back when we were in school, we had time in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,7,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,7,8,0","type":4,"elements":"afternoons to check the line and hunt and gather and still","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,8","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,8,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,8,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,9","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,9,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,9,0,0","type":4,"elements":"get back to trade in town. But now that Gale has gone to work in the coal mines -- and I have nothing to do all ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,9,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,9,1,0","type":4,"elements":"day--I've taken over the job. By this time Gale will have clocked in at the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,10","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,10,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,10,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,11","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,11,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,11,0,0","type":4,"elements":"mines, taken the stomach-churning elevator ride into the depths of the earth, and be pounding away at a coal ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,11,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,11,1,0","type":4,"elements":"seam. I know what it's like down there. Every year in school, as part of our training, my class had to tour the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,11,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,11,2,0","type":4,"elements":"mines. When I was little, it was just unpleasant. The claustrophobic tunnels, foul air, suffocating darkness on all ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,11,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,11,3,0","type":4,"elements":"sides. But after my father and several other miners were killed in an explosion, I could barely force myself onto ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,11,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,11,4,0","type":4,"elements":"the elevator. The annual trip became an enormous source of anxiety. Twice I made myself so sick in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,11,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,11,5,0","type":4,"elements":"anticipation of it that my mother kept me home because she thought I had contracted the flu. I","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,12","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,12,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,12,0,0","type":4,"elements":"think of Gale, who is only really alive in the woods, with its fresh air and sunlight and clean, flowing water. I don't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,12,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,12,1,0","type":4,"elements":"know how he stands it. Well ... yes, I do. He stands it because it's the way to feed his mother and two younger ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,12,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,12,2,0","type":4,"elements":"brothers and sister. And here I am with buckets of money, far more than enough to feed both our families now, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,12,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,12,3,0","type":4,"elements":"and he won't take a single coin. It's even hard for him to let me bring in meat, although he'd surely have kept ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,12,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,12,4,0","type":4,"elements":"my mother and Prim supplied if I'd been killed in the Games. I tell him he's doing me a favor, that it drives me ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,12,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,12,5,0","type":4,"elements":"nuts to sit around all day. Even so, I never drop off the game while he's at home. Which is easy since he works ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,12,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,12,6,0","type":4,"elements":"twelve hours a day. The only time I really get to see Gale now is on Sundays, when we meet up in the woods to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,12,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,12,7,0","type":4,"elements":"hunt together. It's still the best day of the week, but it's not like it used to be before, when we could tell each ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,12,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,12,8,0","type":4,"elements":"other anything. The Games have spoiled even that. I keep","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,13","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,13,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,13,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,14","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,14,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,14,0,0","type":4,"elements":"hoping that as time passes we'll regain the ease between us, but part of me knows it's futile. There's no going ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,14,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,14,1,0","type":4,"elements":"back. I get a good haul from the traps -- eight rabbits, two squirrels, and a beaver that swam into a wire ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,14,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,14,2,0","type":4,"elements":"contraption Gale designed himself. He's something of a whiz with snares, rigging them to bent saplings so they ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,14,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,14,3,0","type":4,"elements":"pull the kill out of the reach of predators, balancing logs on delicate stick triggers, weaving inescapable baskets ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,14,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,14,4,0","type":4,"elements":"to capture fish. As I go along, carefully resetting each snare, I know I can never quite replicate his eye for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,14,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,14,5,0","type":4,"elements":"balance, his instinct for where the prey will cross the path. It's more than experience. It's a natural gift. Like the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,14,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,14,6,0","type":4,"elements":"way I can shoot at an animal in almost complete darkness and still take it down with one arrow. By the time I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,14,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,14,7,0","type":4,"elements":"make it back to the fence that surrounds District 12, the sun is well up. As always, I listen a moment, but there's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,14,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,14,8,0","type":4,"elements":"no telltale hum of electrical current running through the chain","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,15","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,15,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,15,0,0","type":4,"elements":"link. There hardly ever is, even though the thing is supposed to be charged full-time. I wriggle through the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,15,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,15,1,0","type":4,"elements":"opening at the bottom of the fence and come up in the Meadow, just a stone's throw from my home. My old ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,15,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,15,2,0","type":4,"elements":"home. We still get to keep it since officially it's the designated dwelling of my mother and sister. If I should drop ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,15,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,15,3,0","type":4,"elements":"dead right now, they would have to return to it. But at present, they're both","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,16","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,16,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,16,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,17","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,17,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,17,0,0","type":4,"elements":"happily installed in the new house in the Victor's Village, and I'm the only one who uses the squat little place ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,17,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,17,1,0","type":4,"elements":"where I was raised. To me, it's my real home. I go there now to switch my clothes. Exchange my father's old ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,17,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,17,2,0","type":4,"elements":"leather jacket for a fine wool coat that always seems too tight in the shoulders. Leave my soft, worn hunting ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,17,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,17,3,0","type":4,"elements":"boots for a pair of expensive machine-made shoes that my mother thinks are more appropriate for someone of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,17,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,17,4,0","type":4,"elements":"my status. I've already","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,18","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,18,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,18,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,19","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,19,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,19,0,0","type":4,"elements":"stowed my bow and arrows in a hollow log in the woods. Although time is ticking away, I allow myself a few ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,19,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,19,1,0","type":4,"elements":"minutes to sit in the kitchen. It has an abandoned quality with no fire on the hearth, no cloth on the table. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,19,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,19,2,0","type":4,"elements":"mourn my old life here. We barely scraped by, but I knew where I fit in, I knew what my place was in the tightly ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,19,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,19,3,0","type":4,"elements":"interwoven fabric that was our life. I wish I could go back to it because, in retrospect, it seems so secure ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,19,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,19,4,0","type":4,"elements":"compared with now, when I am so rich and so famous and so hated by the authorities in the Capitol. A wailing at ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,19,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,19,5,0","type":4,"elements":"the back door demands my attention. I open it to find Buttercup, Prim's scruffy old tomcat. He dislikes the new ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,19,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,19,6,0","type":4,"elements":"house almost as much as I do and always leaves it when my sister's at school. We've never been particularly ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,19,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,19,7,0","type":4,"elements":"fond of each other, but now we have this new bond. I let him in, feed him a chunk of beaver fat, and even rub ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,19,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,19,8,0","type":4,"elements":"him between the ears for a bit. \"You're hideous, you","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,20","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,20,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,20,0,0","type":4,"elements":"know that, right?\" I ask him. Buttercup nudges my hand for more petting, but we have to go. \"Come on, you.\" I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,20,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,20,1,0","type":4,"elements":"scoop him up with one hand, grab my game bag with the other, and haul them both out onto the street. The cat ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,20,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,20,2,0","type":4,"elements":"springs free and disappears under a bush. The shoes pinch my toes as I crunch along the cinder street. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,20,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,20,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Cutting down alleys and through backyards gets me to Gale's house in minutes. His mother, Hazelle, sees me ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,20,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,20,4,0","type":4,"elements":"through the window, where she's bent over the kitchen sink. She dries her hands on her apron and disappears ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,20,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,20,5,0","type":4,"elements":"to meet me at the door. I like Hazelle. Respect her. The explosion that killed my father took out her husband as ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,20,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,20,6,0","type":4,"elements":"well, leaving her with three boys and a baby due any day. Less than a week after she gave birth, she was out ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,20,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,20,7,0","type":4,"elements":"hunting the streets for work. The mines weren't an option, what with a baby to look after, but she managed to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,20,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,20,8,0","type":4,"elements":"get laundry from some of the merchants in town.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,21","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,21,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,21,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,22","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,22,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,22,0,0","type":4,"elements":"At fourteen, Gale, the eldest of the kids, became the main supporter of the family. He was already signed up for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,22,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,22,1,0","type":4,"elements":"tesserae, which entitled them to a meager supply of grain and oil in exchange for his entering his name extra ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,22,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,22,2,0","type":4,"elements":"times in the drawing to become a tribute. On top of that, even back then, he was a skilled trapper. But it wasn't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,22,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,22,3,0","type":4,"elements":"enough to keep a family of five without Hazelle working her fingers to the bone on that washboard. In winter her ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,22,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,22,4,0","type":4,"elements":"hands got so red and cracked, they bled at the slightest provocation. Still would if it wasn't for a salve my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,22,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,22,5,0","type":4,"elements":"mother concocted. But they are determined, Hazelle and Gale, that the other boys, twelve- year-old Rory and","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,23","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,23,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,23,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,24","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,24,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,24,0,0","type":4,"elements":"ten-year-old Vick, and the baby, four-year-old Posy, will never have to sign up for tesserae. Hazelle smiles ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,24,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,24,1,0","type":4,"elements":"when she sees the game. She takes the beaver by the tail, feeling its","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,25","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,25,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,25,0,0","type":4,"elements":"weight. \"He's going to make a nice stew.\" Unlike Gale, she has no problem with our hunting arrangement. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,25,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,25,1,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Good pelt, too,\" I answer. It's comforting here with Hazelle. Weighing the merits of the game, just as we always ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,25,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,25,2,0","type":4,"elements":"have. She pours me a mug of herb tea, which I wrap my chilled fingers around gratefully. \"You know, when I get ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,25,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,25,3,0","type":4,"elements":"back from the tour, I was thinking I might take Rory out with me sometimes. After school. Teach him to shoot.\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,25,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,25,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Hazelle nods. \"That'd be good. Gale means to, but he's only got his Sundays, and I think he likes saving those ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,25,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,25,5,0","type":4,"elements":"for you.\" I can't stop the redness that floods my cheeks. It's stupid, of course. Hardly anybody knows me better ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,25,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,25,6,0","type":4,"elements":"than Hazelle. Knows the bond I share with Gale. I'm sure plenty of people assumed that we'd eventually get ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,25,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,25,7,0","type":4,"elements":"married even if I never gave it any thought. But that was before the Games. Before my fellow tribute, Peeta ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,25,8","type":3,"elements":[{"