t. If it attracts a somewhat criminal element, then I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,27,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,27,7,0","type":4,"elements":"belong here, I guess. Hunting in the woods surrounding District 12 violates at least a dozen laws and is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,27,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,27,8,0","type":4,"elements":"punishable by death. Although they","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,28","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,28,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,28,0,0","type":4,"elements":"never mention it, I owe the people who frequent the Hob. Gale told me that Greasy Sae, the old woman who ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,28,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,28,1,0","type":4,"elements":"serves up soup, started a collection to sponsor Peeta and me during the Games. It was supposed to be just a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,28,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,28,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Hob thing, but a lot of other people heard about it and chipped in. I don't know exactly how much it was, and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,28,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,28,3,0","type":4,"elements":"the price of any gift in the arena was exorbitant. But for all I know, it made the difference between my life and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,28,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,28,4,0","type":4,"elements":"death. It's still odd to drag open the front door with an empty game bag, with nothing to trade, and instead feel ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,28,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,28,5,0","type":4,"elements":"the heavy pocket of coins against my hip. I try to hit as many stalls as possible, spreading out my purchases of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,28,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,28,6,0","type":4,"elements":"coffee, buns, eggs, yarn, and oil. As an afterthought, I buy three bottles of white liquor from a one-armed ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,28,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,28,7,0","type":4,"elements":"woman named Ripper, a victim of a mine accident who was smart enough to find a way to stay alive. The liquor ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,28,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,28,8,0","type":4,"elements":"isn't for my family. It's for Haymitch,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,29","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,29,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,29,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,30","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,30,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,30,0,0","type":4,"elements":"who acted as mentor for Peeta and me in the Games. He's surly, violent, and drunk most of the time. But he did ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,30,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,30,1,0","type":4,"elements":"his job -- more than his job--because for the first time in history, two tributes were allowed to win. So no matter ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,30,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,30,2,0","type":4,"elements":"who Haymitch is, I owe him, too. And that's for always. I'm getting the white liquor because a few weeks ago he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,30,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,30,3,0","type":4,"elements":"ran out and there was none for sale and he had a withdrawal, shaking and screaming at terrifying things only ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,30,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,30,4,0","type":4,"elements":"he could see. He scared Prim to death and, 