","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,31,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,31,4,0","type":4,"elements":"usually good for a joke. He's probably in his twenties, but he doesn't seem much older than I do. Something ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,31,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,31,5,0","type":4,"elements":"about his smile, his red hair that sticks out every which way, gives him a boyish quality. \"Aren't you supposed to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,31,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,31,6,0","type":4,"elements":"be on a train?\" he asks me. \"They're collecting me at noon,\" I answer.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,32","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,32,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,32,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,33","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,33,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,33,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Shouldn't you look better?\" he asks in a loud whisper. I can't help smiling at his teasing, in spite of my mood. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,33,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,33,1,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Maybe","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,34","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,34,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,34,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,35","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,35,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,35,0,0","type":4,"elements":"a ribbon in your hair or something?\" He flicks my braid with his hand and I brush him away. \"Don't worry. By the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,35,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,35,1,0","type":4,"elements":"time they get through with me I'll be unrecognizable,\" I say. \"Good,\" he says. \"Let's show a little district pride for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,35,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,35,2,0","type":4,"elements":"a change, Miss Everdeen. Hm?\" He shakes his head at Greasy Sae in mock disapproval and walks off to join ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,35,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,35,3,0","type":4,"elements":"his friends. \"I'll want that bowl back,\" Greasy Sae calls after him, but since she's laughing, she doesn't sound ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,35,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,35,4,0","type":4,"elements":"particularly stern. \"Gale going to see you off?\" she asks me. \"No, he wasn't on the list,\" I say. \"I saw him ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,35,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,35,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Sunday, though.\" \"Think he'd have made the list. Him being your cousin and all,\" she says wryly. It's just one ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,35,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,35,6,0","type":4,"elements":"more part of the lie the Capitol has concocted. When Peeta and I made it into the final eight in the Hunger ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,35,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,35,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Games, they sent reporters to do personal stories about us. When they asked about my friends, everyone ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,35,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,35,8,0","type":4,"elements":"directed them to Gale. But it wouldn't do, what with the romance I was playing out in","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,36","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,36,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,36,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the arena, to have my best friend be Gale. He was too handsome, too male, and not the least bit willing to smile ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,36,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,36,1,0","type":4,"elements":"and play nice for the cameras. We do resemble each other, though, quite a bit. We have that Seam look. Dark ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,36,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,36,2,0","type":4,"elements":"straight hair, olive skin, gray eyes. So some genius made him my cousin. I didn't know about it until we were ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,36,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,36,3,0","type":4,"elements":"already home, on the platform at the train station, and my mother said, \"Your cousins can hardly wait to see ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,36,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,36,4,0","type":4,"elements":"you!\" Then I turned and saw Gale and Hazelle and all the kids waiting for me, so what could I do but go along? ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,36,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,36,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Greasy Sae knows we're not related, but even some of the people who have known us for years seem to have ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,36,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,36,6,0","type":4,"elements":"forgotten. \"I just can't wait for the whole thing to be over,\" I whisper. \"I know,\" says Greasy Sae. \"But you've got ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,36,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,36,7,0","type":4,"elements":"to go through it to get to the end of it. Better not be late.\" A light snow starts to fall as I make my way to the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,36,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,36,8,0","type":4,"elements":"Victor's Village. It's about a half-mile walk from the square in the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"T