he cameras, so it's no time to be tracking ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,46,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,46,3,0","type":4,"elements":"up her shiny floors. I've barely stepped inside when she's there, holding my arm as if to stop me. \"Don't worry, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,46,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,46,4,0","type":4,"elements":"I'm taking them off here,\" I say, leaving my shoes on the mat. My mother gives an odd, breathy laugh and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,46,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,46,5,0","type":4,"elements":"removes the game bag loaded with supplies from my shoulder. \"It's just snow. Did you have a nice walk?\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,46,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,46,6,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Walk?\" She knows I've been in the woods half the night. Then I see the man standing behind her in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,46,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,46,7,0","type":4,"elements":"kitchen doorway. One look at his tailored suit and surgically perfected features and I know he's from the Capitol. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,46,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,46,8,0","type":4,"elements":"Something is wrong. \"It was more like skating. It's really","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,47","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,47,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,47,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,48","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,48,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,48,0,0","type":4,"elements":"getting slippery out there.\" \"Someone's here to see you,\" says my mother. Her face is too pale and I can hear ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,48,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,48,1,0","type":4,"elements":"the anxiety she's trying to hide. \"I thought they weren't due until noon.\" I pretend not to notice her state. \"Did ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,48,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,48,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Cinna come early to help me get ready?\" \"No, Katniss, it's --\" my mother begins. \"This way, please, Miss ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,48,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,48,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Everdeen,\" says the man. He gestures down the hallway. It's weird to be ushered around your own home, but I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,48,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,48,4,0","type":4,"elements":"know better than to comment on it. As I go, I give my mother a reassuring smile over my shoulder. \"Probably ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,48,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,48,5,0","type":4,"elements":"more instructions for the tour.\" They've been sending me all kinds of stuff about my itinerary and what protocol ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,48,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,48,6,0","type":4,"elements":"will be observed in each district. But as I walk toward the door of the study, a door I have never even seen ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,48,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,48,7,0","type":4,"elements":"closed until this moment, I can feel my mind begin to race. Who is here? What do they want? Why is my mother ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,48,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,48,8,0","type":4,"elements":"so pale? \"Go right in,\" says the Capitol man, who has followed me","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,49","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,49,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,49,0,0","type":4,"elements":