type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,53,7,0","type":4,"elements":"insane by a passionate love for Peeta. So we were both allowed to live. To be crowned victors. To go home ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,53,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,53,8,0","type":4,"elements":"and celebrate and wave good-bye to the cameras and be left alone. Until now.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,54","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,54,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,54,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Perhaps it is the newness of the house or the shock of seeing him or the mutual understanding that he could ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,54,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,54,1,0","type":4,"elements":"have me killed in a second that makes me feel like the intruder. As if this is his home and I'm the uninvited party. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,54,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,54,2,0","type":4,"elements":"So I don't welcome him or offer him a chair. I don't say anything. In fact, I treat him as if he's a real snake, the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,54,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,54,3,0","type":4,"elements":"venomous kind. I stand motionless, my eyes locked on him, considering plans of retreat. \"I think we'll make this ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,54,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,54,4,0","type":4,"elements":"whole situation a lot simpler by agreeing not to lie to each other,\" he says. \"What do you think?\" I think my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,54,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,54,5,0","type":4,"elements":"tongue has frozen and speech will be impossible, so I surprise myself by answering back in a steady voice, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,54,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,54,6,0","ty