ario. And you were pretty good, too, with the love-crazed ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,60,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,60,3,0","type":4,"elements":"schoolgirl bit. The people in the Capitol were quite convinced. Unfortunately, not everyone in the districts fell for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,60,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,60,4,0","type":4,"elements":"your act,\" he says. My face must register at least a flicker of bewilderment, because he addresses it. \"This, of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,60,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,60,5,0","type":4,"elements":"course, you don't know. You have no access to information about the mood in other districts. In several of them, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,60,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,60,6,0","type":4,"elements":"however, people viewed your little trick with the berries as an act of defiance, not an act of love. And if a girl from ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,60,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,60,7,0","type":4,"elements":"District Twelve of all places can defy the Capitol and walk away unharmed, what is to stop them from doing the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,60,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,60,8,0","type":4,"elements":"same?\" he says. \"What is to","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,61","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,61,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,61,0,0","type":4,"elements":"prevent, say, an uprising?\" It takes a moment for his last sentence to sink in. Then the full weight of it hits me. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,61,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,61,1,0","type":4,"elements":"\"There have been uprisings?\" I ask, both chilled and somewhat elated by the possibility. \"Not yet. But they'll ","