e and I spend our Sundays hunting. Don't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,71,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,71,1,0","type":4,"elements":"we show up at the end of each one loaded down with game? Haven't we for years? The real question is what ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,71,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,71,2,0","type":4,"elements":"he thinks goes on in the woods beyond District 12. Surely they haven't been tracking us in there. Or have they? ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,71,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,71,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Could we have been followed? That seems impossible. At least by a person. Cameras? That never crossed my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,71,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,71,4,0","type":4,"elements":"mind until this moment. The woods have always been our place of safety, our place beyond the reach of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,71,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,71,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Capitol, where we're free to say what","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,72","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,72,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,72,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,73","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,73,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,73,0,0","type":4,"elements":"we feel, be who we are. At least before the Games. If we've been watched since, what have they seen? Two ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,73,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,73,1,0","type":4,"elements":"people hunting, saying treasonous things against the Capitol, yes. But not two people in love, which seems to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,73,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,73,2,0","type"