when I get upset. Then I looked up and there he was, ten feet","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,79","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,79,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,79,0,0","type":4,"elements":"away, just watching me. Without even thinking, I jumped up and threw my arms around him, making some ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,79,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,79,1,0","type":4,"elements":"weird sound that combined laughing, choking, and crying. He was holding me so tightly that I couldn't see his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,79,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,79,2,0","type":4,"elements":"face, but it was a really long time before he let me go and then he didn't have much choice, because I'd gotten ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,79,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,79,3,0","type":4,"elements":"this unbelievably loud case of the hiccups and had to get a drink. We did what we always did that day. Ate ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,79,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,79,4,0","type":4,"elements":"breakfast. Hunted and fished and gathered. Talked about people in town. But not about us, his new life in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,79,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,79,5,0","type":4,"elements":"mines, my time in the arena. Just about other things. By the time we were at the hole in the fence that's nearest ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,79,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,79,6,0","type":4,"elements":"the Hob, I think I really believed that things could be the same. That we could go on as we always had. I'd ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,79,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,79,7,0","type":4,"elements":"given all the game to Gale to trade since we had so much food now. I told him I'd skip the Hob, even though I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,79,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,79,8,0","type":4,"elements":"was looking forward to going there, because my mother and","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,80","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,80,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,80,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,81","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,81,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,81,0,0","type":4,"elements":"sister didn't even know I'd gone hunting and they'd be wondering where I was. Then suddenly, as I was ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,81,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,81,1,0","type":4,"elements":"suggesting I take over the daily snare run, he took my face in his hands and kissed me. I was completely ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,81,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,81,2,0","type":4,"elements":"unprepared. You would think that after all the hours I'd spent with Gale--watching him talk and laugh and frown ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,81,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,81,3,0","type":4,"elements":"-- that I would know all there was to know about his lips. But I hadn't imagined how warm they would feel ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,81,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,81,4,0","type":4,"elements":"pressed against my own. Or how those hands, which could set the most intricate of snares, could as easily ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,81,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,81,5,0","type":4,"elements":"entrap me. I think I made some sort of noise in the back of my throat, and I vaguely remember my fingers, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,81,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,81,6,0","type":4,"elements":"curled tightly closed, resting on his chest. Then he let go and said, \"I had to do that. At least once.\" And he was ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,81,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,81,7,0","type":4,"elements":"gone. Despite the fact that the sun was setting and my family would be worried, I sat by a tree next to the fence. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,81,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,81,8,0","type":4,"elements":"I tried to decide how I felt about the kiss, if I had liked it or resented it, but all","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,82","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,82,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,82,0,0","type":4,"elements":"I really remembered was the pressure of Gale's lips and the scent of the oranges that still lingered on his skin. It ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,82,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,82,1,0","type":4,"elements":"was pointless comparing it with the many kisses I'd exchanged with Peeta. I still hadn't figured out if any of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,82,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,82,2,0","type":4,"elements":"those counted. Finally I went home. That week I managed the snares and dropped off the meat with Hazelle. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,82,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,82,3,0","type":4,"elements":"But I didn't see Gale until Sunday. I had this whole speech worked out, about how I didn't want a boyfriend and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,82,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,82,4,0","type":4,"elements":"never planned on marrying, but I didn't end up using it. Gale acted as if the kiss had never happened. Maybe ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,82,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,82,5,0","type":4,"elements":"he was waiting for me to say something. Or kiss him back. Instead I just pretended it had never happened, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,82,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,82,6,0","type":4,"elements":"either. But it had. Gale had shattered some invisible barrier between us and, with it, any hope I had of resuming ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,82,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,82,7,0","type":4,"elements":"our old, uncomplicated","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,83","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,83,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,83,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,84","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,84,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,84,0,0","type":4,"elements":"friendship. Whatever I pretended, I could never look","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,85","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,85,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,85,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,86","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,86,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,86,0,0","type":4,"elements":"at his lips in quite the same way. This all flashes through my head in an instant as President Snow's eyes bore ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,86,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,86,1,0","type":4,"elements":"into me on the heels of his threat to kill Gale. How stupid I've been to think the Capitol would just ignore me ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,86,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,86,2,0","type":4,"elements":"once I'd returned home! Maybe I didn't know about the potential uprisings. But I knew they were angry with me. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,86,3","type":3,"ele