,"elements":"lipstick on me but resigns himself to a pink as they begin to color my face and nails. I can see by the palette ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,115,9","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,115,9,0","type":4,"elements":"Cinna has assigned that we're going for girlish, not sexy. Good. I'll never convince anyone of anything if I'm ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,115,10","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,115,10,0","type":4,"elements":"trying to be provocative. Haymitch made that very clear when he was coaching me for my interview for the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,115,11","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,115,11,0","type":4,"elements":"Games. My mother comes in, somewhat shyly, and says that Cinna has asked her to show the preps how she ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,115,12","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,115,12,0","type":4,"elements":"did my hair the day of the reaping. They respond with enthusiasm and then watch, thoroughly engrossed, as ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,115,13","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,115,13,0","type":4,"elements":"she breaks down the process of the elaborate braided hairdo. In the mirror, I can see their earnest faces ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,115,14","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,115,14,0","type":4,"elements":"following her every move, their eagerness when it is their turn to try a step. In fact, all three are so readily ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,115,15","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,115,15,0","type":4,"elements":"respectful and nice to my mother that I feel bad about how I go around feeling so superior to them. Who knows ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,115,16","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,115,16,0","type":4,"elements":"who I would be or what I would talk about if I'd been raised in the Capitol? Maybe my","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,116","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,116,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,116,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,117","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,117,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,117,0,0","type":4,"elements":"biggest regret would be having feathered costumes at my birthday party, too. When my hair is done, I find ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,117,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,117,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Cinna downstairs in the living room, and just the sight of him makes me feel more hopeful. He looks the same ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,117,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,117,2,0","type":4,"elements":"as always, simple clothes, short brown hair, just a hint of gold eyeliner. We embrace, and I can barely keep from ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,117,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,117,3,0","type":4,"elements":"spilling out the entire episode with President Snow. But no, I've decided to tell Haymitch first. He'll know best ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,117,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,117,4,0","type":4,"elements":"who to burden with it. It's so easy to talk to Cinna, though. Lately we've been speaking a lot on the telephone ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,117,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,117,5,0","type":4,"elements":"that came with the house. It's sort of a joke, because almost no one else we know owns one. There's Peeta, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,117,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,117,6,0","type":4,"elements":"but obviously I don't call him. Haymitch tore his out of the wall years ago. My friend Madge, the mayor's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,117,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,117,7,0","type":4,"elements":"daughter, has a telephone in her house, but if we want to talk, we do it in person. At first, the thing barely ever ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,117,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,117,8,0","type":4,"elements":"got used. Then Cinna started to call to work on my talent. Every","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,118","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,118,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,118,0,0","type":4,"elements":"victor is supposed to have one. Your talent is the activity you take up since you don't have to work either in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,118,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,118,1,0","type":4,"elements":"school or your district's industry. It can be anything, really, anything that they can interview you about. Peeta, it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,118,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,118,2,0","type":4,"elements":"turns out, actually has a talent, which is painting. He's been frosting those cakes and cookies for years in his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,118,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,118,3,0","type":4,"elements":"family's bakery. But now that he's rich, he can afford to smear real paint on canvases. I don't have a talent, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,118,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,118,4,0","type":4,"elements":"unless you count hunting illegally, which they don't. Or maybe singing, which I wouldn't do for the Capitol in a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,118,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,118,5,0","type":4,"elements":"million years. My mother tried to interest me in a variety of suitable alternatives from a list Effie Trinket sent her. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-48