,"elements":"fixes it on the knot in the scarf. Effie Trinket's nearby, clapping her hands. \"Attention, everyone! We're about to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,131,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,131,2,0","type":4,"elements":"do the first outdoor shot, where the victors greet each other at the beginning of their marvelous trip. All right, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,131,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,131,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Katniss, big smile, you're very excited, right?\" I don't exaggerate when I say she shoves me out the door. For a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,131,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,131,4,0","type":4,"elements":"moment I can't quite see right because of the snow, which is now coming down in","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,132","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,132,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,132,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,133","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,133,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,133,0,0","type":4,"elements":"earnest. Then I make out Peeta coming through his front door. In my head I hear President Snow's directive, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,133,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,133,1,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Convince me.\" And I know I must. My face breaks into a huge smile and I start walking in Peeta's direction. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,133,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,133,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Then, as if I can't stand it another second, I start running. He catches me and spins me around and then he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,133,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,133,3,0","type":4,"elements":"slips -- he still isn't entirely in command of his artificial leg--and we fall into the snow, me on top of him, and that's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,133,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,133,4,0","type":4,"elements":"where we have our first kiss in months. It's full of fur and snowflakes and lipstick, but underneath all that, I can ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,133,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,133,5,0","type":4,"elements":"feel the steadiness that Peeta brings to everything. And I know I'm not alone. As badly as I have hurt him, he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,133,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,133,6,0","type":4,"elements":"won't expose me in front of the cameras. Won't condemn me with a halfhearted kiss. He's still looking out for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,133,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,133,7,0","type":4,"elements":"me. Just as he did in the arena. Somehow the thought makes me want to cry. Instead I pull him to his feet, tuck ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,133,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,133,8,0","type":4,"elements":"my glove through the crook of his arm, and merrily pull him on","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,134","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,134,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,134,0,0","type":4,"elements":"our way. The rest of the day is a blur of getting to the station, bidding everyone good-bye, the train pulling out, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,134,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,134,1,0","type":4,"elements":"the old team -- Peeta and me, Effie and Haymitch, Cinna and Portia, Peeta's stylist--dining on an indescribably ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,134,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,134,2,0","type":4,"elements":"delicious meal I don't remember. And then I'm swathed in pajamas and a voluminous robe, sitting in my plush ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,134,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,134,3,0","type":4,"elements":"compartment, waiting for the others to go to sleep. I know Haymitch will be up for hours. He doesn't like to sleep ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,134,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,134,4,0","type":4,"elements":"when it's dark out. When the train seems quiet, I put on my slippers and pad down to his door. I have to knock ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,134,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,134,5,0","type":4,"elements":"several times before he answers, scowling, as if he's certain I've brought bad news. \"What do you want?\" he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,134,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,134,6,0","type":4,"elements":"says, nearly knocking me out with a cloud of wine fumes. \"I have to talk to you,\" I whisper. \"Now?\" he says. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,134,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,134,7,0","type":4,"elements":"nod. \"This better be good.\" He waits, but I feel certain every word we utter on a Capitol train is being recorded. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,134,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,134,8,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Well?\" he barks. The train starts to brake and for a","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,135","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,135,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,135,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,136","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,136,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,136,0,0","type":4,"elements":"second I think President Snow is watching me and doesn't approve of my confiding in Haymitch and has ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,136,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,136,1,0","type":4,"elements":"decided to go ahead and kill me now. But we're just stopping for fuel. \"The train's so stuffy,\" I say. It's a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,136,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,136,2,0","type":4,"elements":"harmless phrase, but I see Haymitch's eyes narrow in understanding. \"I know what you need.\" He pushes past ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,136,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,136,3,0","type":4,"elements":"me and lurches down the hall to a door. When he wrestles it open, a blast of snow hits us. He trips out onto the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,136,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,136,4,0","type":4,"elements":"ground. A Capitol attendant rushes to help, but Haymitch waves her away","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,137","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,137,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,137,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,138","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,138,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,138,0,0","type":4,"elements":"good-naturedly as he staggers off. \"Just want some fresh air. Only be a minute.\" \"Sorry. He's drunk,\" I say ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,138,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,138,1,0","type":4,"elements":"apologetically. \"I'll get him.\" I hop down and stumble along the track behind him, soaking my slippers with snow, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,138,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,138,2,0","type":4,"elements":"as he leads me beyond the end of the train so we will not be overheard. Then he turns on me. \"What?\" I tell him","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,139","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,139,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,139,0,0","type":4,"elements":"everything. About the president's visit, about Gale, about how we're all going to die if I fail. His face sobers, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,139,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,139,1,0","type":4,"elements":"grows older in the glow of the red tail-lights. \"Then you can't fail.\" \"If you could just help me get through this ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,139,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,139,2,0","type":4,"elements":"trip--\" I begin. \"No, Katniss, it's not just this trip,\" he says. \"What do you mean?\" I say. \"Even if you pull it off, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,139,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,139,3,0","type":4,"elements":"they'll be back in another few months to take us all to the Games. You and Peeta, you'll be mentors now, every ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,139,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,139,4,0","type":4,"elements":"year from here on out. And every year they'll revisit the romance and broadcast the details of your private life, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,139,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,139,5,0","type":4,"elements":"and you'll never, ever be able to do anything but live happily ever after with that boy.\" The full impact of what ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,139,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,139,6,0","type":4,"elements":"he's saying hits me. I will never have a life with Gale, even if I want to. I will never be allowed to live alone. I will ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,139,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,139,7,0","type":4,"elements":"have to be forever in love with Peeta. The Capitol will insist on it. I'll have a few years maybe, because I'm still ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,139,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,139,8,0","type":4,"elements":"only sixteen, to stay with my mother and Prim. And","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,140","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,140,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,140,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,141","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,141,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,141,0,0","type":4,"elements":"then ... and then ... \"Do you understand what I mean?\" he presses me. I nod. He means there's only one future, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,141,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,141,1,0","type":4,"elements":"if I want to keep those I love alive and stay alive myself. I'll have to marry Peeta. We slog back to the train in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,141,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,141,2,0","type":4,"elements":"silence. In the hallway outside my door, Haymitch gives my shoulder a pat and says, \"You could do a lot worse, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,141,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,141,3,0","type":4,"elements":"you know.\" He heads off to his compartment, taking the smell of wine with him. In my room, I remove my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,141,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,141,4,0","type":4,"elements":"sodden slippers, my wet robe and pajamas. There are more in the drawers but I just crawl between the covers ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,141,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,141,5,0","type":4,"elements":"of my bed in my underclothes. I stare into the darkness, thinking about my conversation with Haymitch. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,141,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,141,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Everything he said was true about the Capitol's expectations, my future with Peeta, even his last comment. Of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,141,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,141,7,0","type":4,"elements":"course, I could do a lot worse than Peeta. That isn't really the point, though, is it? One of the few freedoms we ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,141,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,141,8,0","type":4,"elements":"have in District 12 is the right to marry who we want or not marry at","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,142","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,142,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,142,0,0","type":4,"elements":"all. And now even that has been taken away from me. I wonder if President Snow will insist we have children. If ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,142,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,142,1,0","type":4,"elements":"we do, they'll have to face the reaping each year. And wouldn't it be something to see the child of not one but ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,142,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,142,2,0","type":4,"elements":"two victors chosen for the arena? Victors' children have been in the ring before. It always causes a lot of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,142,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,142,3,0","type":4,"elements":"excitement and generates talk about how the odds are not in that family's favor. But it happens too frequently to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,142,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,142,4,0","type":4,"elements":"just be about odds. Gale's convinced the Capitol does it on purpose, rigs the drawings to add extra drama. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,142,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,142,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Given all the trouble I've caused, I've probably guaranteed any child of mine a spot in the Games. I think of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,142,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,142,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Haymitch, unmarried, no family,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,143","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,143,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,143,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,144","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,144,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,144,0,0","type":4,"elements":"blotting out the world with drink. He could have had his choice of any woman in the district. And he chose ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,144,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,144,1,0","type":4,"elements":"solitude. Not solitude-- that sounds too peaceful. More like","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,145","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,145,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,145,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,146","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,0,0","type":4,"elements":"solitary confinement. Was it because, having been in the arena, he knew it was better than risking the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,1,0","type":4,"elements":"alternative? I had a taste of that alternative when they called Prim's name on reaping day and I watched her ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,2,0","type":4,"elements":"walk to the stage to her death. But as her sister I could take her place, an option forbidden to our mother. My ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,3,0","type":4,"elements":"mind searches frantically for a way out. I can't let President Snow condemn me to this. Even if it means taking ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,4,0","type":4,"elements":"my own life. Before that, though, I'd try to run away. What would they do if I simply vanished? Disappeared into ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,5,0","type":4,"elements":"the woods and never came out? Could I even manage to take everyone I love with me, start a new life deep in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,6,0","type":4,"elements":"the wild? Highly unlikely but not impossible. I shake my head to clear it. This is not the time to be making wild ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,7,0","type":4,"elements":"escape plans. I must focus on the Victory Tour. Too many people's fates depend on my giving a good show. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,8,0","type":4,"elements":"Dawn comes before sleep does, and there's Effie rapping on my door. I pull on whatever clothes are at the top ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,9","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,9,0","type":4,"elements":"of the drawer and drag myself down to the dining car. I don't see what difference it makes when I get up, since ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,10","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,10,0","type":4,"elements":"this is a travel day, but then it turns out that yesterday's makeover was just to get me to the train station. Today ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,11","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,11,0","type":4,"elements":"I'll get the works from my prep team. \"Why? It's too cold for anything to show,\" I grumble. \"Not in District ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,12","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,12,0","type":4,"elements":"Eleven,\" says Effie. District 11. Our first stop. I'd rather start in any other district, since this was Rue's home. But ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,13","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,13,0","type":4,"elements":"that's not how the Victory Tour works. Usually it kicks off in 12 and then goes in descending district order to 1, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,14","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,14,0","type":4,"elements":"followed by the Capitol. The victor's district is skipped and saved for very last. Since 12 puts on the least ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,15","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,15,0","type":4,"elements":"fabulous celebration -- usually just a dinner for the tributes and a victory rally in the square, where nobody looks ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,146,16","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,146,16,0","type":4,"elements":"like they're having any fun -- it's probably best to get us","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,147","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,147,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,147,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,148","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,148,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,148,0,0","type":4,"elements":"out of the way as soon as possible. This year, for the first time since Haymitch won, the final stop on the tour will ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,148,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,148,1,0","type":4,"elements":"be 12, and the Capitol will spring for the festivities. I try to enjoy the food like Hazelle said. The kitchen staff ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,148,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,148,2,0","type":4,"elements":"clearly wants to please me. They've prepared my favorite, lamb stew with dried plums, among other delicacies. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,148,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,148,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Orange juice and a pot of steaming hot chocolate wait at my place at the table. So I eat a lot, and the meal is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,148,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,148,4,0","type":4,"elements":"beyond reproach, but I can't say I'm enjoying it. I'm also annoyed that no one but Effie and I has shown up. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,148,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,148,5,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Where's everybody else?\" I ask. \"Oh, who knows where Haymitch is,\" says Effie. I didn't really expect ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,148,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,148,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Haymitch, because he's probably just getting to bed. \"Cinna was up late working on organizing your garment ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,148,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,148,7,0","type":4,"elements":"car. He must have over a hundred outfits for you. Your evening clothes are exquisite. And Peeta's team is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,148,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,148,8,0","type":4,"elements":"probably still asleep.\" \"Doesn't he need prepping?\" I ask. \"Not the way you","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,149","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,149,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,149,0,0","type":4,"elements":"do,\" Effie replies. What does this mean? It means I get to spend the morning having the hair ripped off my body ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,149,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,149,1,0","type":4,"elements":"while Peeta sleeps in. I hadn't thought about it much, but in the arena at least some of the boys got to keep ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,149,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,149,2,0","type":4,"elements":"their body hair whereas none of the girls did. I can remember Peeta's now, as I bathed him by the stream. Very ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,149,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,149,3,0","type":4,"elements":"blond in the sunlight, once the mud and blood had been washed away. Only his face remained completely ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,149,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,149,4,0","type":4,"elements":"smooth. Not one of the boys grew a beard, and many were old enough to. I wonder what they did to them. If I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,149,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,149,5,0","type":4,"elements":"feel ragged, my prep team seems in worse condition, knocking back coffee and sharing brightly colored little ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,149,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,149,6,0","type":4,"elements":"pills. As far as I can tell, they never get up before noon unless there's some sort of national emergency, like my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,149,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,149,7,0","type":4,"elements":"leg hair. I was so happy when it grew back in, too. As if it were a sign that things might be returning to normal. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,149,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,149,8,0","type":4,"elements":"run my fingers along the soft, curly","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,150","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,150,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,150,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,151","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,151,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,151,0,0","type":4,"elements":"down on my legs and give myself over to the team. None of them are up to their usual chatter, so I can hear ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,151,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,151,1,0","type":4,"elements":"every","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,152","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,152,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,152,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,153","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,153,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,153,0,0","type":4,"elements":"strand being yanked from its follicle. I have to soak in a tub full of a thick, unpleasant-smelling solution, while my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,153,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,153,1,0","type":4,"elements":"face and hair are plastered with creams. Two more baths follow in other, less offensive, concoctions. I'm ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,153,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,153,2,0","type":4,"elements":"plucked and scoured and massaged and anointed until I'm raw. Flavius tilts up my chin and sighs. \"It's a shame ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,153,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,153,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Cinna said no alterations on you.\" \"Yes, we could really make you something special,\" says Octavia. \"When ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,153,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,153,4,0","type":4,"elements":"she's older,\" says Venia almost grimly. \"Then he'll have to let us.\" Do what? Blow my lips up like President ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,153,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,153,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Snow's? Tattoo my breasts? Dye my skin magenta and implant gems in it? Cut decorative patterns in my face? ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,153,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,153,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Give me curved talons? Or cat's whiskers? I saw all these things and more on the people in","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,154","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,154,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,154,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the Capitol. Do they really have no idea how freakish they look to the rest of us? The thought of being left to my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,154,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,154,1,0","type":4,"elements":"prep team's fashion whims only adds to the miseries competing for my attention-- my abused body, my lack of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,154,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,154,2,0","type":4,"elements":"sleep, my mandatory marriage, and the terror of being unable to satisfy President Snow's demands. By the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,154,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,154,3,0","type":4,"elements":"time I reach lunch, where Effie, Cinna, Portia, Haymitch, and Peeta have started without me, I'm too weighed ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,154,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,154,4,0","type":4,"elements":"down to talk. They're raving about the food and how well they sleep on trains. Everyone's all full of excitement ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,154,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,154,5,0","type":4,"elements":"about the tour. Well, everyone but Haymitch. He's nursing a hangover and picking at a muffin. I'm not really ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,154,6","type":3,"elements"