oo,\" I say. I'm not sure for what exactly. Maybe because there's a real chance I'm about to destroy him. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,162,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,162,1,0","type":4,"elements":"\"There's nothing for you to be sorry about. You were just keeping us alive. But I don't want us to go on like this, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,162,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,162,2,0","type":4,"elements":"ignoring each other in real life and falling into the snow every time there's a camera around. So I thought if I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,162,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,162,3,0","type":4,"elements":"stopped being so, you know, wounded, we could take a shot at just being friends,\" he says. All my friends are ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,162,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,162,4,0","type":4,"elements":"probably going to end up dead, but refusing Peeta wouldn't keep him safe. \"Okay,\" I say. His offer does make ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,162,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,162,5,0","type":4,"elements":"me feel better. Less duplicitous somehow. It would be nice if he'd come to me with this earlier, before I knew that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,162,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,162,6,0","type":4,"elements":"President Snow had other plans and just being friends was not an option for us anymore. But either way, I'm ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,162,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,162,7,0","type":4,"elements":"glad we're speaking again. \"So what's wrong?\" he asks. I can't tell him. I pick at the clump of weeds. \"Let's start ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,162,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,162,8,0","type":4,"elements":"with something more basic. Isn't it strange","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,163","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,163,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,163,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,164","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,164,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,164,0,0","type":4,"elements":"that I know you'd risk your life to save mine ... but I don't know what your favorite color is?\" he says. A smile ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,164,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,164,1,0","type":4,"elements":"creeps onto my lips. \"Green. What's yours?\" \"Orange,\" he says. \"Orange? Like Effie's hair?\" I say. \"A bit more ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,164,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,164,2,0","type":4,"elements":"muted,\" he says. \"More like ... sunset.\" Sunset. I can see it immediately, the rim of the descending sun, the sky ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,164,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,164,3,0","type":4,"elements":"streaked with soft shades of orange. Beautiful. I remember the tiger lily cookie and, now that Peeta is talking to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,164,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,164,4,0","type":4,"elements":"me again, it's all I can do not to recount","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,165","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,165,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,165,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,166","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,166,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,166,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the whole story about President Snow. But I know Haymitch wouldn't want me to. I'd better stick to small talk. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,166,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,166,1,0","type":4,"elements":"\"You know, everyone's always raving about your paintings. I feel bad I haven't seen them,\" I say. \"Well, I've got ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,166,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,166,2,0","type":4,"elements":"a whole train car full.\" He rises and offers me his hand. \"Come on.\" It's good to feel his fingers entwined with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,166,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,166,3,0","type":4,"elements":"mine again, not for","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,167","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,167,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,167,0,0","type":4,"elements":"show but in actual friendship. We walk back to the train hand in hand. At the door, I remember. \"I've got to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,167,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,167,1,0","type":4,"elements":"apologize to Effie first.\" \"Don't be afraid to lay it on thick,\" Peeta tells me. So when we go back to the dining car, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,167,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,167,2,0","type":4,"elements":"where the others are still at lunch, I give Effie an apology that I think is overkill but in her mind probably just ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,167,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,167,3,0","type":4,"elements":"manages to compensate for my breach of etiquette. To her credit, Effie accepts graciously. She says it's clear ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,167,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,167,4,0","type":4,"elements":"I'm under a lot of pressure. And her comments about the necessity of someone attending to the schedule only ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,167,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,167,5,0","type":4,"elements":"last about five minutes. Really, I've gotten off easily. When Effie finishes, Peeta leads me down a few cars to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,167,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,167,6,0","type":4,"elements":"see his paintings. I don't know what I expected. Larger versions of the flower cookies maybe. But this is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,167,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,167,7,0","type":4,"elements":"something entirely different. Peeta has painted the Games. Some you wouldn't get right away, if you hadn't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,167,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,167,8,0","type":4,"elements":"been with him in the arena yourself. Water dripping","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,168","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,168,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,168,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,169","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,169,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,169,0,0","type":4,"elements":"through the cracks in our cave. The dry pond bed. A pair of hands, his own, digging for roots. Others any viewer ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,169,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,169,1,0","type":4,"elements":"would recognize. The golden horn called the Cornucopia. Clove arranging the knives inside her jacket. One of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,169,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,169,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the mutts, unmistakably the blond, green-eyed one meant to be Glimmer, snarling as it makes its way toward ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,169,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,169,3,0","type":4,"elements":"us. And me. I am everywhere. High up in a tree. Beating a shirt against the stones in the stream. Lying ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,169,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,169,4,0","type":4,"elements":"unconscious in a pool of blood. And one I can't place -- perhaps this is how I looked when his fever was ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,169,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,169,5,0","type":4,"elements":"high--emerging from a silver gray mist that matches my eyes exactly. \"What do you think?\" he asks. \"I hate ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,169,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,169,6,0","type":4,"elements":"them,\" I say. I can almost smell the blood, the dirt, the unnatural breath of the mutt. \"All I do is go around trying ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,169,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,169,7,0","type":4,"elements":"to forget the arena and you've brought it, back to life. How do you remember these things so exactly?\" \"I see ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,169,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,169,8,0","type":4,"elements":"them every night,\" he says. I know what he means. Nightmares -- which I","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,170","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,170,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,170,0,0","type":4,"elements":"was no stranger to before the Games -- now plague me whenever I sleep. But the old standby, the one of my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,170,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,170,1,0","type":4,"elements":"father being blown to bits in the mines, is rare. Instead I relive versions of what happened in the arena. My ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,170,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,170,2,0","type":4,"elements":"worthless attempt to save Rue. Peeta bleeding to death. Glimmer's bloated body disintegrating in my hands. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,170,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,170,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Cato's horrific end with the muttations. These are the most frequent visitors. \"Me, too. Does it help? To paint ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,170,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,170,4,0","type":4,"elements":"them out?\" \"I don't know. I think I'm a little less afraid of going to sleep at night, or I tell myself I am,\" he says. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,170,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,170,5,0","type":4,"elements":"\"But they haven't gone anywhere.\" \"Maybe they won't. Haymitch's haven't.\" Haymitch doesn't say so, but I'm ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,170,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,170,6,0","type":4,"elements":"sure this is why he doesn't like to sleep in the dark.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,171","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,171,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,171,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,172","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,172,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,172,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"No. But for me, it's better to wake up with a paintbrush than a knife in my hand,\" he says. \"So you really hate ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,172,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,172,1,0","type":4,"elements":"them?\"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,173","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,173,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,173,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,174","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,174,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,174,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Yes. But they're extraordinary. Really,\" I say. And they are. But I don't want to look at them anymore. \"Want to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,174,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,174,1,0","type":4,"elements":"see my talent? Cinna did a great job on it.\" Peeta laughs. \"Later.\" The train lurches forward, and I can see the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,174,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,174,2,0","type":4,"elements":"land moving past us through the window. \"Come on, we're almost to District Eleven. Let's go take a look at it.\"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,175","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,175,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,175,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,176","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,176,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,176,0,0","type":4,"elements":"We go down to the last car on the train. There are chairs and couches to sit on, but what's wonderful is that the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,176,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,176,1,0","type":4,"elements":"back windows retract into the ceiling so you're riding outside, in the fresh air, and you can see a wide sweep of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,176,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,176,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the landscape. Huge open fields with herds of dairy cattle grazing in them. So unlike our own heavily wooded ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,176,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,176,3,0","type":4,"elements":"home. We slow slightly and I think we might be coming in for another stop, when a fence rises up before us. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,176,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,176,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Towering at least thirty-five feet in the air and topped with wicked coils","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,177","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,177,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,177,0,0","type":4,"elements":"of barbed wire, it makes ours back in District 12 look childish. My eyes quickly inspect the base, which is lined ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,177,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,177,1,0","type":4,"elements":"with enormous metal plates. There would be no burrowing under those, no escaping to hunt. Then I see the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,177,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,177,2,0","type":4,"elements":"watchtowers, placed evenly apart, manned with armed guards, so out of place among the fields of wildflowers ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,177,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,177,3,0","type":4,"elements":"around them. \"That's something different,\" says Peeta. Rue did give me the impression that the rules in District ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,177,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,177,4,0","type":4,"elements":"11 were more harshly enforced. But I never imagined something like this. Now the crops begin, stretched out as ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,177,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,177,5,0","type":4,"elements":"far as the eye can see. Men, women, and children wearing straw hats to keep off the sun straighten up, turn our ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,177,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,177,6,0","type":4,"elements":"way, take a moment to stretch their backs as they watch our train go by. I can see orchards in the distance, and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,177,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,177,7,0","type":4,"elements":"I wonder if that's where Rue would have worked, collecting the fruit from the slimmest branches at the tops of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,177,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,177,8,0","type":4,"elements":"the trees. Small communities of","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,178","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,178,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,178,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,179","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,179,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,179,0,0","type":4,"elements":"shacks -- by comparison the houses in the Seam are upscale -- spring up here and there, but they're all ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,179,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,179,1,0","type":4,"elements":"deserted. Every hand must be needed for the harvest. On and on it goes. I can't believe the size of District 11. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,179,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,179,2,0","type":4,"elements":"\"How many people do you think live here?\" Peeta asks. I shake my head. In school they refer to it as a large ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,179,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,179,3,0","type":4,"elements":"district, that's all. No actual figures on the population. But those kids we see on camera waiting for the reaping ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,179,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,179,4,0","type":4,"elements":"each year, they can't be but a sampling of the ones who actually live here. What do they do? Have preliminary ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,179,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,179,5,0","type":4,"elements":"drawings? Pick the winners ahead of time and make sure they're in the crowd? How exactly did Rue end up on ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,179,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,179,6,0","type":4,"elements":"that stage with nothing but the wind offering to take her place? I begin to weary of the vastness, the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,179,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,179,7,0","type":4,"elements":"endlessness of this place. When Effie comes to tell us to dress, I don't object. I go to my compartment and let ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,179,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,179,8,0","type":4,"elements":"the prep team do my hair and makeup. Cinna comes in with a","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,180","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,180,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,180,0,0","type":4,"elements":"pretty orange frock patterned with autumn leaves. I think how much Peeta will like the color. Effie gets Peeta ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,180,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,180,1,0","type":4,"elements":"and me together and goes through the day's program one last time. In some districts the victors ride through ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,180,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,180,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the city while the residents cheer. But in 11 -- maybe because there's not much of a city to begin with, things ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,180,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,180,3,0","type":4,"elements":"being so spread out, or maybe because they don't want to waste so many people while the harvest is on -- the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,180,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,180,4,0","type":4,"elements":"public appearance is confined to the square. It takes place before their Justice Building, a huge marble ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,180,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,180,5,0","type":4,"elements":"structure. Once, it must have been a thing of","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14