":4,"elements":"victor had any special allies among the dead tributes, it is considered good form to add a few personal ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,184,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,184,4,0","type":4,"elements":"comments as well. I should say something about Rue, and Thresh, too, really, but every time I tried to write it at ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,184,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,184,5,0","type":4,"elements":"home, I ended up with a blank paper staring me in the face: It's hard for me to talk about them without getting ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,184,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,184,6,0","type":4,"elements":"emotional. Fortunately, Peeta has a little something worked up, and with some slight alterations, it can count for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,184,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,184,7,0","type":4,"elements":"both of us. At the end of the ceremony, we'll be presented with some sort of plaque, and then we can withdraw ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,184,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,184,8,0","type":4,"elements":"to the Justice Building, where a special dinner will","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,185","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,185,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,185,0,0","type":4,"elements":"be served. As the train is pulling into the District 11 station, Cinna puts the finishing touches on my outfit, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,185,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,185,1,0","type":4,"elements":"switching my orange hairband for one of metallic gold and securing the mockingjay pin I wore in the arena to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,185,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,185,2,0","type":4,"elements":"my dress. There's no welcoming, committee on the platform, just a squad of eight Peacekeepers who direct us ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,185,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,185,3,0","type":4,"elements":"into the back of an armored truck. Effie sniffs as the door clanks closed behind us. \"Really, you'd think we were ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,185,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,185,4,0","type":4,"elements":"all criminals,\" she says. Not all of us, Effie. Just me, I think. The truck lets us out at the back of the Justice ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,185,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,185,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Building. We're hurried inside. I can smell an excellent meal being prepared, but it doesn't block out the odors ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,185,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,185,6,0","type":4,"elements":"of mildew and rot. They've left us no time to look around. As. we make a beeline for the front entrance, I can ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,185,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,185,7,0","type":4,"elements":"hear the anthem beginning outside in the square. Someone clips a microphone on me. Peeta takes my left ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,185,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,185,8,0","type":4,"elements":"hand. The mayor's introducing us as the massive doors open with a","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,186","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,186,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,186,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,187","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,187,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,187,0,0","type":4,"elements":"groan. \"Big smiles!\" Effie says, and gives us a nudge. Our feet start moving forward. This is it. This is where I ","form