29d"}]},{"id":"0,192,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,192,6,0","type":4,"elements":"changed forever when Thresh and Rue were lost, but this gift will change them again. A month of tribute ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,192,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,192,7,0","type":4,"elements":"winnings can easily provide for a family for a year. As long as we live, they will not hunger. I look at Peeta and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,192,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,192,8,0","type":4,"elements":"he gives me a sad smile. I hear Haymitch's voice. \"You could do a lot","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,193","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,193,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,193,0,0","type":4,"elements":"worse.\" At this moment, it's impossible to imagine how I could do any better. The gift ... it is perfect. So when I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,193,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,193,1,0","type":4,"elements":"rise up on tiptoe to kiss him, it doesn't seem forced at all. The mayor steps forward and presents us each with a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,193,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,193,2,0","type":4,"elements":"plaque that's so large I have to put down my bouquet to hold it. The ceremony's about to end when I notice one ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,193,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,193,3,0","type":4,"elements":"of Rue's sisters staring at me. She must be about nine and is almost an exact replica of Rue, down to the way ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,193,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,193,4,0","type":4,"elements":"she stands with her arms slightly extended. Despite the good news about the winnings, she's not happy. In ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,193,5","type":3,"