I had pledged all my winnings to the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,197,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,197,2,0","type":4,"elements":"families, it would not excuse my silence today. \"Wait, please.\" I don't know how to start, but once I do, the words ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,197,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,197,3,0","type":4,"elements":"rush from my lips as if they've been forming in the back of my mind for a long time. \"I want to give my thanks to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,197,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,197,4,0","type":4,"elements":"the tributes of District Eleven,\" I say. I look at the pair of women on Thresh's side. \"I only ever spoke to Thresh ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,197,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,197,5,0","type":4,"elements":"one time. Just long enough for him to spare my life. I didn't know him, but I always respected him. For his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,197,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,197,6,0","type":4,"elements":"power. For his refusal to play the Games on anyone's terms but his own. The Careers wanted him to team up ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,197,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,197,7,0","type":4,"elements":"with them from the beginning, but he wouldn't do it. I respected","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,198","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,198,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,198,0,0","type":4,"elements":"him for that.\" For the first time the old hunched woman -- is she Thresh's grandmother? -- raises her head and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,198,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,198,1,0","type":4,"elements":"the trace of a smile plays on her lips. The crowd has fallen silent now, so silent that I wonder how they manage ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,198,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,198,2,0","type":4,"elements":"it. They must all be holding their breath. I turn to Rue's family. \"But I feel as if I did know Rue, and she'll always ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,198,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,198,3,0","type":4,"elements":"be with me. Everything beautiful brings her to mind. I see her in the yellow flowers that grow in the Meadow by ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,198,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,198,4,0","type":4,"elements":"my house. I see her in the mockingjays that sing in the trees. But most of all, I see her in my sister, Prim.\" My ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,198,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,198,5,0","type":4,"elements":"voice is undependable, but I am almost finished. \"Thank you for your children.\" I raise my chin to address the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,198,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,198,6,0","type":4,"elements":"crowd. \"And thank you all for the bread.\" I stand there, feeling broken and small, thousands of eyes trained on ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,198,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,198,7,0","type":4,"elements":"me. There's a long pause. Then, from somewhere in the crowd, someone whistles Rue's four- note ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,198,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,198,8,0","type":4,"elements":"mocking-jay tune. The one that signaled the end of the workday in the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,199","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,199,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,199,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,200","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,200,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,200,0,0","type":4,"elements":"orchards. The one that meant safety in the arena. By the end of the tune, I have found the whistler, a wizened ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,200,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,200,1,0","type":4,"elements":"old man in a faded red shirt and overalls. His eyes meet mine. What happens next is not an accident. It is too ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,200,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,200,2,0","type":4,"elements":"well executed to be spontaneous, because it happens in complete unison. Every person in the crowd presses ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,200,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,200,3,0","type":4,"elements":"the three middle fingers of their left hand against their lips and extends them to me. It's our sign from District 12, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,200,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,200,4,0","type":4,"elements":"the last good-bye I gave Rue in the arena. If I hadn't spoken to President Snow, this gesture might move me to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,200,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,200,5,0","type":4,"elements":"tears. But with his recent orders to calm the districts fresh in my ears, it fills me with dread. What will he think of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,200,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,200,6,0","type":4,"elements":"this very public salute to the girl who defied the Capitol? The full impact of what I've done hits me. It was not ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,200,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,200,7,0","type":4,"elements":"intentional--I only meant to express my thanks -- but I have elicited something dangerous. An act of dissent ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,200,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,200,8,0","type":4,"elements":"from the people of District 11. This is exactly the kind of thing I am","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,201","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,201,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,201,0,0","type":4,"elements":"supposed to be defusing! I try to think of something to say to undermine what has just happened, to negate it, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,201,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,201,1,0","type":4,"elements":"but I can hear the slight burst of static indicating my microphone has been cut off and","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,202","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,202,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,202,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,203","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,203,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,203,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the mayor has taken over. Peeta and I acknowledge a final round of applause. He leads me back toward the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,203,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,203,1,0","type":4,"elements":"doors, unaware that anything has gone wrong. I feel funny and have to stop for a moment. Little bits of bright ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,203,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,203,2,0","type":4,"elements":"sunshine dance before my eyes. \"Are you all right?\" Peeta asks. \"Just dizzy. The sun was so bright,\" I say. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,203,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,203,3,0","type":4,"elements":"see his bouquet. \"I forgot my flowers,\" I mumble. \"I'll get them,\" he says. \"I can,\" I answer. We would be safe ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,203,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,203,4,0","type":4,"elements":"inside the Justice B