s moving back toward the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,205,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,205,6,0","type":4,"elements":"crowd. Haymitch, Effie, Portia, and Cinna wait under a static-filled screen that's mounted on the wall, their faces ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,205,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,205,7,0","type":4,"elements":"tight with anxiety. \"What happened?\" Effie hurries over. \"We lost the feed just after Katniss's beautiful speech, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,205,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,205,8,0","type":4,"elements":"and then Haymitch said he thought he heard a gun fire, and I said it was","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,206","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,206,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,206,0,0","type":4,"elements":"ridiculous, but who knows? There are lunatics everywhere!\" \"Nothing happened, Effie. An old truck backfired,\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,206,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,206,1,0","type":4,"elements":"says Peeta evenly. Two more shots. The door doesn't muffle their sound much. Who was that? Thresh's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,206,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,206,2,0","type":4,"elements":"grandmother? One of Rue's little sisters?","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,207","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,207,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,207,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,208","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,208,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,208,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Both of you. With me,\" says Haymitch. Peeta and I follow him, leaving the others behind. The Peacekeepers ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":