t of all of Panem. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,226,16","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,226,16,0","type":4,"elements":"Haymitch had known about that and not told me.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,227","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,227,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,227,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,228","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,228,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,228,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"I think I broke a few things myself after that interview.\" \"Just an urn,\" he says. \"And your hands. There's no ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,228,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,228,1,0","type":4,"elements":"point to it anymore, though, is there? Not being straight with each other?\" I say. \"No point,\" says Peeta. We ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,228,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,228,2,0","type":4,"elements":"stand at the top of the stairs, giving Haymitch a fifteen-step lead as Effie directed. \"Was that really the only time ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,228,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,228,3,0","type":4,"elements":"you kissed Gale?\" I'm so startled I answer. \"Yes.\" With all that has happened today, has that question actually ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,228,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,228,4,0","type":4,"elements":"been preying on him? \"That's fifteen. Let's do it,\" he says. A light hits us, and I put on the most dazzling smile I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,228,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,228,5,0","type":4,"elements":"can. We descend the steps and are sucked into what becomes an indistinguishable round of dinners, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,228,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,228,6,0","type":4,"elements":"ceremonies, and train rides. Each day it's the same. Wake up. Get dressed. Ride through cheering crowds. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,228,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,228,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Listen to a speech in our honor. Give a thank-you speech in return, but only the one the Capitol gave us, never ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,228,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,228,8,0","type":4,"elements":"any personal additions now. Sometimes a brief tour: a","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,229","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,229,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,229,0,0","type":4,"elements":"glimpse of the sea in one district, towering forests in another, ugly factories, fields of wheat, stinking refineries. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,229,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,229,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Dress in evening clothes. Attend dinner. Train. During ceremonies, we are solemn and respectful but always ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,229,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,229,2,0","type":4,"elements":"linked together, by our hands, our arms. At dinners, we are borderline delirious in our love for each other. We ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,229,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,229,3,0","type":4,"elements":"kiss, we dance, we get caught trying to sneak away to be alone. On the train, we are quietly miserable as we ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,229,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,229,4,0","type":4,"elements":"try to assess what effect we might be having. Even without our personal speeches to trigger dissent-- needless ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,229,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,229,5,0","type":4,"elements":"to say the ones we gave in District 11 were edited out before the event was broadcast--you can feel something ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,229,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,229,6,0","type":4,"elements":"in the air, the rolling boil of a pot about to run over. Not everywhere. Some crowds have the weary-cattle feel ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,229,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,229,7,0","type":4,"elements":"that I know District 12 usually projects at the victors' ceremonies. But in others -- particularly 8, 4, and 3 -- there ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,229,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,229,8,0","type":4,"elements":"is genuine elation in the faces","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,230","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,230,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,230,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,231","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,231,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,231,0,0","type":4,"elements":"of the people at the sight of us, and under the elation, fury. When they chant my name, it is more of a cry for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,231,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,231,1,0","type":4,"elements":"vengeance than a cheer. When","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,232","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,232,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,232,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,233","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,233,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,233,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the Peacekeepers move in to quiet an unruly crowd, it presses back instead of retreating. And I know that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,233,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,233,1,0","type":4,"elements":"there's nothing I could ever do to change this. No show of love, however believable, will turn this tide. If my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,233,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,233,2,0","type":4,"elements":"holding out those berries was an act of temporary insanity, then these people will embrace insanity, too. Cinna ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,233,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,233,3,0","type":4,"elements":"begins to take in my clothes around the waist. The prep team frets over the circles under my eyes. Effie starts ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,233,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,233,4,0","type":4,"elements":"giving me pills to sleep, but they don't work. Not well enough. I drift off only to be roused by nightmares that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,233,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,233,5,0","type":4,"elements":"have increased in number and intensity. Peeta, who spends much of the night roaming the train, hears me ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,233,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,233,6,0","type":4,"elements":"screaming as I struggle to break out of the haze of drugs that merely prolong the horrible dreams. He manages ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,233,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,233,7,0","type":4,"elements":"to wake me and calm me down. Then he climbs into bed to hold me until I fall back to sleep. After that, I refuse ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,233,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,233,8,0","type":4,"elements":"the pills. But every night I let him into my bed. We manage the darkness as we did in the arena, wrapped in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,233,9","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,233,9,0","type":4,"ele