 desperate. We ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,235,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,235,2,0","type":4,"elements":"make endless appearances to adoring crowds. There is no danger of an uprising here among the privileged, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,235,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,235,3,0","type":4,"elements":"among those whose names are never placed in the reaping balls, whose children never die for the supposed ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,235,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,235,4,0","type":4,"elements":"crimes committed generations ago. We don't need to convince anybody in the Capitol of our love but hold to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,235,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,235,5,0","type":4,"elements":"the slim hope that we can still reach some of those we failed to convince in the districts. Whatever we do ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,235,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,235,6,0","type":4,"elements":"seems too little, too late. Back in our old quarters in the Training Center, I'm the one who suggests the public ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,235,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,235,7,0","type":4,"elements":"marriage proposal. Peeta agrees to do it but then disappears to his room for a long time. Haymitch tells me to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,235,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,235,8,0","type":4,"elements":"leave him alone. \"I thought he wanted it, anyway,\" I say. \"Not","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,236","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,236,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,236,0,0","type":4,"elements":"like this,\" Haymitch says. \"He wanted it to be real.\" I go back to my room and lie under the covers, trying not to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,236,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,236,1,0","type":4,"elements":"think of Gale and thinking of nothing else. That night, on the stage before the Training Center, we bubble our ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,236,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,236,2,0","type":4,"elements":"way through a list of questions. Caesar Flickerman, in his twinkling midnight blue suit, his hair, eyelids, and lips ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,236,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,236,3,0","type":4,"elements":"still dyed powder blue, flawlessly guides us through the interview. When he asks us about the future, Peeta ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,236,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,236,4,0","type":4,"elements":"gets down on one knee, pours out his heart, and begs me to marry him. I, of course, accept. Caesar is beside ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,236,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,236,5,0","type":4,"elements":"himself, the Capitol audience is hysterical, shots of crowds around Panem show a country besotted with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,236,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,236,6,0","type":4,"elements":"happiness. President Snow himself makes a surprise visit to congratulate us. He clasps Peeta's hand and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,236,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,236,7,0","type":4,"elements":"gives him an approving slap on the shoulder. He embraces me, enfolding me in the smell of blood and roses, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,236,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,236,8,0","type":4,"elements":"and plants a puffy kiss on my cheek. When he pulls back, his fingers","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,237","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,237,0","type":3,"element