is game. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,240,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,240,5,0","type":4,"elements":"That the question of whether I can succeed in this venture has been answered, even if that answer is a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,240,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,240,6,0","type":4,"elements":"resounding no. That if desperate times call for","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,241","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,241,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,241,0,0","type":4,"elements":"desperate measures, then I am free to act as desperately as I wish. Only not here, not quite yet. It's essential to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,241,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,241,1,0","type":4,"elements":"get back to District 12, because the main part of any plan will include my mother and sister, Gale and his family. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,241,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,241,2,0","type":4,"elements":"And Peeta, if I can get him to come with us. I add Haymitch to the list. These are the people I must take with me ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,241,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,241,3,0","type":4,"elements":"when I escape into the wild. How I will convince them, where we will go in the dead of winter, what it will take to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,241,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,241,4,0","type":4,"elements":"evade capture are unanswered questions. But at least now I know what I must do. So instead of crumpling to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,241,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,241,5,0","type":4,"elements":"the ground and weeping, I find myself standing up straighter and with more confidence than I have in weeks. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,241,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,241,6,0","type":4,"elements":"My smile, while somewhat insane, is not forced. And when President Snow silences the audience and says, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,241,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,241,7,0","type":4,"elements":"\"What do you think about us throwing them a wedding right here in the Capitol?\" I pull off ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,241,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,241,8,0","type":4,"elements":"girl-almost-catatonic-with-joy without a hitch. Caesar","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,242","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,242,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,242,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,243","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,243,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,243,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Flickerman asks if the president has a date in mind. \"Oh, before we set a date, we better clear it with Katniss's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,243,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,243,1,0","type":4,"elements":"mother,\" says the president. The audience gives a big laugh and the president puts his arm around me. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,243,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,243,2,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Maybe if the whole country puts its mind to it, we can get you married before you're thirty.\" \"You'll probably ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,243,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,243,3,0","type":4,"elements":"have to pass a new law,\" I say with a giggle. \"If that's what it takes,\" says the president with conspiratorial good ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,243,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,243,4,0","type":4,"elements":"humor. Oh, the fun we two have together. The party, held in the banquet room of President Snow's mansion, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,243,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,243,5,0","type":4,"elements":"has no equal. The forty-foot ceiling has been transformed into the night sky, and the stars look exactly as they ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,243,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,243,6,0","type":4,"elements":"do at home. I suppose they look the same from the Capitol, but who would know? There's always too much ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,243,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,243,7,0","type":4,"elements":"light from the city to see the stars here. About halfway between the floor and the ceiling, musicians float on what ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,243,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,243,8,0","type":4,"elements":"look like fluffy white clouds, but I can't see what holds","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,244","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,244,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,244,0,0","type":4,"elements":"them aloft. Traditional dining tables have been replaced by innumerable stuffed sofas and chairs, some ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,244,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,244,1,0","type":4,"elements":"surrounding fireplaces, others beside fragrant flower gardens or ponds filled with exotic fish, so that people can ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,244,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,244,2,0","type":4,"elements":"eat and drink and do whatever they please in the utmost comfort. There's a large tiled area in the center of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,244,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,244,3,0","type":4,"elements":"room that serves as everything from a dance floor, to a stage","format_id":"93e3f29