ames. My appetite has returned with my' desire to fight back. After weeks of feeling too worried to eat, I'm ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,248,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,248,2,0","type":4,"elements":"famished. \"I want to taste everything in the room,\" I tell Peeta. I can see him trying to read my expression, to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,248,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,248,3,0","type":4,"elements":"figure out my transformation. Since he doesn't know that President Snow thinks I have failed, he can only ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,248,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,248,4,0","type":4,"elements":"assume that I think we have succeeded. Perhaps even that I have some genuine happiness at our ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,248,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,248,5,0","type":4,"elements":"engagement. His eyes reflect his puzzlement but only briefly, because we're on camera. \"Then you'd better ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,248,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,248,6,0","type":4,"elements":"pace yourself,\" he says. \"Okay, no more than one bite of each dish,\" I say. My resolve is almost immediately ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,248,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,248,7,0","type":4,"elements":"broken at the first table, which has twenty or so soups, when I encounter a creamy pumpkin brew sprinkled with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,248,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,248,8,0","type":4,"elements":"slivered nuts and tiny black seeds. \"I could just eat this all night!\" I","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,249","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,249,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,249,0,0","type":4,"elements":"exclaim. But I don't. I weaken again at a clear green broth that I can only describe as tasting like springtime, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,249,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,249,1,0","type":4,"elements":"and again when I try a frothy pink soup dotted with raspberries. Faces appear, names are exchanged, pictures ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,249,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,249,2,0","type":4,"elements":"taken, kisses brushed on cheeks. Apparently my mockingjay pin has spawned a new fashion sensation, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,249,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,249,3,0","type":4,"elements":"because several people come up to show me their accessories. My bird has been replicated on belt buckles, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,249,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,249,4,0","type":4,"elements":"embroidered into silk lapels, even tattooed in intimate places. Everyone wants to wear the winner's token. I can ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,249,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,249,5,0","type":4,"elements":"only imagine how nuts that makes President Snow. But what can he do? The Games were such a hit here, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,249,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,249,6,0","type":4,"elements":"where the berries were only a symbol of a desperate girl trying to save her lover. Peeta and I make no effort to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,249,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,249,7,0","type":4,"elements":"find company but are constantly sought out. We are what no one wants to miss at the party. I act delighted, but I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,249,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,249,8,0","type":4,"elements":"have zero interest in these Capitol people. They are only","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"