ies ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,256,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,256,4,0","type":4,"elements":"of the children on our kitchen table as my mother prescribes what the parents can't give. More food. Now that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,256,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,256,5,0","type":4,"elements":"we're rich, she'll send some home with them. But often in the old days, there was nothing to give and the child ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,256,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,256,6,0","type":4,"elements":"was past saving, anyway. And here in the Capitol they're vomiting for the pleasure of filling their bellies again ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,256,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,256,7,0","type":4,"elements":"and again. Not from some illness of body or mind, not from spoiled food. It's what everyone does at a party. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,256,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,256,8,0","type":4,"elements":"Expected. Part of the fun. One day when I dropped by","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,257","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,257,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,257,0,0","type":4,"elements":"to give Hazelle the game, Vick was home sick with a bad cough. Being part of Gale's family, the kid has to eat ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,257,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,257,1,0","type":4,"elements":"better than ninety percent of the rest of District 12. But he still spent about fifteen minutes talking about how ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,257,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,257,2,0","type":4,"elements":"they'd opened a can of corn syrup from Parcel Day and each had a spoonful on bread and were going to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,257,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,257,3,0","type":4,"elements":"maybe have more later in the week. How Hazelle had said he could have a bit in a cup of tea to soothe his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,257,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,257,4,0","type":4,"elements":"cough, but he wouldn't feel right unless the others had some, too. If it's like that at Gale's, what's it like in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,257,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,257,5,0","type":4,"elements":"other houses? \"Peeta, they bring us here to fight to the death for their entertainment,\" I say. \"Really, this is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,257,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,257,6,0","type":4,"elements":"nothing by comparison.\" \"I know. I know that. It's just sometimes I can't stand it anymore. To the point where ... ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,257,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,257,7,0","type":4,"elements":"I'm","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,258","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,258,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,258,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,259","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,259,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,259,0,0","type":4,"elements":"not sure what I'll do.\" He pauses, then whispers, \"Maybe we were wrong, Katniss.\" \"About what?\" I ask. \"About","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,260","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,260,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,260,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,261","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,261,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,261,0,0","type":4,"elements":"trying to subdue things in the districts,\" he says. My head turns swiftly from side to side, but no one seems to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,261,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,261,1,0","type":4,"elements":"have heard. The camera crew got sidetracked at a table of shellfish, and the couples dancing around us are ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,261,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,261,2,0","type":4,"elements":"either too drunk or too self-involved to notice. \"Sorry,\" he says. He should be. This is no place to be voicing ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,261,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,261,3,0","type":4,"elements":"such thoughts. \"Save it for home,\" I tell him.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,262","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,262,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,262,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,263","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,263,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,263,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Just then Portia appears with a large man who looks vaguely familiar. She introduces him as Plutarch ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,263,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,263,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Heavensbee, the new Head Gamemaker. Plutarch asks Peeta if he can steal me for a dance. Peeta's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,263,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,263,2,0","type":4,"elements":"recovered his camera face and good-naturedly passes me over, warning the man not to get too attached. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,263,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,263,3,0","type":4,"elements":"don't want to dance with Plutarch Heavensbee. I don't want to feel his hands, one resting against mine, one on ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":