o point out that twenty-two dead tributes will never recover from the Games he helped create, either. But I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,264,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,264,8,0","type":4,"elements":"only say, \"Good. So, you're the Head Gamemaker this","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,265","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,265,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,265,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,266","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,266,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,266,0,0","type":4,"elements":"year? That must be a big honor.\" \"Between you and me, there weren't many takers for the job,\" he says. \"So ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,266,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,266,1,0","type":4,"elements":"much responsibility as to how the Games turn out.\" Yeah, the last guy's dead, I think. He must know about ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,266,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,266,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Seneca Crane, but he doesn't look the least bit concerned. \"Are you planning the Quarter Quell Games ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,266,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,266,3,0","type":4,"elements":"already?\" I say. \"Oh, yes. Well, they've been in the works for years, of course. Arenas aren't built in a day. But ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,266,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,266,4,0","type":4,"elements":"the, shall we say, flavor of the Games is being determined now. Believe it or not, I've got a strategy meeting ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,266,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,266,5,0","type":4,"elements":"tonight,\" he says. Plutarch steps back and pulls out a gold watch on a chain from a vest pocket. He flips open ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,266,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,266,6,0","type":4,"elements":"the lid, sees the time, and frowns. \"I'll have to be going soon.\" He turns the watch so I can see the face. \"It ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,266,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,266,7,0","type":4,"elements":"starts at midnight.\" \"That seems late for--\" I say, but then something distracts me. Plutarch has run his thumb ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,266,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,266,8,0","type":4,"elements":"across the crystal face of the watch and for just a moment an image appears, glowing as if","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,267","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,267,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,267,0,0","type":4,"elements":"lit by candlelight. It's another mockingjay. Exactly like the pin on my dress. Only this one disappears. He snaps ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,267,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,267,1,0","type":4,"elements":"the watch closed. \"That's very pretty,\" I say. \"Oh, it's more than pretty. It's one of a kind,\" he says. \"If anyone ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,267,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,267,2,0","type":4,"elements":"asks about me, say I've gone home to bed. The meetings are supposed to be kept secret. But I thought it'd be ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,267,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,267,3,0","type":4,"elements":"safe to tell you.\" \"Yes. Your secret's safe with me,\" I say. As we shake hands, he gives a small bow, a common ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,267,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,267,4,0","type":4,"elements":"gesture here in the Capitol. \"Well, I'll see you next summer at the Games, Katniss. Best wishes on your ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,267,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,267,5,0","type":4,"elements":"engagement, and good luck with your mother.\" \"I'll","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,268","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,268,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,268,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,269","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,269,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,269,0,0","type":4,"elements":"need it,\" I say. Plutarch disappears and I wander through the crowd, looking for Peeta, as strangers ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,269,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,269,1,0","type":4,"elements":"congratulate me. On my engagement, on my victory at the Games, on my choice of lipstick. I respond, but ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,269,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,269,2,0","type":4,"elements":"really I'm thinking about Plutarch showing off his pretty, one-of-a-kind","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,270","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,270,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,270,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,271","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,271,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,271,0,0","type":4,"elements":"watch to me. There was something strange about it. Almost clandestine. But why? Maybe he thinks someone ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,271,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,271,1,0","type":4,"elements":"else will steal his idea of putting a disappearing mockingjay on a watch face. Yes, he probably paid a fortune for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,271,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,271,2,0","type":4,"elements":"it and now he can't show it to anyone because he's afraid someone will make a cheap, knockoff version. Only ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,271,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,271,3,0","type":4,"elements":"in the Capitol. I find Peeta admiring a table of elaborately decorated cakes. Bakers have come in from the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,271,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,271,4,0","type":4,"elements":"kitchen especially to talk frosting with him, and you can see them tripping over one another to answer his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,271,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,271,5,0","type":4,"elements":"questions. At his request, they assemble an assortment of little cakes for him to take back to District 12, where ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,271,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,271,6,0","type":4,"elements":"he can examine their work in quiet. \"Effie said we have to be on the train at one. I wonder what time it is,\" he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,271,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,271,7,0","type":4,"elements":"says, glancing around. \"Almost midnight,\" I reply. I pluck a chocolate flower from a cake with my fingers and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,271,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,271,8,0","type":4,"elements":"nibble on it, so beyond worrying about manners. \"Time to","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,272","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,272,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,272,0,0","type":4,"elements":"say thank you and farewell!\" trills Effie at my elbow. It's one of those moments when I just love her compulsive ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,272,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,272,1,0","type":4,"elements":"punctuality. We collect Cinna and Portia, and she escorts us around to say good-bye to important people, then ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,272,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,272,2,0","type":4,"elements":"herds us to the door. \"Shouldn't we thank President Snow?\" asks Peeta. \"It's his house.\" \"Oh, he's not a big ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,272,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,272,3,0","type":4,"elements":"one for parties. Too busy,\" says Effie. \"I've already arranged for the necessary notes and gifts to be sent to him ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,272,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,272,4,0","type":4,"elements":"tomorrow. There you are!\" Effie gives a little wave to two Capitol attendants who have an inebriated Haymitch ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,272,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,272,5,0","type":4,"elements":"propped up between them. We travel through the streets of the Capitol in a car with darkened windows. Behind ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,272,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,272,6,0","type":4,"elements":"us, another car brings the prep teams. The throngs of people celebrating are so thick it's slow going. But Effie ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,272,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,272,7,0","type":4,"elements":"has this all down to a science, and at exactly one o'clock we are back on the train and it's pulling out of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,272,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,272,8,0","type":4,"elements":"station. Haymitch is deposited in his room. Cinna orders tea and we all take seats","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,273","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,273,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,273,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,274","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,274,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,274,0,0","type":4,"elements":"around the table while Effie rattles her schedule papers and reminds us we're still on tour. \"There's the Harvest ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,274,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,274,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Festival in District Twelve to think about. So I suggest we drink our tea and head straight to bed.\" No one ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,274,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,274,2,0","type":4,"elements":"argues. When I open my eyes, it's early afternoon. My head rests on Peeta's arm. I don't remember him coming ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,274,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,274,3,0","type":4,"elements":"in last night. I turn, being careful not to disturb him, but he's already awake. \"No nightmares,\" he says. \"What?\" I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,274,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,274,4,0","type":4,"elements":"ask. \"You didn't have any nightmares last night,\" he says. He's right. For the first time in ages I've slept through ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,274,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,274,5,0","type":4,"elements":"the night. \"I had a dream, though,\" I say, thinking back. \"I was following a mockingjay through the woods. For a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,274,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,274,6,0","type":4,"elements":"long time. It was Rue, really. I mean, when it sang, it had her voice.\" \"Where did she","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,275","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,275,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,275,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,276","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,276,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,276,0,0","type":4,"elements":"take you?\" he says, brushing my hair off my forehead. \"I don't know. We never arrived,\" I say. \"But I felt happy.\"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,277","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,277,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,277,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Well, you slept like you were happy,\" he says. \"Peeta, how come I never know when you're having a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,277,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,277,1,0","type":4,"elements":"nightmare?\" I say. \"I don't know. I don't think I cry out or thrash around or anything. I just come to, paralyzed ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,277,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,277,2,0","type":4,"elements":"with terror,\" he says. \"You should wake me,\" I say, thinking about how I can interrupt his sleep two or three ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,277,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,277,3,0","type":4,"elements":"times on a bad night. About how long it can take to calm me down. \"It's not necessary. My nightmares are ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,277,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,277,4,0","type":4,"elements":"usually about losing you,\" he says. \"I'm okay once I realize you're here.\" Ugh. Peeta makes comments like this ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,277,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,277,5,0","type":4,"elements":"in such an offhand way, and it's like being hit in the gut. He's only answering my question honestly. He's not ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,277,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,277,6,0","type":4,"elements":"pressing me to reply in kind, to make any declaration of love. But I still feel awful, as if I've been using him in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,277,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,277,7,0","type":4,"elements":"some terrible way. Have I? I don't know. I only know that for the first time, I feel immoral about him being here in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,277,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,277,8,0","type":4,"elements":"my bed. Which is ironic since we're officially engaged now.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,278","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,278,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,278,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,279","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,279,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,279,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Be worse when we're home and I'm sleeping alone again,\" he says. That's right, we're almost home. The ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,279,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,279,1,0","type":4,"elements":"agenda for District 12 includes a dinner at Mayor Undersee's house tonight and a victory rally in the square ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,279,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,279,2,0","type":4,"elements":"during the Harvest Festival tomorrow. We always celebrate the Harvest Festival on the final day of the Victory ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,279,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,279,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Tour, but usually it means a meal at home or with a few friends if you can afford it. This year it will be a public ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,279,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,279,4,0","type":4,"elements":"affair, and since the Capitol will be throwing it, everyone in the whole district will have full bellies. Most of our ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,279,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,279,5,0","type":4,"elements":"prepping will take place at the mayor's house, since we're back to being covered in furs for outdoor ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,279,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,279,6,0","type":4,"elements":"appearances. We're only at the train station briefly, to smile and wave as we pile into our car. We don't even get ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,279,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,279,7,0","type":4,"elements":"to see our families until the dinner tonight. I'm glad it will be at the mayor's house instead of at the Justice ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,279,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,279,8,0","type":4,"elements":"Building, where the memorial for my father was held, where they took me after","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,280","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,280,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,280,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the reaping for those wrenching goodbyes to my family. The Justice Building is too full of sadness. But I like ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,280,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,280,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Mayor Undersee's house, especially now that his daughter, Madge, and I are friends. We always were, in a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,280,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,280,2,0","type":4,"elements":"way. It became official when she came to say good-bye to me before I left for the Games. When she gave me ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,280,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,280,3,0","type":4,"elements":"the mockingjay pin for luck. After I got home, we started spending time together. It turns out Madge has plenty of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,280,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,280,4,0","type":4,"elements":"empty hours to fill, too. It was a little awkward at first because we didn't know what to do. Other girls our age, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,280,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,280,5,0","type":4,"elements":"I've heard them talking about boys, or other girls, or clothes. Madge and I aren't gossipy and clothes bore me to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,280,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,280,6,0","type":4,"elements":"tears. But after a few false starts, I realized she was dying to go into the woods, so I've taken her a couple of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,280,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,280,7,0","type":4,"elements":"times and showed her how to shoot. She's trying to teach me the piano, but mostly I like to listen to her play. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,280,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,280,8,0","type":4,"elements":"Sometimes we eat at each other's houses. Madge","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,281","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,281,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,281,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,282","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,282,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,282,0,0","type":4,"elements":"likes mine better. Her parents seem nice but I don't think she sees a whole lot of them. Her father has District 12 ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,282,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,282,1,0","type":4,"elements":"to run and her mother gets fierce headaches that force her to stay in bed for days. \"Maybe you should take her ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,282,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,282,2,0","type":4,"elements":"to the Capitol,\" I said during one of them. We weren't playing the piano that day, because even two floors away ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,282,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,282,3,0","type":4,"elements":"the sound caused her mother pain. \"They can fix her up, I bet.\" \"Yes. But you don't go to the Capitol unless ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,282,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,282,4,0","type":4,"elements":"they invite you,\" said Madge unhappily. Even the mayor's privileges are limited. When we reach the mayor's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,282,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,282,5,0","type":4,"elements":"house, I only have time to give Madge a quick hug before Effie hustles me off to the third floor to get ready. After ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,282,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,282,6,0","type":4,"elements":"I'm prepped and dressed in a full-length silver gown, I've still got an hour to kill before the dinner, so I slip off to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,282,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,282,7,0","type":4,"elements":"find her. Madge's bedroom is on the second floor along with several guest rooms and her father's study. I stick ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,282,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,282,8,0","type":4,"elements":"my head in the study to say hello to the mayor","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,283","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,283,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,283,0,0","type":4,"elements":"but it's empty. The television's droning on, and I stop to watch shots of Peeta and me at the Capitol party last ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,283,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,283,1,0","type":4,"elements":"night. Dancing, eating, kissing. This will be playing in every household in Panem right now. The audience must ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,283,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,283,2,0","type":4,"elements":"be sick to death of the star-crossed lovers from District 12. I know I am. I'm leaving the room when a beeping ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,283,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,283,3,0","type":4,"elements":"noise catches my attention. I turn back to see the screen of the television go black. Then the words \"UPDATE ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,283,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,283,4,0","type":4,"elements":"ON DISTRICT 8\" start flashing. Instinctively I know this is not for my eyes but something intended only for the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,283,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,283,5,0","type":4,"elements":"mayor. I should go. Quickly. Instead I find myself stepping closer to the television. An announcer I've never ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,283,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,283,6,0","type":4,"elements":"seen before appears. It's a woman with graying hair and a hoarse, authoritative voice. She warns that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,283,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,283,7,0","type":4,"elements":"conditions are worsening and a Level 3 alert has been called. Additional forces are being sent into District 8, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,283,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,283,8,0","type":4,"elements":"and all textile production has ceased. They cut away from","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,284","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,284,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,284,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,285","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,285,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,285,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the woman to the main square in District 8. I recognize it because I was there only last week. There are still ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,285,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,285,1,0","type":4,"elements":"banners with my face waving from the rooftops. Below them, there's a mob scene. The square's packed with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,285,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,285,2,0","type":4,"elements":"screaming people, their faces hidden with rags and homemade masks, throwing bricks. Buildings burn. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,285,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,285,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Peacekeepers shoot into the crowd, killing at random. I've never seen anything like it, but I can only be ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,285,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,285,4,0","type":4,"elements":"witnessing one thing. This is what President Snow calls an uprising. A leather bag filled with food and a flask of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,285,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,285,5,0","type":4,"elements":"hot tea. A pair of fur-lined gloves that Cinna left behind. Three twigs, broken from the naked trees, lying in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,285,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,285,6,0","type":4,"elements":"snow, pointing in the direction I will travel. This is what I leave for Gale at our usual meeting place on the first ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,285,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,285,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Sunday after the Harvest Festival. I have continued on through the cold, misty woods, breaking a path that will ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,285,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,285,8,0","type":4,"elements":"be unfamiliar to Gale but is simple for my feet to find. It leads to the lake. I no","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,286","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,286,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,286,0,0","type":4,"elements":"longer trust that our regular rendezvous spot offers privacy, and I'll need that and more to spill my guts to Gale","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,287","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,287,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,287,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,288","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,288,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,288,0,0","type":4,"elements":"today. But will he even come? If he doesn't, I'll have no choice but to risk going to his house in the dead of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,288,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,288,1,0","type":4,"elements":"night. There are things he has to know... things I need him to help me figure out... Once the implications of what ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,288,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,288,2,0","type":4,"elements":"I was seeing on Mayor Undersee's television hit me, I made for the door and started down the hall. Just in time, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,288,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,288,3,0","type":4,"elements":"too, because the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,289","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,289,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,289,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,290","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,290,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,290,0,0","type":4,"elements":"mayor came up the steps moments later. I gave him a wave. \"Looking for Madge?\" he said in a friendly tone. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,290,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,290,1,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Yes. I want to show her my dress,\" I said. \"Well, you know where to find her.\" Just then, another round of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,290,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,290,2,0","type":4,"elements":"beeping came from his study. His face turned grave. \"Excuse me,\" he said. He went into his study and closed ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,290,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,290,3,0","type":4,"elements":"the door tightly. I waited in the hall","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,291","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,291,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,291,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,292","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,292,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,292,0,0","type":4,"elements":"until I had composed myself. Reminded myself I must act naturally. Then I found Madge in her room, sitting at ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,292,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,292,1,0","type":4,"elements":"her dressing table, brushing out her wavy blond hair before a mirror. She was in the same pretty white dress ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,292,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,292,2,0","type":4,"elements":"she'd worn on reaping day. She saw my reflection behind her and smiled. \"Look at you. Like you came right off ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,292,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,292,3,0","type":4,"elements":"the streets of the Capitol.\" I stepped in closer. My fingers touched the mockingjay. \"Even my pin now. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,292,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,292,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Mockingjays are all the rage in the Capitol, thanks to you. Are you sure you don't want it back?\" I asked. \"Don't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,292,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,292,5,0","type":4,"elements":"be silly, it was a gift,\" said Madge. She tied back her hair in a festive gold ribbon. \"Where did you get it, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,292,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,292,6,0","type":4,"elements":"anyway?\" I asked. \"It was my aunt's,\" she said. \"But I think it's been in the family a long time.\" \"It's a funny ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,292,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,292,7,0","type":4,"elements":"choice, a mockingjay,\" I said. \"I mean, because of what happened in the rebellion. With the jabber-jays ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,292,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,292,8,0","type":4,"elements":"backfiring on the Capitol and all.\" The jabberjays were muttations, genetically","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,293","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,293,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,293,0,0","type":4,"elements":"enhanced male birds created by the Capitol as weapons to spy on rebels in the districts. They could remember ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,293,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,293,1,0","type":4,"elements":"and repeat long passages of human speech, so they were sent into rebel areas to capture our words and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,293,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,293,2,0","type":4,"elements":"return them to the Capitol. The rebels caught on and turned them against the Capitol by sending them home ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,293,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,293,3,0","type":4,"elements":"loaded with lies. When this was discovered, the jabberjays were left to die. In a few years, they became extinct ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,293,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,293,4,0","type":4,"elements":"in the wild, but not before they had mated with female mockingbirds, creating an entirely new species. \"But ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,293,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,293,5,0","type":4,"elements":"mockingjays were never a weapon,\" said Madge. \"They're just songbirds. Right?\" \"Yeah, I guess so,\" I said. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,293,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,293,6,0","type":4,"elements":"But it's not true. A mockingbird is just a songbird. A mockingjay is a creature the Capitol never intended to exist. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,293,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,293,7,0","type":4,"elements":"They hadn't counted on the highly controlled jabberjay having the brains to adapt to the wild, to pass on its ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,293,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,293,8,0","type":4,"elements":"genetic code, to thrive in a new form. They","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,294","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,294,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,294,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,295","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,295,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,295,0,0","type":4,"elements":"hadn't anticipated its will to live. Now, as I trudge through the snow, I see the mockingjays hopping about on ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,295,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,295,1,0","type":4,"elements":"branches as they pick up on other birds' melodies, replicate them, and then transform them into something ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,295,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,295,2,0","type":4,"elements":"new. As always, they remind me of Rue. I think of the dream I had the last night on the train, where I followed ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,295,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,295,3,0","type":4,"elements":"her in mockingjay form. I wish I could have stayed asleep just a bit longer and found out where she was trying ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,295,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,295,4,0","type":4,"elements":"to take me. It's a hike to the lake, no question. If he decides to follow me at all, Gale's going to be put out by this ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,295,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,295,5,0","type":4,"elements":"excessive use of energy that could be better spent in hunting. He was conspicuously absent from the dinner at ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,295,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,295,6,0","type":4,"elements":"the mayor's house, although the rest of his family came.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,296","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,296,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,296,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,297","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,297,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,297,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Hazelle said he was home sick, which was an obvious lie. I couldn't find him at the Harvest Festival, either. Vick","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,298","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,298,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,298,0,0","type":4,"elements":"told me he was out hunting. That was probably true. After a couple of hours, I reach an old house near the edge ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,298,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,298,1,0","type":4,"elements":"of the lake. Maybe \"house\" is too big a word for it. It's only one room, about twelve feet square. My father ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,298,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,298,2,0","type":4,"elements":"thought that a long time ago there were a lot of buildings -- you can still see some of the foundations -- and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,298,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,298,3,0","type":4,"elements":"people came to them to play and fish in the lake. This house outlasted the others because it's made of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,298,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,298,4,0","type":4,"elements":"concrete. Floor, roof, ceiling. Only one of four glass windows remains, wavy and yellowed by time. There's no ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,298,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,298,5,0","type":4,"elements":"plumbing and no electricity, but the fireplace still works and there's a woodpile in the corner that my father and I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,298,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,298,6,0","type":4,"elements":"collected years ago. I start a small fire, counting on the mist to obscure any telltale smoke. While the fire ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,298,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,298,7,0","type":4,"elements":"catches, I sweep out the snow that has accumulated under the empty windows, using a twig broom my father ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,298,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,298,8,0","type":4,"elements":"made me when I was about eight and I played house here. Then I sit on the tiny","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,299","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,299,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,299,0,0","