 say. Gale raises his eyebrows ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,300,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,300,8,0","type":4,"elements":"slightly, but there's no real show of fear or astonishment. \"Anyone","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,301","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,301,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,301,0,0","type":4,"elements":"else?\" \"Well, he didn't actually give me a copy of the list. But it's a good guess it includes both our families,\" I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,301,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,301,1,0","type":4,"elements":"say. It's enough to bring him to the fire. He crouches before the hearth and warms himself. \"Unless what?\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,301,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,301,2,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Unless nothing, now,\" I say. Obviously this requires more of an explanation, but I have no idea where to start, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,301,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,301,3,0","type":4,"elements":"so I just sit there staring gloomily into the fire. After about a minute of this, Gale breaks the silence. \"Well, thanks ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,301,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,301,4,0","type":4,"elements":"for the heads-up.\" I turn to him, ready to snap, but I catch the glint in his eye. I hate myself for smiling. This is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,301,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,301,5,0","type":4,"elements":"not a funny moment, but I guess it's a lot to drop on someone. We're all going to be obliterated no matter what. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,301,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,301,6,0","type":4,"elements":"\"I do have a plan, you know.\" \"Yeah, I bet it's a stunner,\" he says. He tosses the gloves on my lap. \"Here. I don't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,301,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,301,7,0","type":4,"elements":"want your fianc 's old gloves.\" \"He's not my fianc . That's just part of the act. And these aren't his gloves. They ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,301,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,301,8,0","type":4,"elements":"were Cinna's,\"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,302","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,302,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,302,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,303","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,303,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,303,0,0","type":4,"elements":"I say. \"Give them back, then,\" he says. He pulls on the gloves, flexes his fingers, and nods in approval. \"At least ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,303,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,303,1,0","type":4,"elements":"I'll die in comfort.\" \"That's optimistic. Of course, you don't know what's happened,\" I say. \"Let's have it,\" he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,303,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,303,2,0","type":4,"elements":"says. I decide to begin with the night Peeta and I were crowned victors of the Hunger Games, and Haymitch ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,303,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,303,3,0","type":4,"elements":"warned me of the Capitol's fury. I tell him about the uneasiness that dogged me even once I was back home, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,303,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,303,4,0","type":4,"elements":"President Snow's visit to my house, the murders in District 11, the tension in the crowds, the last-ditch effort of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,303,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,303,5,0","type":4,"elements":"the engagement, the president's indication that it hadn't been enough, my certainty that I'll have to pay. Gale ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,303,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,303,6,0","type":4,"elements":"never interrupts. While I talk, he tucks the gloves in his pocket and occupies himself with turning the food in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,303,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,303,7,0","type":4,"elements":"leather bag into a meal for us. Toasting bread and cheese, coring apples, placing chestnuts in the fire to roast. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,303,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,303,8,0","type":4,"elements":"watch his hands, his beautiful, capable fingers. Scarred, as mine","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,304","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,304,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,304,0,0","type":4,"elements":"were before the Capitol erased all marks from my skin, but strong and deft. Hands that have the power to mine ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,304,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,304,1,0","type":4,"elements":"coal but the precision to set a delicate snare. Hands I trust. I pause to take a drink of tea from the flask before I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,304,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,304,2,0","type":4,"elements":"tell him about my homecoming. \"Well, you really made a mess of things,\" he says. \"I'm not even done,\" I tell ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,304,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,304,3,0","type":4,"elements":"him. \"I've heard enough for the moment. Let's skip ahead to this plan of yours,\" he says. I take a deep breath. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,304,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,304,4,0","type":4,"elements":"\"We run away.\" \"What?\" he asks. This has actually caught him off guard. \"We take to the woods and make a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,304,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,304,5,0","type":4,"elements":"run for it,\" I say. His face is impossible to read. Will he laugh at me, dismiss this as foolishness? I rise in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,304,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,304,6,0","type":4,"elements":"agitation, preparing for an argument. \"You said yourself you thought that we could do it! That morning of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,304,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,304,7,0","type":4,"elements":"reaping. You said--\" He steps in and I feel myself lifted off the ground. The room spins, and I have to lock my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,304,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,304,8,0","type":4,"elements":"arms around Gale's neck to brace myself. He's laughing, happy. \"Hey!\" I","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,305","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,305,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,305,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,306","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,306,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,306,0,0","type":4,"elements":"protest, but I'm laughing, too. Gale sets me down but doesn't release his hold on me. \"Okay, let's run away,\" he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,306,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,306,1,0","type":4,"elements":"says. \"Really? You don't think I'm mad? You'll go with me?\" Some of the crushing weight begins to lift as it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,306,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,306,2,0","type":4,"elements":"transfers to Gale's shoulders. \"I do think you're mad and I'll still go with you,\" he says. He means it. Not only ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,306,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,306,3,0","type":4,"elements":"means it but welcomes it. \"We can do it. I know we can. Let's get out of here and never come back!\" \"You're ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,306,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,306,4,0","type":4,"elements":"sure?\" I say. \"Because it's going to be hard, with the kids and all. I don't want to get five miles into the woods ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,306,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,306,5,0","type":4,"elements":"and have you--\" \"I'm sure. I'm completely, entirely, one hundred percent sure.\" He tilts his forehead down to rest ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,306,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,306,6,0","type":4,"elements":"against mine and pulls me closer. His skin, his whole being, radiates heat from being so near the fire, and I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,306,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,306,7,0","type":4,"elements":"close my eyes, soaking in his warmth. I breathe in the smell of snow-dampened leather and smoke and apples, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,306,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,306,8,0","type":4,"elements":"the smell of all those wintry days we shared before the Games. I don'try to move away. Why should I, anyway? ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,306,9","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,306,9,0","type":4,"elements":"His voice","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,307","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,307,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,307,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,308","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,308,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,308,0,0","type":4,"elements":"drops to a whisper. \"I love you.\" That's why. I never see these things coming. They happen too fast. One ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,308,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,308,1,0","type":4,"elements":"second you're proposing an escape plan and the next... you're expected to deal with something like this. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,308,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,308,2,0","type":4,"elements":"come up with what must be the worst possible response. \"I know.\" It sounds terrible. Like I assume he couldn't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,308,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,308,3,0","type":4,"elements":"help loving me but that I don't feel anything in return. Gale starts to draw away, but I grab hold of him. \"I know! ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,308,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,308,4,0","type":4,"elements":"And you... you know what you are to me.\" It's not enough. He breaks my grip. \"Gale, I can't think about anyone ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,308,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,308,5,0","type":4,"elements":"that way now. All I can think about, every day, every waking minute since they drew Prim's name at the reaping, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,308,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,308,6,0","type":4,"elements":"is how afraid I am. And there doesn't seem to be room for anything else. If we could get somewhere safe, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,308,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,308,7,0","type":4,"elements":"maybe I could be different. I don't know.\" I","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,309","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,309,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,309,0,0","type":4,"