ce her, Gale. Do ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,311,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,311,7,0","type":4,"elements":"you think I'm making this stuff up?\" My voice is rising in anger as well. \"No. I don't know. Maybe the president's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,311,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,311,8,0","type":4,"elements":"just manipulating you. I mean, he's throwing","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,312","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,312,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,312,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,313","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,313,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,313,0,0","type":4,"elements":"your wedding. You saw how the Capitol crowd reacted. I don't think he can","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,314","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,314,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,314,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,315","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,315,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,315,0,0","type":4,"elements":"afford to kill you. Or Peeta. How's he going to get out of that one?\" says Gale. \"Well, with an uprising in District ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,315,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,315,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Eight, I doubt he's spending much time choosing my wedding cake!\" I shout. The instant the words are out of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,315,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,315,2,0","type":4,"elements":"my mouth I want to reclaim them. Their effect on Gale is immediate--the flush on his cheeks, the brightness of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,315,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,315,3,0","type":4,"elements":"his gray eyes. \"There's an uprising in Eight?\" he says in a hushed voice. I try to backpedal. To defuse him, as I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,315,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,315,4,0","type":4,"elements":"tried to defuse the districts. \"I don't know if it's really an uprising. There's unrest. People in the streets --\" I say. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,315,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,315,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Gale grabs my shoulders. \"What did you see?\" \"Nothing! In person. I just heard something.\" As usual, it's too ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,315,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,315,6,0","type":4,"elements":"little, too late. I give up and tell him. \"I saw something on the mayor's television. I wasn't supposed to. There ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,315,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,315,7,0","type":4,"elements":"was a","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,316","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,316,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,316,0,0","type":4,"elements":"crowd, and fires, and the Peacekeepers were gunning people down but they were fighting back. ...\" I bite my lip ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,316,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,316,1,0","type":4,"elements":"and struggle to continue describing the scene. Instead I say aloud the words that have been eating me up ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,316,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,316,2,0","type":4,"elements":"inside. \"And it's my fault, Gale. Because of what I did in the arena. If I had just killed myself with those berries, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,316,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,316,3,0","type":4,"elements":"none of this would've happened. Peeta could have come home and lived, and everyone else would have been ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,316,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,316,4,0","type":4,"elements":"safe, too.\" \"Safe to do what?\" he says in a gentler tone. \"Starve? Work like slaves? Send their kids to the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,316,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,316,5,0","type":4,"elements":"reaping? You haven't hurt people--you've given them an opportunity. They just have to be brave enough to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,316,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,316,6,0","type":4,"elements":"take it. There's already been talk in the mines. People who want to fight. Don't you see? It's happening! It's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,316,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,316,7,0","type":4,"elements":"finally happening! If there's an uprising in District Eight, why not here? Why not everywhere? This could be it, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,316,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,316,8,0","type":4,"elements":"the thing we've been--\" \"Stop it! You don't know what you're saying.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,317","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,317,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,317,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,318","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,318,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,318,0,0","type":4,"elements":"The Peacekeepers outside of Twelve, they're not like Darius, or even Cray! The lives of district people -- they ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,318,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,318,1,0","type":4,"elements":"mean less than nothing to them!\" I say. \"That's why we have to join the fight!\" he answers harshly. \"No! We ","format_id":"93e3