 I","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,322","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,322,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,322,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,323","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,323,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,323,0,0","type":4,"elements":"could go then, tap at the window, tell her the situation so she'll keep Gale from doing anything foolish. My ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,323,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,323,1,0","type":4,"elements":"conversation with President Snow in the study comes back to me. \"My advisors were concerned you would be ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,323,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,323,2,0","type":4,"elements":"difficult, but you're not planning on being difficult at all, are you?\" \"No.\" \"That's what I told them. I said any girl ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,323,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,323,3,0","type":4,"elements":"who goes to such lengths to preserve her life isn't going to be interested in throwing it away with both hands.\" I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,323,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,323,4,0","type":4,"elements":"think of how hard Hazelle has worked to keep that family alive. Surely she'll be on my side in this matter. Or ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,323,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,323,5,0","type":4,"elements":"won't she? It must be getting on toward noon now and the days are so short. No point in being in the woods ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,323,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,323,6,0","type":4,"elements":"after dark if you don't have to. I stamp out the remains of my little fire, clear up the scraps of food, and tuck ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-