{"id":"0,324,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,324,6,0","type":4,"elements":"square gets little use. It's a safe enough place to talk. But I can't seem to get the words out. Proposing it to Gale ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,324,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,324,7,0","type":4,"elements":"was such a disaster. I gnaw on my chapped lips. The square gets closer with every step. I may not have an ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,324,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,324,8,0","type":4,"elements":"opportunity again soon. I take a deep breath and let the words rush out. \"Peeta,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,325","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,325,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,325,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,326","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,326,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,326,0,0","type":4,"elements":"if I asked you to run away from the district with me, would you?\" Peeta takes my arm, bringing me to a stop. He ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,326,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,326,1,0","type":4,"elements":"doesn't need to check my face to see if I'm serious. \"Depends on why you're asking.\" \"President Snow wasn't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,326,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,326,2,0","type":4,"elements":"convinced by me. There's an uprising in District Eight. We have to get out,\" I say. \"By 'we' do you mean just you ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,326,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,326,3,0","type":4,"elements":"and me? No. Who else would be going?\" he asks. \"My family. Yours, if they want to come.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,327","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,327,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,327,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,328","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,328,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,328,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Haymitch, maybe,\" I say. \"What about Gale?\" he says. \"I don't know. He might have other plans,\" I say. Peeta ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,328,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,328,1,0","type":4,"elements":"shakes his head and gives me a rueful smile. \"I bet he does. Sure, Katniss, I'll go.\" I feel a slight twinge of hope. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,328,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,328,2,0","type":4,"elements":"\"You will?\" \"Yeah. But I don't think for a minute you will,\" he says. I jerk my arm away. \"Then you don't know me. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,328,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,328,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Be ready. It could be any time.\" I take off walking and he follows a pace or two","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,329","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,329,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,329,0,0","type":4,"elements":"behind. \"Katniss,\" Peeta says. I don't slow down. If he thinks it's a bad idea, I don't want to know, because it's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,329,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,329,1,0","type":4,"elements":"the only one I have. \"Katniss, hold up.\" I kick a dirty, frozen chunk of snow off the path and let him catch up. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,329,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,329,2,0","type":4,"elements":"The coal dust makes everything look especially ugly. \"I really will go, if you want me to. I just think we better talk ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,329,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,329,3,0","type":4,"elements":"it through with Haymitch. Make sure we won't be making things worse for everyone.\" He raises his head. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,329,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,329,4,0","type":4,"elements":"\"What's that?\" I lift my chin. I've been so consumed with my own worries, I haven't noticed the strange noise ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,329,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,329,5,0","type":4,"elements":"coming from the square. A whistling, the sound of an impact, the intake of breath from a crowd. \"Come on,\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,329,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,329,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta says, his face suddenly hard. I don't know why. I can't place the sound, even guess at the situation. But it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,329,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,329,7,0","type":4,"elements":"means something bad to him. When we reach the square, it's clear something's happening, but the crowd's too ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,329,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,329,8,0","type":4,"elements":"thick to see. Peeta steps up on a crate against the wall of","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,330","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,330,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,330,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,331","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,331,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,331,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the sweetshop and offers me a hand while he scans the square. I'm halfway up when he suddenly blocks my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,331,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,331,1,0","type":4,"elements":"way. \"Get down. Get out of here!\" He's whispering, but his voice is harsh with insistence. \"What?\" I say, trying to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,331,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,331,2,0","type":4,"elements":"force my way back up. \"Go home, Katniss! I'll be there in a minute, I swear!\" he says. Whatever it is, it's terrible. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,331,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,331,3,0","type":4,"elements":"I yank away from his hand and begin to push my way through the crowd. People see me, recognize my face, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,331,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,331,4,0","type":4,"elements":"and then look panicked. Hands shove me back. Voices hiss. \"Get out of here, girl.\" \"Only make it worse.\" \"What ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,331,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,331,5,0","type":4,"elements":"do you want to do? Get him killed?\" But at this point, my heart is beating so fast and fierce I hardly hear them. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,331,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,331,6,0","type":4,"elements":"only know that whatever waits in the middle of the square is meant for me. When I finally break through to the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,331,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,331,7,0","type":4,"elements":"cleared space, I see I am right. And Peeta was right. And those voices were right, too. Gale's wrists are bound ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,331,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,331,8,0","type":4,"elements":"to a wooden post. The wild turkey he shot earlier hangs above","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,332","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,332,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,332,0,0","type":4,"elements":"him, the nail driven through its neck. His jacket's been cast aside on the ground, his shirt torn away. He slumps ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,332,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,332,1,0","type":4,"elements":"unconscious on his knees, held up only by the ropes at his wrists. What used to be his back is a raw, bloody ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,332,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,332,2,0","type":4,"elements":"slab of meat. Standing behind him is a man I've never seen, but I recognize his uniform. It's the one designated ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,332,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,332,3,0","type":4,"elements":"for our Head Peacekeeper. This isn't old Cray, though. This is a tall, muscular man with sharp creases in his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,332,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,332,4,0","type":4,"elements":"pants. The pieces of the picture do not quite come together until I see his arm raise the whip. \"No!\" I cry, and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,332,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,332,5,0","type":4,"elements":"spring forward. It's too late to stop the arm","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,333","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,333,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,333,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,334","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,334,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,334,0,0","type":4,"elements":"from descending, and I instinctively know I won't have the power to block it. Instead I throw myself directly ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,334,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,334,1,0","type":4,"elements":"between the whip and Gale. I've flung out my arms to protect as much of his broken body as possible, so ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,334,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,334,2,0","type":4,"elements":"there's nothing to","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,335","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,335,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,335,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,336","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,336,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,336,0,0","type":4,"elements":"deflect the lash. I take the full force of it across the left side of my face. The pain is blinding and instantaneous. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,336,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,336,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Jagged flashes of light cross my vision and I fall to my knees. One hand cups my cheek while the other keeps ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,336,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,336,2,0","type":4,"elements":"me from tipping over. I can already feel the welt rising up, the swelling closing my eye. The stones beneath me ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,336,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,336,3,0","type":4,"elements":"are wet with Gale's blood, the air heavy with its scent. \"Stop it! You'll kill him!\" I shriek. I get a glimpse of my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,336,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,336,4,0","type":4,"elements":"assailant's face. Hard, with deep lines, a cruel mouth. Gray hair shaved almost to nonexistence, eyes so black ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,336,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,336,5,0","type":4,"elements":"they seem all pupils, a long, straight nose reddened by the freezing air. The powerful arm lifts again, his sights ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,336,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,336,6,0","type":4,"elements":"set on me. My hand flies to my shoulder, hungry for an arrow, but, of course, my wea