d. He grabbed Thread's arm and Thread hit him in the head with the butt of the whip. Nothing good waiting for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,350,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,350,6,0","type":4,"elements":"him,\" says Bristel. \"Doesn't sound like much good for any of us,\" says Haymitch. Snow begins, thick and wet, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,350,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,350,7,0","type":4,"elements":"making visibility even more difficult. I stumble up the walk to my house behind the others, using my ears more ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,350,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,350,8,0","type":4,"elements":"than my eyes to guide me. A golden light colors the snow as the door","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,351","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,351,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,351,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,352","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,352,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,352,0,0","type":4,"elements":"opens. My mother, who was no doubt waiting for me after a long day of unexplained absence, takes in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,352,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,352,1,0","type":4,"elements":"scene. \"New Head,\" Haymitch says, and she gives him a curt nod as if no other explanation is needed. I'm ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,352,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,352,2,0","type":4,"elements":"filled with awe, as I always am, as I watch her transform from a woman who calls me to kill a spider to a woman ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,352,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,352,3,0","type":4,"elements":"immune to fear. When a sick or dying person is brought to her ... this is the only time I think my mother knows ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,352,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,352,4,0","type":4,"elements":"who she is. In moments, the long kitchen table has been cleared, a sterile white cloth spread across it, and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,352,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,352,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Gale hoisted onto it. My mother pours water from a kettle into a basin while ordering Prim to pull a series of her ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,352,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,352,6,0","type":4,"elements":"remedies from the medicine cabinet. Dried herbs and tinctures and store-bought bottles. I watch her hands, the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,352,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,352,7,0","type":4,"elements":"long, tapered fingers crumbling this, adding drops of that, into the basin. Soaking acloth in the hot liquid as she ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,352,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,352,8,0","type":4,"elements":"gives Prim instructions to prepare a second brew. My mother glances my way. \"Did it cut your eye?\" \"No, it's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,352,9","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,352,9,0","type":4,"elements":"just swelled shut,\" I say. \"Get more snow on it,\" she instructs. But I am clearly not a priority. \"Can you save ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,352,10","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,352,10,0","type":4,"elements":"him?\" I ask my mother. She says nothing as she wrings out the cloth and holds it in the air to cool somewhat. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,352,11","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,352,11,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Don't worry,\" says Haymitch. \"Used to be a lot of whipping before Cray. She's the one we took them to.\" I can't ","format_id":"