e money. Hazelle arrives, breathless and flushed, fresh snow in her hair. Wordlessly, she sits on a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,354,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,354,3,0","type":4,"elements":"stool next to the table, takes Gale's hand, and holds it against her lips. My mother doesn't acknowledge even ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,354,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,354,4,0","type":4,"elements":"her. She's gone into that special zone that includes only herself and the patient and occasionally Prim. The rest ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,354,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,354,5,0","type":4,"elements":"of us can wait. Even in her expert hands, it takes a long time to clean the wounds, arrange what shredded skin ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,354,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,354,6,0","type":4,"elements":"can be saved, apply a salve and a light bandage. As the blood clears, I can see where every stroke of the lash ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,354,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,354,7,0","type":4,"elements":"landed and feel it resonate in the single cut on my face. I multiply my own pain once, twice, forty times and can ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,354,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,354,8,0","type":4,"elements":"only hope that Gale remains unconscious. Of course, that's","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,355","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,355,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,355,0,0","type":4,"elements":"too much to ask for. As the final bandages are being placed, a moan escapes his lips. Hazelle strokes his hair ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,355,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,355,1,0","type":4,"elements":"and whispers something while my mother and Prim go through their meager store of painkillers, the kind ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,355,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,355,2,0","type":4,"elements":"usually accessible only to doctors. They are hard to come by, expensive, and always in demand. My mother ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,355,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,355,3,0","type":4,"elements":"has to save the strongest for the worst pain, but what is the worst pain? To me, it's always the pain that is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,355,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,355,4,0","type":4,"elements":"present. If I were in charge, those painkillers would be gone in a day because I have so little ability to watch ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,355,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,355,5,0","type":4,"elements":"suffering. My mother tries to save them for those who are actually in the process of dying, to ease them out of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,355,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,355,6,0","type":4,"elements":"the world. Since Gale is regaining consciousness, they decide on an herbal concoction he can take by mouth. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,355,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,355,7,0","type":4,"elements":"\"That won't be enough,\" I say. They stare at me. \"That won't be enough, I know how it feels. That will barely ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,355,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,355,8,0","type":4,"elements":"knock out a headache.\" \"We'll combine it with sleep syrup, Katniss, and he'll manage","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,356","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,356,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,356,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,357","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,357,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,357,0,0","type":4,"elements":"it. The herbs are more for the inflammation--\" my mother begins calmly. \"Just give him the medicine!\" I scream ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,357,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,357,1,0","type":4,"elements":"at her.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,358","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,358,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,358,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,359","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,359,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,359,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Give it to him! Who are you, anyway, to decide how much pain he can stand!\" Gale begins stirring at my voice, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,359,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,359,1,0","type":4,"elements":"trying to reach me. The movement causes fresh blood to stain his bandages and an agonized sound to come ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,359,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,359,2,0","type":4,"elements":"from his mouth. \"Take her out,\" says my mother. Haymitch and Peeta literally carry me from the room while I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,359,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,359,3,0","type":4,"elements":"shout obscenities at her. They pin me down on a bed in one of the extra bedrooms until I stop fighting. While I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,359,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,359,4,0","type":4,"elements":"lie there, sobbing, tears trying to squeeze out of the slit of my eye, I hear Peeta whisper to Haymitch about ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,359,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,359,5,0","type":4,"elements":"President Snow, about the uprising in District 8. \"She wants us all to run,\" he says, but if Haymitch has an ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,359,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,359,6,0","type":4,"elements":"opinion on this, he doesn't offer it. After a while, my mother comes in and treats my face. Then she","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,360","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,360,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,360,0,0","type":4,"elements":"holds my hand, stroking my arm, while Haymitch fills her in on what happened with Gale. \"So it's starting ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,360,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,360,1,0","type":4,"elements":"again?\" she says. \"Like before?\" \"By the looks of it,\" he answers. \"Who'd have thought we'd ever be sorry to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,360,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,360,2,0","type":4,"elements":"see old Cray go?\" Cray would have been disliked, anyway, because of the uniform he wore, but it was his habit ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,360,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,360,3,0","type":4,"elements":"of luring starving young women into his bed for money that made him an object of loathing in the district. In ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,360,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,360,4,0","type":4,"elements":"really bad times, the hungriest would gather at his door at nightfall, vying for the chance to earn a few coins to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,360,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,360,5,0","type":4,"elements":"feed their families by selling their bodies. Had I been older when my father died, I might have been among ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,360,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,360,6,0","type":4,"elements":"them. Instead I learned to hunt. I don't 