evealing ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,362,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,362,5,0","type":4,"elements":"half a dozen vials of clear liquid. \"They're my mother's. She said I could take them. Use them, please.\" She ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,362,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,362,6,0","type":4,"elements":"runs back into the storm before we can stop her. \"Crazy girl,\" Haymitch mutters as we follow, my mother into the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,362,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,362,7,0","type":4,"elements":"kitchen. Whatever my mother had given Gale, I was right, it isn't enough. His teeth are gritted and his flesh ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,362,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,362,8,0","type":4,"elements":"shines with sweat. My mother fills a syringe with the clear liquid from","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,363","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,363,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,363,0,0","type":4,"elements":"one of the vials and shoots it into his arm. Almost immediately, his face begins to relax. \"What is that stuff?\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,363,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,363,1,0","type":4,"elements":"asks Peeta. \"It's from the Capitol. It's called morphling,\" my mother answers. \"I didn't even know Madge knew ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,363,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,363,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Gale,\" says Peeta. \"We used to sell her","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,364","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,364,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,364,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,365","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,365,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,365,0,0","type":4,"elements":"strawberries,\" I say almost angrily. What am I angry about, though? Not that she has brought the medicine, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,365,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,365,1,0","type":4,"elements":"surely. \"She must have quite a taste for them,\" says Haymitch.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,366","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,366,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,366,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,367","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,367,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,367,0,0","type":4,"elements":"That's what nettles me. It's the implication that there's something going on between Gale and Madge. And I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,367,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,367,1,0","type":4,"elements":"don't like it. \"She's my friend\" is all I say. Now that Gale has drifted away on the painkiller, everyone seems to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,367,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,367,2,0","type":4,"elements":"deflate. Prim makes us each eat some stew and bread. A room is offered to Hazelle, but she has to go home to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,367,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,367,3,0","type":4,"elements":"the other kids. Haymitch","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,368","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,368,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,368,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,369","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,369,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,369,0,0","type":4,"elements":"and Peeta are both willing to stay, but my mother sends them home to bed as well. She knows it's pointless to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,369,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,369,1,0","type":4,"elements":"try this with me and leaves me to tend Gale while she and Prim rest. Alone in the kitchen with Gale, I sit on ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,369,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,369,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Hazelle's stool, holding his hand. After a while, my fingers find his face. I touch parts of him I have never had ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,369,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,369,3,0","type":4,"elements":"cause to touch before. His heavy, dark eyebrows, the curve of his cheek, the line of his nose, the hollow at the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,369,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,369,4,0","type":4,"elements":"base of his neck. I trace the outline of stubble on his jaw and finally work my way to his lips. Soft and full, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,369,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,369,5,0","type":4,"elements":"slightly chapped. His breath warms my chilled skin. Does everyone look younger asleep? Because right now ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,369,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,369,6,0","type":4,"elements":"he could be the boy I ran into in the woods years ago, the one who accused me of stealing from his traps. What ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,369,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,369,7,0","type":4,"elements":"a pair we were--fatherless, frightened, but fiercely committed, too, to keeping our families alive. Desperate, yet ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,369,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,369,8,0","type":4,"elements":"no longer alone after that day, because we'd found each","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,370","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,370,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,370,0,0","type":4,"elements":"other. I think of a hundred moments in the woods, lazy afternoons fishing, the day I taught him to swim, that time ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,370,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,370,1,0","type":4,"elements":"I twisted my knee and he carried me home. Mutually counting on each other, watching each other's backs, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,370,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,370,2,0","type":4,"elements":"forcing each other to be brave. For the first time, I reverse our positions in my head. I imagine watching Gale ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,370,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,370,3,0","type":4,"elements":"volunteering to save Rory in the reaping, having him torn from my life, becoming some strange girl's lover to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,370,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,370,4,0","type":4,"elements":"stay alive, and then coming home with her. Living next to her. Promising to marry her. The hatred I feel for him, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,370,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,370,5,0","type":4,"elements":"for the phantom girl, for everything, is so real and immediate that it chokes me. Gale is mine. I am his. Anything ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,370,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,370,6,0","type":4,"elements":"else is unthinkable. Why did it take him being whipped within an inch of his life to see it? Because I'm selfish. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,370,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,370,7,0","type":4,"elements":"I'm a coward. I'm the kind of girl who, when she might actually be of use, would run to stay alive and leave ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,370,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,370,8,0","type":4,"elements":"those who couldn't follow to suffer and die. This is","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,371","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,371,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,371,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,372","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,372,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,372,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the girl Gale met in the woods today. No wonder I won the Games. No decent person ever does. You saved ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,372,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,372,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta, I think weakly. But now I question even that. I knew good and well that my life back in District 12 would ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,372,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,372,2,0","type":4,"elements":"be unlivable if I let that boy die. I rest my head forward on the edge of the table, overcome with loathing for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,372,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,372,3,0","type":4,"elements":"myself. Wishing I had died in the arena. Wishing Seneca Crane had blown me to bits the way President Snow ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,372,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,372,4,0","type":4,"elements":"said he should have when I held out the berries. The berries. I realize the answer to who I am lies in that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,372,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,372,5,0","type":4,"elements":"handful of poisonous fruit. If I held them out to save Peeta because I knew I would be shunned if I came back ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,372,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,372,6,0","type":4,"elements":"without him, then I am despicable. If I held them out because","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,373","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,373,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,373,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,374","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,374,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,374,0,0","type":4,"elements":"I loved him, I am still self-centered, although forgivable. But if I held them out to defy the Capitol, I am","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,375","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,375,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,375,0,0","type":4,"elements":"someone of worth. The trouble is, I don't know exactly what was going on inside me at that moment. Could it be ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,375,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,375,1,0","type":4,"elements":"the people in the districts are right? That it was an act of rebellion, even if it was an unconscious one? ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,375,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,375,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Because, deep down, I must know it isn't enough to keep myself, or my family, or my friends alive by running ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,375,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,375,3,0","type":4,"elements":"away. Even if I could. It wouldn't fix anything. It wouldn't stop people from being hurt the way Gale was today. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,375,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,375,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Life in District 12 isn't really so different from life in the arena. At some point, you have to stop running and turn ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,375,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,375,5,0","type":4,"elements":"around and face whoever wants you dead. The hard thing is finding the courage to do it. Well, it's not hard for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,375,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,375,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Gale. He was born a rebel. I'm the one making an escape plan. \"I'm so sorry,\" I whisper. I lean forward and kiss ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,375,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,375,7,0","type":4,"elements":"him. His eyelashes flutter and he looks at me through a haze of opiates. \"Hey, Catnip.\" \"Hey, Gale,\" I say. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,375,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,375,8,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Thought you'd be gone by now,\" he says. My choices are simple. I can die","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,376","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,376,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,376,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,377","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,377,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,377,0,0","type":4,"elements":"like quarry in the woods or I can die here beside Gale. \"I'm not going anywhere. I'm going to stay right here and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,377,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,377,1,0","type":4,"elements":"cause all kinds of trouble.\" \"Me, too,\" Gale says. He just manages a smile before the drugs pull him back under. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,377,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,377,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Someone gives my shoulder a shake and I sit up. I've fallen asleep with my face on the table. The white cloth ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,377,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,377,3,0","type":4,"elements":"has left creases on my good cheek. The other, the one that took the lash from Thread, throbs painfully. Gale's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a2