angled cry and wake with a start, sweating ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,380,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,380,2,0","type":4,"elements":"and shivering at once. Cradling my damaged cheek in my hand, I remind myself that it was not Clove but ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,380,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,380,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Thread who gave me this wound. I wish that Peeta were here to hold me, until I remember I'm not supposed to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,380,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,380,4,0","type":4,"elements":"wish, that anymore. I have chosen Gale and the rebellion, and a future with Peeta is the Capitol's design, not ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,380,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,380,5,0","type":4,"elements":"mine. The swelling around my eye has gone down and I can open it a bit. I push aside the curtains and see the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,380,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,380,6,0","type":4,"elements":"snowstorm has strengthened to a full-out blizzard. There's nothing but whiteness and the howling wind that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,380,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,380,7,0","type":4,"elements":"sounds remarkably like the muttations. I welcome the blizzard, with its ferocious winds and deep, drifting snow. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,380,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,380,8,0","type":4,"elements":"This may be enough to keep the real wolves,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,381","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,381,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,381,0,0","type":4,"elements":"also known as the Peacekeepers, from my door. A few days to think. To work out a plan. With Gale and Peeta ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9e