at_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,391,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,391,2,0","type":4,"elements":"warm months?\" I ask. A crease appears between my mother's eyebrows as she frowns. \"Tried to keep the flies ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,391,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,391,3,0","type":4,"elements":"away.\" My","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,392","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,392,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,392,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,393","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,0,0","type":4,"elements":"stomach turns at the thought. She fills a handkerchief with the snow-coat mixture and I hold it to the weal on my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,393,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,1,0","type":4,"elements":"cheek. Instantly the pain withdraws. It's the coldness of the snow, yes, but whatever mix of herbal juices my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,393,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,2,0","type":4,"elements":"mother has added numbs as well. \"Oh. That's wonderful. Why didn't you put this on him last night?\" \"I needed ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,393,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,3,0","type":4,"elements":"the wound to set first,\" she says. I don't know what that means exactly, but as long as it works, who am I to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,393,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,4,0","type":4,"elements":"question her? She knows what she's doing, my mother. I feel a pang of remorse about yesterday, the awful ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,393,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,5,0","type":4,"elements":"things I yelled at her as Peeta and Haymitch dragged me from the kitchen. \"I'm sorry. About screaming at you ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,393,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,6,0","type":4,"elements":"yesterday.\" \"I've heard worse,\" she says. \"You've seen how people are, when someone they love is in pain.\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,393,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Someone they love. The words numb my tongue as if it's been packed in snow coat. Of course, I love Gale. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,393,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,8,0","type":4,"elements":"But what kind of love does she mean? What do I mean when I say I love Gale? I don't know. I did kiss him last ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,393,9","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,9,0","type":4,"elements":"night, in a moment when my emotions were running so high. But I'm sure he doesn't remember it. Does he? I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,393,10","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,10,0","type":4,"elements":"hope not. If he does, everything will just get more complicated and I really can't think about kissing when I've ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,393,11","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,11,0","type":4,"elements":"got a rebellion to incite. I give my head a little shake to clear it. \"Where's Peeta?\" I say. \"He went home when ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,393,12","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,12,0","type":4,"elements":"we heard you stirring. Didn't want to leave his house unattended during the storm,\" says my mother. \"Did he get ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,393,13","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,393,13,0","type":4,"elements":"back all right?\" I ask. In a blizzard, you can get","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,394","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,394,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,394,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,395","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,395,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,395,0,0","type":4,"elements":"lost in a matter of yards and wander off course into oblivion. \"Why don't you give him a call and check?\" she ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,395,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,395,1,0","type":4,"elements":"says. I go into the study, a room I've pretty much avoided since my meeting with President Snow, and dial ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,395,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,395,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta's number. After a few rings he answers. \"Hey. I just wanted to make sure you got home,\" I say. \"Katniss, I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,395,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,395,3,0","type":4,"elements":"live three houses away from you,\" he says. \"I know, but with the weather and all,\" I say. \"Well, I'm fine. Thank ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,395,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,395,4,0","type":4,"elements":"you for checking.\" There's a long pause. \"How's Gale?\" \"All right. My mother and Prim are giving him snow coat ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,395,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,395,5,0","type":4,"elements":"now,\" I say. \"And your face?\" he asks. \"I've got some, too,\" I say. \"Have you seen Haymitch today?\" \"I checked ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,395,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,395,6,0","type":4,"elements":"in on him. Dead drunk. But I built up his fire and left him some bread,\" he says. \"I wanted to talk to -- to both of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,395,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,395,7,0","type":4,"elements":"you.\" I don't dare add more, here on my phone, which is surely tapped. \"Probably have to wait until after the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,395,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,395,8,0","type":4,"elements":"weather calms down,\" he says. \"Nothing much will happen before","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,396","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,396,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,396,0,0","type":4,"elements":"that, anyway.\" \"No, nothing much,\" I agree. It takes two days for the storm to blow itself out, leaving us with drifts ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,396,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,396,1,0","type":4,"elements":"higher than my head. Another day before the path is cleared from the Victor's Village to the square. During this ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,396,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,396,2,0","type":4,"elements":"time I help tend to Gale, apply snow coat to my cheek, try to remember everything I can about the uprising in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,396,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,396,3,0","type":4,"elements":"District 8, in case it will help us. The swelling in my face goes down, leaving me with an itchy, healing wound ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,396,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,396,4,0","type":4,"elements":"and a very black eye. But still, the first chance I get, I call Peeta to see if he wants to go into town with me. We ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,396,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,396,5,0","type":4,"elements":"rouse Haymitch and drag him along with us. He complains, but not as much as usual. We all know we need to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,396,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,396,6,0","type":4,"elements":"discuss what happened and it can't be anywhere as dangerous as our homes in the Victor's Village. In fact, we ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,396,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,396,7,0","type":4,"elements":"wait until the village is well behind us to even speak. I spend the time studying the ten-foot walls of snow piled ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,396,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,396,8,0","type":4,"elements":"up on either side of the narrow path that has been","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,397","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,397,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,397,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,398","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,398,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,398,0,0","type":4,"elements":"cleared, wondering if they will collapse in on us. Finally Haymitch breaks the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,399","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,399,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,399,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,400","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,400,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,400,0,0","type":4,"elements":"silence. \"So we're all heading off into the great unknown, are we?\" he asks me. \"No,\" I say. \"Not anymore.\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,400,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,400,1,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Worked through the flaws in that plan, did you, sweetheart?\" he asks. \"Any new ideas?\" \"I want to start an ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,400,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,400,2,0","type":4,"elements":"uprising,\" I say. Haymitch just laughs. It's not even a mean laugh, which is more troubling. It shows he can't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,400,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,400,3,0","type":4,"elements":"even take me seriously. \"Well, I want a drink. You let me know how that works out for you, though,\" he says. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,400,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,400,4,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Then what's your plan?\" I spit back at him. \"My plan is to make sure everything is just perfect for your ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,400,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,400,5,0","type":4,"elements":"wedding,\" says Haymitch. \"I called and rescheduled the photo shoot without giving too many details.\" \"You ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,400,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,400,6,0","type":4,"elements":"don't even have a phone,\" I say. \"Effie had that fixed,\" he says. \"Do you know she asked me if I'd like to give ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,400,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,400,7,0","type":4,"elements":"you away? I told her","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,401","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,401,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,401,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the sooner the better.\" \"Haymitch.\" I can hear the pleading creeping into my voice. \"Katniss.\" He mimics my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,401,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,401,1,0","type":4,"elements":"tone. \"It won't work.\" We shut up as a team of men with shovels passes us, headed out to the Victor's Village. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,401,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,401,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Maybe they can do something about those ten-foot walls. And by the time they're out of earshot, the square is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,401,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,401,3,0","type":4,"elements":"too close. We step into it and all come to a stop simultaneously. Nothing much will happen during the blizzard. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,401,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,401,4,0","type":4,"elements":"That's what Peeta and I had agreed. But we couldn't have been more wrong. The square has been ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,401,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,401,5,0","type":4,"elements":"transformed. A huge banner with the seal of Panem hangs off the roof of the Justice Building. Peacekeepers, in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,401,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,401,6,0","type":4,"elements":"pristine white uniforms, march on the cleanly swept cobblestones. Along the rooftops, more of them occupy ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,401,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,401,7,0","type":4,"elements":"nests of machine guns. Most unnerving is a line of new constructions --an official whipping post, several ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,401,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,401,8,0","type":4,"elements":"stockades, and a gallows -- set up in the center of the square.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,402","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,402,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,402,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,403","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,403,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,403,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Thread's a quick worker,\" says Haymitch. Some streets away from the square, I see a blaze flare up. None of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,403,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,403,1,0","type":4,"elements":"us has to say it. That can only be the Hob going up in smoke. I think of Greasy Sae, Ripper, all my friends who ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,403,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,403,2,0","type":4,"elements":"make their living there. \"Haymitch, you don't think everyone was still in---\" I can't finish the sentence. \"Nah, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,403,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,403,3,0","type":4,"elements":"they're smarter than that. You'd be, too, if you'd been around longer,\" he says. \"Well, I better go see how much ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,403,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,403,4,0","type":4,"elements":"rubbing alcohol the apothecary can spare.\" He trudges off across the square and I look at Peeta. \"What's he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,403,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,403,5,0","type":4,"elements":"want that for?\" Then I realize the answer. \"We can't let him drink it. He'll kill himself, or at the very least go blind. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,403,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,403,6,0","type":4,"elements":"I've got some white liquor put away at home.\" \"Me, too. Maybe that will hold him until Ripper finds a way to be ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,403,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,403,7,0","type":4,"elements":"back in business,\" says Peeta. \"I need to check on my family.\" \"I have to go see Hazelle.\" I'm worried now. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,403,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,403,8,0","type":4,"elements":"thought she'd be on our doorstep the moment the snow was cleared. But","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,404","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,404,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,404,0,0","type":4,"elements":"there's been no sign of her. \"I'll go, too. Drop by the bakery on my way home,\" he says. \"Thanks.\" I'm suddenly ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,404,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,404,1,0","type":4,"elements":"very scared at what I might find. The streets are almost deserted, which would not be so unusual at this time of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,404,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,404,2,0","type":4,"elements":"day if people were at the mines, kids","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,405","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,405,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,405,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,406","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,406,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,406,0,0","type":4,"elements":"at school. But they're not. I see faces peeking at us out of doorways, through cracks in shutters. An uprising, I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,406,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,406,1,0","type":4,"elements":"think. What an idiot I am. There's an inherent flaw in the plan that both Gale and I were too blind to see. An ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,406,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,406,2,0","type":4,"elements":"uprising requires breaking the law, thwarting authority. We've done that our whole lives, or our families have. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,406,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,406,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Poaching, trading on the black market, mocking the Capitol in the woods. But for most people in District 12, a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,406,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,406,4,0","type":4,"elements":"trip to buy something at the Hob would be too risky. And I expect them to assemble in the square with bricks ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,406,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,406,5,0","type":4,"elements":"and torches? Even the sight of Peeta","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,407","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,407,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,407,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,408","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,408,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,408,0,0","type":4,"elements":"and me is enough to make people pull their children away from the windows and draw the curtains tightly. We ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,408,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,408,1,0","type":4,"elements":"find Hazelle in her house, nursing a very sick Posy. I recognize the measles spots. \"I couldn't leave her,\" she ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,408,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,408,2,0","type":4,"elements":"says. \"I knew Gale'd be in the best possible hands.\" \"Of course,\" I say. \"He's much better. My mother says he'll ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,408,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,408,3,0","type":4,"elements":"be back in the mines in a couple of weeks.\" \"May not be open until then, anyway,\" says Hazelle. \"Word is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,408,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,408,4,0","type":4,"elements":"they're closed until further notice.\" She gives a nervous glance at her empty washtub. \"You closed down, too?\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,408,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,408,5,0","type":4,"elements":"I ask. \"Not officially,\" says Hazelle. \"But everyone's afraid to use me now.\" \"Maybe it's the snow,\" says Peeta. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,408,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,408,6,0","type":4,"elements":"\"No, Rory made a quick round this morning. Nothing to wash, apparently,\" she says. Rory wraps his arms ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,408,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,408,7,0","type":4,"elements":"around Hazelle. \"We'll be all right.\" I take a handful of money from my pocket and lay it on the table. \"My mother ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,408,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,408,8,0","type":4,"elements":"will send something for Posy.\" When we're outside, I turn to Peeta.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,409","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,409,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,409,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"You go on back. I want to walk by the Hob.\" \"I'll go with you,\" he says. \"No. I've dragged you into enough ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,409,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,409,1,0","type":4,"elements":"trouble,\" I tell him. \"And avoiding a stroll by the Hob ... that's going to fix things for me?\" He smiles and takes my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,409,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,409,2,0","type":4,"elements":"hand. Together we wind through the streets of the Seam until we reach the burning building. They haven't even ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,409,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,409,3,0","type":4,"elements":"bothered to leave Peacekeepers around it. They know no one would try to save it. The heat from the flames ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,409,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,409,4,0","type":4,"elements":"melts the surrounding snow and a black trickle runs across my shoes. \"It's all that coal dust, from the old days,\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,409,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,409,5,0","type":4,"elements":"I say. It was in every crack and crevice. Ground into the floorboards. It's amazing the place didn't go up before. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,409,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,409,6,0","type":4,"elements":"\"I want to check on Greasy Sae.\" \"Not today, Katniss. I don't think we'd be helping anyone by dropping in on ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,409,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,409,7,0","type":4,"elements":"them,\" he says. We go back to the square. I buy some cakes from Peeta's father while they exchange small ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,409,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,409,8,0","type":4,"elements":"talk about the weather. No one mentions the ugly tools","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,410","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,410,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,410,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,411","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,411,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,411,0,0","type":4,"elements":"of torture just yards from the front door. The last thing I notice as we leave the square is that I do not recognize ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,411,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,411,1,0","type":4,"elements":"even one of the Peacekeepers' faces. As the days pass, things go from bad to worse. The mines stay shut for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,411,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,411,2,0","type":4,"elements":"two weeks, and by that time half of District 12 is starving. The number of kids signing up for tesserae soars, but ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,411,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,411,3,0","type":4,"elements":"they often don't receive their grain. Food shortages begin, and even those with money come away from stores ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,411,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,411,4,0","type":4,"elements":"empty-handed.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,412","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,412,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,412,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,413","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,413,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,413,0,0","type":4,"elements":"When the mines reopen, wages are cut, hours extended, miners sent into blatantly dangerous work sites. The ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,413,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,413,1,0","type":4,"elements":"eagerly awaited food promised for Parcel Day arrives spoiled and defiled by rodents. The installations in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,413,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,413,2,0","type":4,"elements":"square see plenty of action as people are dragged in and punished for offenses so long overlooked we've ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,413,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,413,3,0","type":4,"elements":"forgotten they are illegal. Gale goes home with no more talk of","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,414","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,414,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,414,0,0","type":4,"elements":"rebellion between us. But I can't help thinking that everything he sees will only strengthen his resolve to fight ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,414,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,414,1,0","type":4,"elements":"back. The hardships in the mines, the tortured bodies in the square, the hunger on the faces of his family. Rory ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,414,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,414,2,0","type":4,"elements":"has signed up for tesserae, something Gale can't even speak about, but it's still not enough with the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,414,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,414,3,0","type":4,"elements":"inconsistent availability and the ever-increasing price of food. The only bright spot is, I get Haymitch to hire ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,414,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,414,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Hazelle as a housekeeper, resulting in some extra money for her and greatly increasing Haymitch's standard of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,414,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,414,5,0","type":4,"elements":"living. It's weird going into his house, finding it fresh and clean, food warming on the stove. He hardly notices ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,414,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,414,6,0","type":4,"elements":"because he's fighting a whole different battle. Peeta and I tried to ration what white liquor we had, but it's almost ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,414,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,414,7,0","type":4,"elements":"run out, and the last time I saw Ripper, she was in the stocks. I feel like a pariah when I walk through the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,414,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,414,8,0","type":4,"elements":"streets. Everyone avoids me in public now. But there's no shortage of company","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,415","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,415,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,415,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,416","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,416,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,416,0,0","type":4,"elements":"at home. A steady supply of ill and injured is deposited in our kitchen before my mother, who has long since ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,416,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,416,1,0","type":4,"elements":"stopped charging for her services. Her stocks of remedies are running so low, though, that soon all she'll have ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,416,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,416,2,0","type":4,"elements":"to treat the patients with is snow. The woods, of course, are forbidden. Absolutely. No question. Even Gale ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,416,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,416,3,0","type":4,"elements":"doesn't challenge this now. But one morning, I do. And it isn't the house full of the sick and dying, the bleeding ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,416,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,416,4,0","type":4,"elements":"backs, the gaunt-faced children, the marching boots, or the omnipresent misery that drives me under the fence. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,416,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,416,5,0","type":4,"elements":"It's the arrival of a crate of wedding dresses one night with a note from Effie saying that President Snow ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,416,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,416,6,0","type":4,"elements":"approved these himself. The wedding. Is he really planning to go through with it? What, in his twisted brain, will ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,416,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,416,7,0","type":4,"elements":"that achieve? Is it for the benefit of those in the Capitol? A wedding was promised, a wedding will be given. And ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,416,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,416,8,0","type":4,"elements":"then he'll kill us? As a lesson to","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,417","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,417,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,417,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the districts? I don't know. I can't make sense of it. I toss and turn in bed until I can't stand it anymore. I have to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,417,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,417,1,0","type":4,"elements":"get out of here. At least for a few hours. My hands dig around in my closet until I find the insulated winter gear ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,417,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,417,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Cinna made for me for recreational use on the Victory Tour. Waterproof boots, a snowsuit","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,418","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,418,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,418,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,419","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,419,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,419,0,0","type":4,"elements":"that covers me from head to toe, thermal gloves. I love my old hunting stuff, but the trek I have in mind today is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,419,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,419,1,0","type":4,"elements":"more suited to this high-tech clothing. I tiptoe downstairs, load my game bag with food, and sneak out of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,419,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,419,2,0","type":4,"elements":"house. Slinking along side streets and back alleys, I make my way to the weak spot in the fence closest to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,419,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,419,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Rooba the butcher's. Since many workers cross this way to get to the mines, the snow's pockmarked with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,419,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,419,4,0","type":4,"elements":"footprints. Mine will not be noticed. With all his security upgrades, Thread has paid little","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,420","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,420,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,420,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,421","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,421,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,421,0,0","type":4,"elements":"attention to the fence, perhaps feeling harsh weather and wild animals are enough to keep everyone safely ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,421,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,421,1,0","type":4,"elements":"inside. Even so, once I'm under the chain link, I cover my tracks until the trees conceal them for me. Dawn is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,421,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,421,2,0","type":4,"elements":"just breaking as I retrieve a set of bow and arrows and begin to force a path through the drifted snow in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,421,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,421,3,0","type":4,"elements":"woods. I'm determined, for some reason, to get to the lake. Maybe to say good-bye to the place, to my father ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,421,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,421,4,0","type":4,"elements":"and the happy times we spent there, because I know I'll probably never return. Maybe just so I can draw a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,421,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,421,5,0","type":4,"elements":"complete breath again. Part of me doesn't really care if they catch me, if I can see it one more time. The trip ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,421,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,421,6,0","type":4,"eleme