. There's a step and a dragging sound. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,429,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,429,2,0","type":4,"elements":"can hear the effort the movement requires. Another woman, or maybe I should call her a girl since she looks ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,429,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,429,3,0","type":4,"elements":"about my age, limps into view. She's dressed in an ill-fitting Peacekeeper's uniform complete with the white fur ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,429,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,429,4,0","type":4,"elements":"cloak, but it's several sizes too large for her slight frame. She carries no visible weapon. Her hands are ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,429,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,429,5,0","type":4,"elements":"occupied with steadying a rough crutch made from a broken branch. The toe of her right boot can't clear the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,429,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,429,6,0","type":4,"elements":"snow, hence the dragging. I examine the girl's face, which is bright red from the cold. Her teeth are crooked and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,429,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,429,7,0","type":4,"elements":"there's a strawberry birthmark over one of her chocolate brown eyes. This is no Peacekeeper. No citizen of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,429,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,429,8,0","type":4,"elements":"Capitol, either. \"Who are you?\" I ask warily but less","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,430","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,430,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,430,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,431","type":2,"elements":[{"id"