ere, where I might be able to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,452,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,452,3,0","type":4,"elements":"accomplish something, instead of waiting here for my death? But then ... if there are people in District 13, with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,452,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,452,4,0","type":4,"elements":"powerful weapons ... \"Why haven't they helped us?\" I say angrily. \"If it's true, why do they leave us to live like ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,452,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,452,5,0","type":4,"elements":"this? With the hunger and the killings and the Games?\" And suddenly I hate this imaginary underground city of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,452,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,452,6,0","type":4,"elements":"District 13 and those who sit by, watching us die. They're no better than the Capitol. \"We don't know,\" Bonnie ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,452,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,452,7,0","type":4,"elements":"whispers. \"Right now, we're just holding on to the hope that they exist.\" That snaps me to my senses. These ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,452,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,452,8,0","type":4,"elements":"are delusions. District 13 doesn't exist because the Capitol would never let","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,453","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,453,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,453,0,0","type":4,"elements":"it exist. They're probably mistaken about the footage. Mockingjays are about as rare as rocks. And about as ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,453,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,453,1,0","type":4,"elements":"tough. If they could survive the initial bombing of 13, they're probably doing better than ever now. 