'm crouched on one knee, preparing to enter the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,460,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,460,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Meadow, but I'm still so preoccupied with the day's events that it takes a sudden screech of an owl to bring me ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,460,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,460,7,0","type":4,"elements":"to my senses. In the fading light, the chain links look as innocuous as usual. But what makes me jerk back my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,460,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,460,8,0","type":4,"elements":"hand is the sound, like the buzz of a tree full of tracker jacker nests,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,461","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,461,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,461,0,0","type":4,"elements":"indicating the fence is alive with electricity. My feet back up automatically and I blend into the trees. I cover my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,461,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,461,1,0","type":4,"elements":"mouth with my glove to disperse the white of my breath in the icy air. Adrenaline courses through me, wiping all ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,461,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,461,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the concerns of the day from my mind as I focus on the immediate threat before me. What is going on? Has ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,461,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,461,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Thread turned on the fence as an additional security precaution? Or does he somehow know I've escaped his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,461,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,461,4,0","type":4,"elements":"net today? Is he determined to strand me outside District 12 until he","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-