r imagine I'd be in the woods. I've even taken steps to mislead them. So if I don't show up, worry ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,465,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,465,3,0","type":4,"elements":"they will. And there's a part of me that's worried, too, because I'm not sure it's just a coincidence, the power ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,465,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,465,4,0","type":4,"elements":"coming on the very day I return to the woods. I thought no one saw me sneak under the fence, but who knows? ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,465,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,465,5,0","type":4,"elements":"There are always eyes for hire. Someone reported Gale kissing me in that very spot. Still, that was in daylight ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,465,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,465,6,0","type":4,"elements":"and before I was more careful about my behavior. Could there be surveillance cameras? I've wondered about ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,465,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,465,7,0","type":4,"elements":"this before. Is this the way President Snow knows about the kiss? It was dark when I went under and my face ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,465,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,465,8,0","type":4,"elements":"was bundled in a scarf. But the list of suspects likely to be trespassing into","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,466","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,466,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,466,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the woods is probably very short. My eyes peer through the trees, past the fence, into the Meadow. All I can see ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,466,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,466,1,0","type":4,"elements":"is the wet snow illuminated here and there by the light from the windows on the edge of the Seam. No ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,466,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,466,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Peacekeepers in sight, no signs I am being hunted. Whether Thread knows I left the district today or not, I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,466,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,466,3,0","type":4,"elements":"realize my course of action must be the same: to get back inside the fence unseen and pretend I never left. Any ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,466,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,466,4,0","type":4,"elements":"contact with the chain link or the coils of barbed wire that guard the top would mean instant electrocution. I don't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,466,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,466,5,0","type":4,"elements":"think I can burrow under the fence without risking detection, and the ground's frozen hard, anyway. That leaves ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,466,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,466,6,0","type":4,"elements":"only one choice. Somehow I'm going to have to go over it. I begin to skirt along the tree line, searching for a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,466,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,466,7,0","type":4,"elements":"tree with a branch high and long enough to fit my needs. After about a mile, I come upon an old maple that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,466,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,466,8,0","type":4,"elements":"might do. The trunk is too wide and icy to shinny up, though,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,467","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,467,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,467,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,468","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,468,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,468,0,0","type":4,"elements":"and there are no low branches. I climb a neighboring tree and leap precariously into the maple, almost losing ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,468,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,468,1,0","type":4,"elements":"my hold on the slick bark. But I manage to get a grip and slowly inch my way out on a limb that hangs above ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,468,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,468,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the barbed wire. As I look down, I remember why Gale and I always waited in the woods rather than try to tackle ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,468,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,468,3,0","type":4,"elements":"the fence. Being high enough to avoid getting fried means you've got to be at least twenty feet in the air. I guess ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,468,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,468,4,0","type":4,"elements":"my branch must be twenty-five. That's a dangerously long drop, even for someone who's had years of practice ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,468,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,468,5,0","type":4,"elements":"in trees. But what choice do I have? I could look for another branch, but it's almost dark now. The falling snow ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,468,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,468,6,0","type":4,"elements":"will obscure any moonlight. Here, at least, I can","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,469","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,469,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,469,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,470","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,470,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,470,0,0","type":4,"elements":"see I've got a snowbank to cushion my landing. Even if I could find another, which is doubtful, who knows what ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,470,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,470,1,0","type":4,"elements":"I'd be jumping into? I throw my empty game bag around my","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,471","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,471,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,471,0,0","type":4,"elements":"neck and slowly lower myself until I'm hanging by my hands. For a moment, I gather my courage. Then I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,471,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,471,1,0","type":4,"elements":"release my fingers. There's the sensation of falling, then I hit the ground with a jolt that goes right up my spine. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,471,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,471,2,0","type":4,"elements":"A second later, my rear end slams the ground. I lie in the snow, trying to assess the damage. Without standing, I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,471,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,471,3,0","type":4,"elements":"can tell by the pain in my left heel and my tailbone that I'm injured. The only question is how badly. I'm hoping ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,471,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,471,4,0","type":4,"elements":"for bruises, but when I force myself onto my feet, I suspect I've broken something as well. I can walk, though, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,471,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,471,5,0","type":4,"elements":"so I get moving, trying to hide my limp as best I can. My mother and Prim can't know I was in the woods. I need ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,471,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,471,6,0","type":4,"elements":"to work up some sort of alibi, no matter how thin. Some of the shops in the square are still open, so I go in one ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,471,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,471,7,0","type":4,"elements":"and purchase white cloth for bandages. We're running low, anyway. In another, I buy a bag of sweets for Prim. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,471,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,471,8,0","type":4,"elements":"stick one of the candies in my mouth, feeling the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,472","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,472,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,472,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,473","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,473,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,473,0,0","type":4,"elements":"peppermint melt on my tongue, and realize it's the first thing I've eaten all day. I meant to make a meal at the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,473,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,473,1,0","type":4,"elements":"lake, but once I saw Twill and Bonnie's condition, it seemed wrong to take a single mouthful from them. By the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,473,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,473,2,0","type":4,"elements":"time I reach my house, my left heel will bear no weight at all. I decide to tell my mother I was trying to mend a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,473,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,473,3,0","type":4,"elements":"leak in the roof of our old house and slid off. As for the missing food, I'll just be vague about who I handed it out ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,473,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,473,4,0","type":4,"elements":"to. I drag myself in the door, all ready to collapse in front of the fire. But instead I get another","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,474","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,474,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,474,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,475","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,475,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,475,0,0","type":4,"elements":"shock. Two Peacekeepers, a man and a woman, are standing in the doorway to our kitchen. The woman ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,475,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,475,1,0","type":4,"elements":"remains impassive, but I catch the flicker of surprise on the man's face. I am unanticipated. They know I was in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,475,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,475,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the woods and should be trapped there now. \"Hello,\" I say in a neutral","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,476","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,476,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,476,0,0","type":4,"elements":"voice. My mother appears behind them, but keeps her distance. \"Here she is, just in time for dinner,\" she says ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,476,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,476,1,0","type":4,"elements":"a little too brightly. I'm very late for dinner. I consider removing my boots as I normally would but doubt I can ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,476,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,476,2,0","type":4,"elements":"manage it without revealing my injuries. Instead I just pull off my wet hood and shake the snow from my hair. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,476,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,476,3,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Can I help you with something?\" I ask the Peacekeepers. \"Head Peacekeeper Thread sent us with a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,476,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,476,4,0","type":4,"elements":"message for you,\" says the woman. \"They've been waiting for hours,\" my mother adds. They've been waiting ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,476,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,476,5,0","type":4,"elements":"for me to fail to return. To confirm I got electrocuted by the fence or trapped in the woods so they could take my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,476,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,476,6,0","type":4,"elements":"family in for questioning. \"Must be an important message,\" I say. \"May we ask where you've been, Miss ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,476,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,476,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Everdeen?\" the woman asks. \"Easier to ask where I haven't been,\" I say with a sound of exasperation. I cross ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,476,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,476,8,0","type":4,"elements":"into the kitchen, forcing myself to use my foot normally","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,477","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,477,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,477,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,478","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,478,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,478,0,0","type":4,"elements":"even though every step is excruciating. I pass between the Peacekeepers and make it to the table all right. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,478,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,478,1,0","type":4,"elements":"fling my bag down and turn to Prim, who's standing stiffly by the hearth. Haymitch and Peeta are there as well, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,478,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,478,2,0","type":4,"elements":"sitting in a pair of matching rockers, playing a game of chess. Were they here by chance or \"invited\" by the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,478,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,478,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Peacekeepers? Either way, I'm glad to see them. \"So where haven't you been?\" says Haymitch in a bored ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,478,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,478,4,0","type":4,"elements":"voice. \"Well, I haven't been talking to the Goat Man about getting Prim's goat pregnant, because someone ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,478,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,478,5,0","type":4,"elements":"gave me completely inaccurate information as to where he lives,\" I say to Prim emphatically. \"No, I didn't,\" says ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,478,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,478,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Prim. \"I told you exactly.\" \"You said he lives beside the west entrance to the mine,\" I say. \"The east entrance,\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,478,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,478,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Prim corrects me. \"You distinctly said the west, because then I said, 'Next to the slag heap?' and you said, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,478,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,478,8,0","type":4,"elements":"'Yeah,'\" I say. \"The slag heap next to the east entrance,\" says Prim patiently.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,479","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,479,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,479,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"No. When did you say that?\" I demand. \"Last night,\" Haymitch chimes in. \"It was definitely the east,\" adds ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,479,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,479,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta. He looks at Haymitch and they laugh. I glare at Peeta and he tries to look contrite. \"I'm sorry, but it's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,479,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,479,2,0","type":4,"elements":"what I've been saying. You don't listen when people talk to you.\" \"Bet people told you he didn't live there today ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,479,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,479,3,0","type":4,"elements":"and you didn't listen again,\" says Haymitch. \"Shut up, Haymitch,\" I say, clearly indicating he's right. Haymitch ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,479,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,479,4,0","type":4,"elements":"and Peeta crack up and Prim allows herself a smile. \"Fine. Somebody else can arrange to get the stupid goat ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,479,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,479,5,0","type":4,"elements":"knocked up,\" I say, which makes them laugh more. And I think, This is why they've made it this far, Haymitch ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,479,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,479,6,0","type":4,"elements":"and Peeta. Nothing throws them. I look at the Peacekeepers. The man's smiling but the woman is","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,480","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,480,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,480,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,481","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,481,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,481,0,0","type":4,"elements":"unconvinced. \"What's in the bag?\" she asks sharply. I know she's hoping for game or wild plants. Something ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,481,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,481,1,0","type":4,"elements":"that","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,482",