":"accept his kiss. Then I look at the Peacekeepers as if I'm suddenly remembering they're there. \"You have a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,483,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,483,8,0","type":4,"elements":"message for me?\" \"From Head Peacekeeper Thread,\" says the woman.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,484","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,484,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,484,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"He wanted you to know that the fence surrounding District Twelve will now have electricity twenty-four hours a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,484,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,484,1,0","type":4,"elements":"day.\" \"Didn't it already?\" I ask, a little too innocently. \"He thought you might be interested in passing this ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,484,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,484,2,0","type":4,"elements":"information on to your cousin,\" says the woman. \"Thank you. I'll tell him. I'm sure we'll all sleep a little more ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,484,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,484,3,0","type":4,"elements":"soundly now that security has addressed that lapse.\" I'm pushing things, I know it, but the comment gives me a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,484,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,484,4,0","type":4,"elements":"sense of satisfaction. The woman's jaw tightens. None of this has gone as planned, but she has no further ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,484,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,484,5,0","type":4,"elements":"orders. She gives me a curt nod and leaves, the man trailing in her wake. When my mother has locked the door ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,484,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,484,6,0","type":4,"elements":"behind them, I slump against the table. \"What is it?\" says Peeta, holding me steadily. \"Oh, I banged up my left ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,484,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,484,7,0","type":4,"elements":"foot. The heel. And my tail-bone's had a bad day, too.\" He helps me over to one of the rockers and I lower ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,484,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,484,8,0","type":4,"elements":"myself onto the padded cushion. My mother eases off my boots. \"What","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,485","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,485,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,485,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,486","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,0,0","type":4,"elements":"happened?\" \"I slipped and fell,\" I say. Four pairs of eyes look at me with disbelief. \"On some ice.\" But we all ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,1,0","type":4,"elements":"know the house must be bugged and it's not safe to talk openly. Not here, not now. Having stripped off my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,2,0","type":4,"elements":"sock, my mother's fingers probe the bones in my left heel and I wince. \"There might be a break,\" she says. She ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,3,0","type":4,"elements":"checks the other foot. \"This one seems all right.\" She judges my tailbone to be badly bruised. Prim's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,4,0","type":4,"elements":"dispatched to get my pajamas and robe. When I'm changed, my mother makes a snow pack for my left heel ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,5,0","type":4,"elements":"and props it up on a hassock. I eat three bowls of stew and half a loaf of bread while the others dine at the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,6,0","type":4,"elements":"table. I stare at the fire, thinking of Bonnie and Twill, hoping that the heavy, wet snow has erased my tracks. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Prim comes and sits on the floor next to me, leaning her head against my knee. We suck on peppermints as I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,8,0","type":4,"elements":"brush her soft blond hair back behind her ear. \"How was school?\" I ask. \"All right.We learned about coal ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,9","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,9,0","type":4,"elements":"by-products,\" she says. We stare at the fire for a while. \"Are you going to try on your wedding dresses?\" \"Not ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,10","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,10,0","type":4,"elements":"tonight. Tomorrow probably,\" I say. \"Wait until I get home, okay?\" she says. \"Sure.\" If they don't arrest me first. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,11","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,11,0","type":4,"elements":"My mother gives me a cup of chamomile tea with a dose of sleep syrup, and my eyelids begin to droop ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,12","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,12,0","type":4,"elements":"immediately. She wraps my bad foot, and Peeta volunteers to get me to bed. I start out by leaning on his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,13","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,13,0","type":4,"elements":"shoulder, but I'm so wobbly he just scoops me up and carries me upstairs. He tucks me in and says good night ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,14","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,14,0","type":4,"elements":"but I catch his hand and hold him there. A side effect of the sleep syrup is that it makes people less inhibited, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,15","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,15,0","type":4,"elements":"like white liquor, and I know I have to control my tongue. But I don't want him to go. In fact, I want him to climb in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,16","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,16,0","type":4,"elements":"with me, to be there when the nightmares hit tonight. For some reason that I can't quite form, I know I'm not ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,486,17","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,486,17,0","type":4,"elements":"allowed to ask that. \"Don't go yet. Not","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,487","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,487,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,487,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,488","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,488,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,488,0,0","type":4,"elements":"until I fall asleep,\" I say. Peeta sits on the side of the bed, warming my hand in both of his. \"Almost thought ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,488,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,488,1,0","type":4,"elements":"you'd changed your mind today. When you were late for dinner.\" I'm foggy but I can guess what he means. With ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,488,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,488,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the fence going on and me showing up late and the Peacekeepers waiting, he thought I'd made a run for it, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,488,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,488,3,0","type":4,"elements":"maybe with Gale. \"No, I'd have told you,\" I say. I pull his hand up and lean my cheek against the back of it, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,488,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,488,4,0","type":4,"elements":"taking in the faint scent of cinnamon and dill from the breads he must have baked today. I want to tell him about ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,488,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,488,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Twill and Bonnie and the uprising and the fantasy of District 13, but it's not safe to and I can feel myself slipping ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,488,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,488,6,0","type":4,"elements":"away, so I just get out one more sentence. \"Stay with me.\" As the tendrils of sleep syrup pull me down, I hear ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,488,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,488,7,0","type":4,"elements":"him whisper a word back, but I don't quite catch it. My mother lets me sleep until noon, then rouses me to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,488,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,488,8,0","type":4,"elements":"examine my heel. I'm ordered to a week of bed rest and I","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,489","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,489,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,489,0,0","type":4,"elements":"don't object because I feel so lousy. Not just my heel and my tailbone. My whole body aches with exhaustion. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,489,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,489,1,0","type":4,"elements":"So I let my mother doctor me and feed me breakfast in bed and tuck another quilt around me. Then I just lie ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,489,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,489,2,0","type":4,"elements":"there, staring out my window at the winter sky, pondering how on earth this will all turn out. I think a lot about ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,489,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,489,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Bonnie and Twill, and the pile of white wedding dresses downstairs, and if Thread will figure out how I got back ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,489,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,489,4,0","type":4,"elements":"in and arrest me. It's funny, because he could just arrest me, anyway, based on past crimes, but maybe he has ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,489,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,489,5,0","type":4,"elements":"to have something really irrefutable to do it, now that I'm a victor. And I wonder if President Snow's in contact ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,489,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,489,6,0","type":4,"elements":"with Thread. I think it's unlikely he ever acknowledged that old Cray existed, but now that I'm such a nationwide ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,489,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,489,7,0","type":4,"elements":"problem, is he carefully instructing Thread what to do? Or is Thread acting on his own? At any rate, I'm sure ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,489,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,489,8,0","type":4,"elements":"they'd both agree on keeping me locked up","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,490","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,490,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,490,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,491","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,491,0","typ