 Peeta comes by every day ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,493,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,493,6,0","type":4,"elements":"to bring me cheese buns and begins to help me work on","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,494","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,494,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,494,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the family book. It's an old thing, made of parchment and leather. Some herbalist on my mother's side of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,494,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,494,1,0","type":4,"elements":"family started it ages ago. The book's composed of page after page of ink drawings of plants with descriptions ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,494,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,494,2,0","type":4,"elements":"of their medical uses. My father added a section on edible plants that was my guidebook to keeping us alive ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,494,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,494,3,0","type":4,"elements":"after his death. For a long time, I've wanted to record my own knowledge in it. Things I learned from experience ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,494,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,494,4,0","type":4,"elements":"or from Gale, and then the information I picked up when I was training for the Games. I didn't because I'm no ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,494,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,494,5,0","type":4,"elements":"artist and it's so crucial that the pictures are drawn in exact detail. That's where Peeta comes in. Some of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,494,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,494,6,0","type":4,"elements":"plants he knows already, others we have dried samples of, and others I have to describe. He makes sketches ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,494,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,494,7,0","type":4,"elements":"on scrap paper until I'm satisfied they're right, then I let him draw them in the book. After that, I carefully print all I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,494,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,494,8,0","type":4,"elements":"know about the plant. It's quiet, absorbing work that","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,495","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,495,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,495,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,496","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,496,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,496,0,0","type":4,"elements":"helps take my mind off my troubles. I like to watch his hands as he works, making a blank page bloom with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,496,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,496,1,0","type":4,"elements":"strokes of ink, adding touches of color to our previously black and yellowish book. His face takes on a special ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,496,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,496,2,0","type":4,"elements":"look when he concentrates. His usual easy expression is replaced by something more intense and removed ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,496,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,496,3,0","type":4,"elements":"that suggests an entire world locked away inside him. I've seen flashes of this before: in the arena, or when he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,496,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,496,4,0","type":4,"elements":"speaks to a crowd, or that time he shoved the Peacekeepers' guns away from me in District 11. I don't know ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,496,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,496,5,0","type":4,"elements":