uding clips from seventy-four years of Hunger Games -- is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,496,14","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,496,14,0","type":4,"elements":"so odious. But now I'm looking for something special. The mockingjay that Bonnie and Twill are basing all their ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,496,15","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,496,15,0","type":4,"elements":"hopes on. I know it's probably foolishness, but if it is, I want to rule it out. And erase the idea of a thriving District ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,496,16","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,496,16,0","type":4,"elements":"13 from my","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,497","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,497,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,497,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,498","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,498,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,498,0,0","type":4,"elements":"mind for good. My first sighting is in a news story referencing the Dark Days. I see the smoldering remains of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,498,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,498,1,0","type":4,"elements":"the Justice Building in District 13 and just catch the black-and-white underside of a mockingjay's wing as it flies ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,498,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,498,2,0","type":4,"elements":"across the upper right-hand corner. That doesn't prove anything, really. It's just an old shot that goes with an old ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,498,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,498,3,0","type":4,"elements":"tale. However, several days later, something else grabs my attention. The main newscaster is reading a piece ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},