one nothing to subdue the hysteria rising up","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,536","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,536,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,536,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,537","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,537,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,537,0,0","type":4,"elements":"inside me. It will drown me unless it's released. I ball up the front of my shirt, stuff it into my mouth, and begin to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,537,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,537,1,0","type":4,"elements":"scream. How long this continues, I don't know. But when I stop, my voice is almost gone. I curl up on my side ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,537,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,537,2,0","type":4,"elements":"and stare at the patches of moonlight on the cement floor. Back in the arena. Back in the place of nightmares. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,537,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,537,3,0","type":4,"elements":"That's where I am","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,538","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,538,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,538,0,0","type":4,"elements":"going. I have to admit I didn't see it coming. I saw a multitude of other things. Being publicly humiliated, tortured, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,538,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,538,1,0","type":4,"elements":"and executed. Fleeing through the wilderness, pursued by Peacekeepers and hovercraft. Marriage to Peeta ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,538,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,538,2,0","type":4,"elements":"with our children forced into the arena. But never that I myself would have to be a player in the Games again. ","format_id":"93e3