asing you.\" \"No, they're laughing at me, and so are you!\" I say. \"No.\" Peeta shakes his head, but ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,671,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,671,2,0","type":4,"elements":"he's still suppressing a smile. I'm seriously rethinking the question of who should get out of these Games alive ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,671,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,671,3,0","type":4,"elements":"when the other elevator opens. Haymitch and Effie join us, looking pleased","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,672","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,672,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,672,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,673","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,673,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,673,0,0","type":4,"elements":"about something. Then Haymitch's face grows hard. What did I do now? I almost say, but I see he's staring ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,673,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,673,1,0","type":4,"elements":"behind me at the entrance to the dining room. Effie blinks in the same direction, then says brightly, \"Looks like ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,673,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,673,2,0","type":4,"elements":"they've got you a matched set this year.\" I turn around and find the redheaded Avox girl who tended to me last ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,673,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,673,3,0","type":4,"elements":"year until the Games began. I think how nice it is to have a friend here. I notice that the young man beside her, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,673,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,673,4,0","type":4,"elements":"another Avox, also has red hair. That must be what Effie meant by a matched set. Then a chill runs through me. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,673,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,673,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Because I know him, too. Not from the Capitol but from years of having easy conversations in the Hob, joking ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,673,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,673,6,0","type":4,"elements":"over Greasy Sae's soup, and that last day watching him lie unconscious in the square while the life bled out of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,673,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,673,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Gale. Our new Avox is Darius. Haymitch grips my wrist as if anticipating my next move, but I am as speechless ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,673,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,673,8,0","type":4,"elements":"as the Capitol's torturers have","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,674","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,674,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,674,0,0","type":4,"elements":"rendered Darius. Haymitch once told me they did something to Avoxes' tongues so they could never talk again. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,674,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,674,1,0","type":4,"elements":"In my head I hear Darius's voice, playful and bright, ringing across the Hob to tease me. Not as my fellow ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,674,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,674,2,0","type":4,"elements":"victors make fun of me now, but because we genuinely liked each other. If Gale could see him ... I know any ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,674,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,674,3,0","type":4,"elements":"move I would make toward Darius, any act of recognition, would only result in punishment for him. So we just ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,674,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,674,4,0","type":4,"elements":"stare into each other's eyes. Darius, now a mute slave; me, now headed to death. What would we say, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,674,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,674,5,0","type":4,"elements":"anyway? That we're sorry for the other's lot? That we ache for the other's pain? That we're glad we had the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,674,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,674,6,0","type":4,"elements":"chance to know each other? No, Darius shouldn't be glad he knew me. If I had been there to stop Thread, he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,674,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,674,7,0","type":4,"elements":"wouldn't have stepped forward to save Gale. Wouldn't be an Avox. And more specifically, wouldn't be my Avox, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,674,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,674,8,0","type":4,"elements":"because President Snow has so obviously had him placed here for my","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,675","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,675,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,675,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,676","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,676,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,676,0,0","type":4,"elements":"benefit. I twist my wrist from Haymitch's grasp and head down to my old bedroom, locking the door behind me. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,676,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,676,1,0","type":4,"elements":"sit on the side of my bed, elbows on my knees, forehead on my fists, and watch my glowing suit in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,676,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,676,2,0","type":4,"elements":"darkness, imagining I am in my old home in District 12, huddled beside the fire. It slowly fades back to black as ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,676,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,676,3,0","type":4,"elements":"the power pack dies out. When Effie eventually knocks on the door to summon me to dinner, I get up and take ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,676,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,676,4,0","type":4,"elements":"off my suit, fold it neatly, and set it on the table with my crown. In the bathroom, I wash the dark streaks of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,676,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,676,5,0","type":4,"elements":"makeup from my face. I dress in a simple shirt and pants and go down the hall to the dining room. I'm not aware ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,676,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,676,6,0","type":4,"elements":"of much at dinner except that","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,677","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,677,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,677,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,678","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,678,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,678,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Darius and the redheaded Avox girl are our servers. Effie, Haymitch, Cinna, Portia, and Peeta are all there, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,678,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,678,1,0","type":4,"elements":"talking about the opening ceremonies, I suppose. But the only time","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,679","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,679,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,679,0,0","type":4,"elements":"I really feel present is when I purposely knock a dish of peas to the floor and, before anyone can stop me, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,679,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,679,1,0","type":4,"elements":"crouch down to clean them up. Darius is right by me when I send the dish over, and we two are briefly side by ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,679,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,679,2,0","type":4,"elements":"side, obscured from view, as we scoop up the peas. For just one moment our hands meet. I can feel his skin, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,679,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,679,3,0","type":4,"elements":"rough under the buttery sauce from the dish. In the tight, desperate clench of our fingers are all the words we ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,679,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,679,4,0","type":4,"elements":"will never be able to say. Then Effie's clucking at me from behind about how \"That isn't your job, Katniss!\" and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,679,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,679,5,0","type":4,"elements":"he lets go. When we go in to watch the recap of the opening ceremonies, I wedge myself in between Cinna and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,679,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,679,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Haymitch on the couch because I don't want to be next to Peeta. This awfulness with Darius belongs to me ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,679,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,679,7,0","type":4,"elements":"and Gale and maybe even Haymitch, but not to Peeta. He might've known Darius to nod hello, but Peeta ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,679,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,679,8,0","type":4,"elements":"wasn't Hob the way the rest of us were. Besides, I'm still angry with him for","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,680","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,680,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,680,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,681","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,681,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,681,0,0","type":4,"elements":"laughing at me along with the other victors, and the last thing I want is his sympathy and comfort. I haven't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,681,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,681,1,0","type":4,"elements":"changed my mind about saving him in the arena, but I don't owe him more than that. As I watch the procession ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,681,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,681,2,0","type":4,"elements":"to the City Circle, I think how it's bad enough that they dress us all up in costumes and parade us through the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,681,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,681,3,0","type":4,"elements":"streets in chariots on a regular year. Kids in costumes are silly, but aging victors, it turns out, are pitiful. A few ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,681,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,681,4,0","type":4,"elements":"who are on the younger side, like Johanna and Finnick, or whose bodies haven't fallen into disrepair, like ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,681,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,681,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Seeder and Brutus, can still manage to maintain a little dignity. But the majority, who are in the clutches of drink ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,681,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,681,6,0","type":4,"elements":"or morphling or illness, look grotesque in their costumes, depicting cows and trees and loaves of bread. Last ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,681,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,681,7,0","type":4,"elements":"year we chattered away about each contestant, but tonight there's only the occasional comment. Small wonder ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,681,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,681,8,0","type":4,"elements":"the crowd goes wild when Peeta and I appear,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,682","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,682,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,682,0,0","type":4,"elements":"looking so young and strong and beautiful in our brilliant costumes. The very image of what tributes should be. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,682,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,682,1,0","type":4,"elements":"As soon as it's over, I stand up and thank Cinna and Portia for their amazing work and head off to bed. Effie ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,682,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,682,2,0","type":4,"elements":"calls a reminder to meet early for breakfast to work out our training strategy, but even her voice sounds hollow. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,682,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,682,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Poor Effie. She finally had a decent year in the Games with Peeta and me, and now it's all broken down into a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,682,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,682,4,0","type":4,"elements":"mess that even she can't put a positive spin on. In Capitol terms, I'm guessing this counts as a true tragedy. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,682,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,682,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Soon after I go to bed, there's a quiet knock on my door, but I ignore it. I don't want Peeta tonight. Especially not ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,682,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,682,6,0","type":4,"elements":"with Darius around. It's almost as bad as if Gale were here. Gale. How am I supposed to let him go with Darius ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,682,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,682,7,0","type":4,"elements":"haunting the hallways? Tongues figure prominently in my nightmares. First I watch frozen and helpless while ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,682,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,682,8,0","type":4,"elements":"gloved hands carry out the bloody","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,683","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,683,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,683,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,684","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,684,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,684,0,0","type":4,"elements":"dissection in Darius's mouth. Then I'm at a party where everyone wears masks and someone with a flicking, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,684,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,684,1,0","type":4,"elements":"wet tongue, who I suppose is Finnick, stalks me, but when he catches me and pulls off his mask, it's President ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,684,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,684,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Snow, and his puffy lips are dripping in bloody saliva. Finally I'm back in the arena, my own tongue as dry as ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,684,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,684,3,0","type":4,"elements":"sandpaper, while I try to reach a pool of water that recedes every time I'm about to touch it. When I wake, I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,684,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,684,4,0","type":4,"elements":"stumble to the bathroom and gulp water from the faucet until I can hold no more. I strip off my sweaty clothes ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,684,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,684,5,0","type":4,"elements":"and fall back into bed, naked, and somehow find sleep again. I delay going down to breakfast as long as ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,684,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,684,6,0","type":4,"elements":"possible the next morning because I really don't want to discuss our training strategy. What's to discuss? Every ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,684,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,684,7,0","type":4,"elements":"victor already knows what everybody else can do. Or used to be able to do, anyway. So Peeta and I will ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,684,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,684,8,0","type":4,"elements":"continue to act in love and that's that. Somehow I'm just not up to talking","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,685","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,685,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,685,0,0","type":4,"elements":"about it, especially with Darius standing mutely by. I take a long shower, dress slowly in the outfit Cinna has left ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,685,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,685,1,0","type":4,"elements":"for training, and order food from the menu in my room by speaking into a mouthpiece. In a minute, sausage, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,685,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,685,2,0","type":4,"elements":"eggs, potatoes, bread, juice, and hot chocolate appear. I eat my fill, trying to drag out the minutes until ten ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,685,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,685,3,0","type":4,"elements":"o'clock, when we have to go down to the Training Center. By nine-thirty, Haymitch is pounding on my door, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,685,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,685,4,0","type":4,"elements":"obviously fed up with me, ordering me to the dining room NOW! Still, I brush my teeth before meandering down ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,685,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,685,5,0","type":4,"elements":"the hall, effectively killing another five minutes. The dining room's empty except for Peeta and Haymitch, whose ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,685,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,685,6,0","type":4,"elements":"face is flushed with drink and anger. On his wrist he wears a solid-gold bangle with a pattern of flames -- this ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,685,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,685,7,0","type":4,"elements":"must be his concession to Effie's matching-token plan -- that he twists unhappily. It's a very handsome bangle, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,685,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,685,8,0","type":4,"elements":"really, but the movement makes it seem","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,686","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,686,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,686,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,687","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,687,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,687,0,0","type":4,"elements":"like something confining, a shackle, rather than a piece of jewelry. \"You're late,\" he snarls at me. \"Sorry. I slept ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,687,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,687,1,0","type":4,"elements":"in after the mutilated-tongue nightmares kept me up half the night.\" I mean to sound hostile, but my voice ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,687,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,687,2,0","type":4,"elements":"catches at the end of the sentence. Haymitch gives me a scowl, then relents. \"All right, never mind. Today, in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,687,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,687,3,0","type":4,"elements":"training, you've got two jobs. One, stay in love.\" \"Obviously,\" I say. \"And two, make some friends,\" says ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,687,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,687,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Haymitch. \"No,\" I say. \"I don't trust any of them, I can't stand most of them, and I'd rather operate with just the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,687,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,687,5,0","type":4,"elements":"two of us.\" \"That's what I said at first, but--\" Peeta begins. \"But it won't be enough,\" Haymitch insists. \"You're ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,687,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,687,6,0","type":4,"elements":"going to need more allies this time around.\" \"Why?\" I ask. \"Because you're at a distinct disadvantage. Your ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,687,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,687,7,0","type":4,"elements":"competitors have known each other for years. So who do you think they're going to target first?\" he says. \"Us. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,687,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,687,8,0","type":4,"elements":"And nothing we're going to do is going to override any old","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,688","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,688,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,688,0,0","type":4,"elements":"friendship,\" I say. \"So why bother?\" \"Because you can fight. You're popular with the crowd. That could still make ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,688,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,688,1,0","type":4,"elements":"you desirable allies. But","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,689","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,689,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,689,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,690","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,690,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,690,0,0","type":4,"elements":"only if you let the others know you're willing to team up with them,\" says Haymitch. \"You mean you want us in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,690,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,690,1,0","type":4,"elements":"the Career pack this year?\" I ask, unable to hide my distaste. Traditionally the tributes from Districts 1, 2, and 4 ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,690,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,690,2,0","type":4,"elements":"join forces, possibly taking in a few other exceptional fighters, and hunt down the weaker competitors. \"That's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,690,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,690,3,0","type":4,"elements":"been our strategy, hasn't it? To train like Careers?\" counters Haymitch. \"And who makes up the Career pack is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,690,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,690,4,0","type":4,"elements":"generally agreed upon before the Games begin. Peeta barely got in with them last year.\" I think of the loathing I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,690,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,690,5,0","type":4,"elements":"felt when I discovered Peeta was with the Careers during the last Games. \"So we're to try to get in with Finnick ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,690,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,690,6,0","type":4,"elements":"and Brutus -- is that what you're","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,691","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,691,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,691,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-487