98d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,692,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,692,8,0","type":4,"elements":"down to the gym. None of the other victors will be showing up with a","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,693","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,693,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,693,0,0","type":4,"elements":"babysitter, and being the youngest, it's even more important we look self-reliant. So she has to satisfy herself ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,693,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,693,1,0","type":4,"elements":"with taking us to the elevator, fussing over our hair, and pushing the button for us. It's such a short ride that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,693,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,693,2,0","type":4,"elements":"there's no real time for conversation, but when Peeta takes my hand, I don't pull it away. I may have ignored ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,693,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,693,3,0","type":4,"elements":"him last night in private, but in training we must appear as an inseparable team. Effie needn't have worried ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,693,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,693,4,0","type":4,"elements":"about us being the last to arrive. Only Brutus and the woman from District 2, Enobaria, are present. Enobaria ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,693,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,693,5,0","type":4,"elements":"looks to be about thirty and all I can remember about her is that, in hand-to-hand combat, she killed one tribute ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,693,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,693,6,0","type":4,"elements":"by ripping open his throat with her teeth. She became so famous for this act that, after she was a victor, she ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,693,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,693,7,0","type":4,"elements":"had her teeth cosmetically altered so each one ends in a sharp point like a fang and is inlaid with gold. She has ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,693,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,693,8,0","type":4,"elements":"no shortage of admirers in the Capitol. By ten o'clock,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,694","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,694,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,694,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,695","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,695,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,695,0,0","type":4,"elements":"only about half of the tributes have shown up. Atala, the woman who runs training, begins her spiel right on ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,695,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,695,1,0","type":4,"elements":"time, unfazed by the poor attendance. Maybe she expected it. I'm sort of relieved, because that means there ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,695,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,695,2,0","type":4,"elements":"are a dozen people I don't have to pretend to make friends with. Atala runs through the list of stations, which ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,695,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,695,3,0","type":4,"elements":"include both combat and","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,696","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,696,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,696,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,697","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,697,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,697,0,0","type":4,"elements":"survival skills, and releases us to train. I tell Peeta I think we'd do best to split up, thus covering more territory. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,697,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,697,1,0","type":4,"elements":"When he goes off to chuck spears with Brutus and Chaff, I head over to the knot-tying station, hardly anyone ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,697,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,697,2,0","type":4,"elements":"ever bothers to visit it. I like the trainer and he remembers me fondly, maybe because I spent time with him last ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,697,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,697,3,0","type":4,"elements":"year. He's pleased when I show him I can still set the trap that leaves an enemy dangling by a leg from a tree. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,697,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,697,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Clearly he took note of","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,698","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,698,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,698,0,0","type":4,"elements":"my snares in the arena last year and now sees me as an advanced pupil, so I ask him to review every kind of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,698,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,698,1,0","type":4,"elements":"knot that might come in handy and a few that I'll probably never use. I'd be content to spend the morning alone ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,698,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,698,2,0","type":4,"elements":"with him, but after about an hour and a half, someone puts his arms around me from behind, his fingers easily ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,698,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,698,3,0","type":4,"elements":"finishing the complicated knot I've been sweating over. Of course it's Finnick, who seems to have spent his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,698,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,698,4,0","type":4,"elements":"childhood doing nothing but wielding tridents and manipulating ropes into fancy knots for nets, I guess. I watch ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,698,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,698,5,0","type":4,"elements":"for a minute while he picks up a length of rope, makes a noose, and then pretends to hang himself for my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,698,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,698,6,0","type":4,"elements":"amusement. Rolling my eyes, I head over to another vacant station where tributes can learn to build fires. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,698,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,698,7,0","type":4,"elements":"already make excellent fires, but I'm still pretty dependent on matches","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,699","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,699,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,699,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,700","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,700,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,700,0,0","type":4,"elements":"for starting them. So the trainer has me work with flint, steel, and some charred cloth. This is much harder than ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,700,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,700,1,0","type":4,"elements":"it looks, and even working as intently as I can, it takes me about an hour to get a fire going. I look up with a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,700,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,700,2,0","type":4,"elements":"triumphant smile only to find I have company. The two tributes from District 3 are beside me, struggling to start a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,700,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,700,3,0","type":4,"elements":"decent fire with matches. I think about leaving, but I really want to try using the flint again, and if I have to report ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,700,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,700,4,0","type":4,"elements":"back to Haymitch that I tried to make friends, these two might be a bearable choice. Both are small in stature ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,700,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,700,5,0","type":4,"elements":"with ashen skin and black hair. The woman, Wiress, is probably around my mother's age and speaks in a quiet, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,700,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,700,6,0","type":4,"elements":"intelligent voice. But right away I notice she has a habit of dropping off her words in mid- sentence, as if she's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,700,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,700,7,0","type":4,"elements":"forgotten you're there. Beetee, the man, is older and somewhat fidgety. He wears glasses but spends a lot of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,700,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,700,8,0","type":4,"elements":"time looking under them. They're a little strange, but I'm pretty","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,701","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,701,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,701,0,0","type":4,"elements":"sure neither of them is going to try to make me uncomfortable by stripping naked. And they're from District 3. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,701,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,701,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Maybe they can even confirm my suspicions of an uprising there. I glance around the Training Center. Peeta is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,701,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,701,2,0","type":4,"elements":"at the center of a ribald circle of knife throwers. The morphlings from District 6 are in the camouflage station, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,701,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,701,3,0","type":4,"elements":"painting each other's faces with bright pink swirls. The male tribute from District 5 is vomiting wine on the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,701,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,701,4,0","type":4,"elements":"sword-fighting floor. Finnick and the old woman from his district are using the archery station. Johanna Mason ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,701,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,701,5,0","type":4,"elements":"is naked again and oiling her skin down for a wrestling lesson. I decide to stay put. Wiress and Beetee make ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,701,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,701,6,0","type":4,"elements":"decent company. They seem friendly enough but don't pry. We talk about our talents; they tell me they both ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,701,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,701,7,0","type":4,"elements":"invent things, which makes my supposed interest in fashion seem pretty weak. Wiress brings up some sort of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,701,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,701,8,0","type":4,"elements":"stitching device she's working on. \"It senses","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,702","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,702,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,702,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,703","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,703,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,703,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the density of the fabric and selects the strength,\" she says, and then becomes absorbed in a bit of dry straw ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,703,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,703,1,0","type":4,"elements":"before she can go on. \"The strength of the thread,\" Beetee finishes explaining. \"Automatically. It rules out ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,703,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,703,2,0","type":4,"elements":"human error.\" Then he talks about his recent success creating a musical chip that's tiny enough to be ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,703,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,703,3,0","type":4,"elements":"concealed in a flake of glitter but can hold hours of songs. I remember Octavia talking about this during the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,703,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,703,4,0","type":4,"elements":"wedding shoot, and I see a possible chance to allude to the uprising. \"Oh, yeah. My prep team was all upset a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,703,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,703,5,0","type":4,"elements":"few months ago, I think, because they couldn't get hold of that,\" I say casually. \"I guess a lot of orders from ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,703,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,703,6,0","type":4,"elements":"District Three were getting backed up.\" Beetee examines me under his glasses. \"Yes. Did you have any similar ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,703,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,703,7,0","type":4,"elements":"backups in coal production, this year?\" he asks. \"No. Well, we lost a couple of weeks when they brought in a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,703,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,703,8,0","type":4,"elements":"new Head Peacekeeper and his crew, but nothing major,\" I say. \"To production, I mean. Two","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,704","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,704,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,704,0,0","type":4,"elements":"weeks sitting around your house doing nothing just means two weeks of being hungry for most people.\" I think","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,705","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,705,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,705,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,706","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,706,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,706,0,0","type":4,"elements":"they understand what I'm trying to say. That we've had no uprising. \"Oh. That's a shame,\" says Wiress in a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,706,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,706,1,0","type":4,"elements":"slightly disappointed voice. \"I found your district very ...\" She trails off, distracted by something in her head. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,706,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,706,2,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Interesting,\" fills in Beetee. \"We both did.\" I feel bad, knowing that their district must have suffered much worse ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,706,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,706,3,0","type":4,"elements":"than ours. I feel I have to defend my people. \"Well, there aren't very many of us in Twelve,\" I say. \"Not that you'd ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,706,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,706,4,0","type":4,"elements":"know it nowadays by the size of the Peacekeeping force. But I guess we're interesting enough.\" As we move ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,706,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,706,5,0","type":4,"elements":"over to the shelter station, Wiress stops and gazes up at the stands where the Gamemakers are roaming ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,706,6","type":3,"element