se who use their brains to find ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,732,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,732,8,0","type":4,"elements":"amusing ways to kill us. To make them realize that while","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,733","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,733,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,733,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,734","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,734,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,734,0,0","type":4,"elements":"we're vulnerable to the Capitol's cruelties, they are as well. Do you have any idea how much I hate you? I think. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,734,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,734,1,0","type":4,"elements":"You, who have given your talents to the Games? I try to catch Plutarch Heavensbee's eye, but he seems to be ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,734,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,734,2,0","type":4,"elements":"intentionally ignoring me, as he has the entire training period. I remember how he sought me out for a dance, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,734,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,734,3,0","type":4,"elements":"how pleased he was to show me the mockingjay on his watch. His friendly manner has no place here. How ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,734,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,734,4,0","type":4,"elements":"could it, when I'm a mere tribute and he's the Head Gamemaker? So powerful, so removed, so safe ... ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,734,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,734,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Suddenly I know just what I'm going to do. Something that will blow anything Peeta did right out of the water. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,734,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,734,6,0","type":4,"elements":"go over to the knot-tying station and get a length of rope. I start to manipulate it, but it's hard because I've never ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,734,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,734,7,0","type":4,"elements":"made this actual knot","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,735","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,735,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,735,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,736","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,736,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,736,0,0","type":4,"elements":"myself. I've only watched Finnick's clever fingers, and","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,737","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,737,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,737,0,0","type":4,"elements":"they moved so fast. After about ten minutes, I've come up with a respectable noose. I drag one of the target ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,737,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,737,1,0","type":4,"elements":"dummies out into the middle of the room and, using some chinning bars, hang it so it dangles by the neck. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,737,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,737,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Tying its hands behind its back would be a nice touch, but I think I might be running out of time. I hurry over to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,737,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,737,3,0","type":4,"elements":"the camouflage station, where some of the other tributes, undoubtedly the morphlings, have made a colossal ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,737,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,737,4,0","type":4,"elements":"mess. But I find a partial container of bloodred berry juice that will serve my needs. The flesh-colored fabric of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,737,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,737,5,0","type":4,"elements":"the dummy's skin makes a good, absorbent canvas. I carefully finger paint the words on its body, concealing ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,737,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,737,6,0","type":4,"elements":"them from view. Then I step away quickly to watch the reaction on the Gamemakers' faces as they read the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,737,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,737,7,0","type":4,"elements":"name on the dummy. SENECA CRANE. The effect on the Gamemakers is immediate and satisfying. Several let ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,737,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,737,8,0","type":4,"elements":"out small shrieks. Others lose their grips on their wineglasses,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,738","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,738,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,738,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,739","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,739,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,739,0,0","type":4,"elements":"which shatter musically against the ground. Two seem to be considering fainting. The look of shock is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,739,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,739,1,0","type":4,"elements":"unanimous. Now I have Plutarch Heavensbee's attention. He stares steadily at me as the juice from the peach ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,739,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,739,2,0","type":4,"elements":"he crushed in his hand runs through his fingers. Finally he clears his throat and says, \"You may go now, Miss ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,739,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,739,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Everdeen.\" I give a respectful nod and turn to go, but at the last moment I can't resist tossing the container of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,739,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,739,4,0","type":4,"elements":"berry juice over my shoulder. I can hear the contents splatter against the dummy while a couple more ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,739,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,739,5,0","type":4,"elements":"wineglasses break. As the elevator doors close before me, I see no one has moved. That surprised them, I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,739,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,739,6,0","type":4,"elements":"think. It was rash and dangerous and no doubt I will pay for it ten times over. But for the moment, I feel ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,739,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,739,7,0","type":4,"elements":"something close to elation and I let myself savor it. I want to find Haymitch immediately and tell him about my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,739,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,739,8,0","type":4,"elements":"session, but no one's around. I guess they're getting ready for dinner and I decide","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,740","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,740,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,740,0,0","type":4,"elements":"to go take a shower myself, since my hands are stained from the juice. As I stand in the water, I begin to wonder ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,740,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,740,1,0","type":4,"elements":"about the wisdom of my latest trick. The question that should now always be my guide is \"Will this help Peeta ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,740,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,740,2,0","type":4,"elements":"stay alive?\" Indirectly, this might not. What happens in training is highly secretive, so there's no point in taking ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,740,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,740,3,0","type":4,"elements":"action against me when no one will know what my transgression was. In fact, last year I was rewarded for my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,740,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,740,4,0","type":4,"elements":"brashness. This is a different sort of crime, though. If the Gamemakers are angry with me and decide to punish ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,740,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,740,5,0","type":4,"elements":"me in the arena, Peeta could get caught up in the attack as well. Maybe it was too impulsive. Still ... I can't say ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,740,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,740,6,0","type":4,"elements":"I'm sorry I did it. As we all gather for dinner, I notice Peeta's hands are faintly stained with a variety of colors, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,740,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,740,7,0","type":4,"elements":"even though his hair is still damp from bathing. He must have done some form of camouflage after all. Once the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,740,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,740,8,0","type":4,"elements":"soup is served, Haymitch gets right to the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,741","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,741,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,741,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,742","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,742,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,742,0,0","type":4,"elements":"issue on everyone's mind. \"All right, so how did your private sessions go?\" I exchange a look","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,743","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,743,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,743,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,744","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,744,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,744,0,0","type":4,"elements":"with Peeta. Somehow I'm not that eager to put what I did into words. In the calm of the dining room, it seems ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,744,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,744,1,0","type":4,"elements":"very extreme. \"You first,\" I say to him. \"It must have been really special. I had to wait for forty minutes to go in.\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,744,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,744,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta seems to be struck with the same reluctance I'm experiencing. \"Well, I -- I did the camouflage thing, like ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,744,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,744,3,0","type":4,"elements":"you suggested, Katniss.\" He hesitates. \"Not exactly camouflage. I mean, I used the dyes.\" \"To do what?\" asks ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,744,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,744,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Portia. I think of how ruffled the Gamemakers were when I entered the gym for my session. The smell of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,744,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,744,5,0","type":4,"elements":"cleaners. The mat pulled over that spot in the center of the gym. Was it to conceal something they were unable ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,744,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,744,6,0","type":4,"elements":"to wash away? \"You painted something, didn't you? A picture.\" \"Did you see it?\" Peeta asks. \"No. But they'd","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,745","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,745,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,745,0,0","type":4,"elements":"made a real point of covering it up,\" I say. \"Well, that would be standard. They can't let one tribute know what ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,745,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,745,1,0","type":4,"elements":"another did,\" says Effie, unconcerned. \"What did you paint, Peeta?\" She looks a little misty. \"Was it a picture of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,745,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,745,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Katniss?\" \"Why would he paint a picture of me, Effie?\" I ask, somehow annoyed. \"To show he's going to do ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,745,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,745,3,0","type":4,"elements":"everything he can to defend you. That's what everyone in the Capitol's expecting, anyway. Didn't he volunteer ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,745,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,745,4,0","type":4,"elements":"to go in with you?\" Effie says, as if it's the most obvious thing in the world. \"Actually, I painted a picture of Rue,\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,745,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,745,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta says. \"How she looked after Katniss had covered her in flowers.\" There's a long pause at the table while ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,745,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,745,6,0","type":4,"elements":"everyone absorbs this. \"And what exactly were you trying to accomplish?\" Haymitch asks in a very measured ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,745,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,745,7,0","type":4,"elements":"voice. \"I'm not sure. I just wanted to hold them accountable, if only for a moment,\" says Peeta. \"For killing that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,745,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,745,8,0","type":4,"elements":"little girl.\" \"This is dreadful.\" Effie sounds like she's about","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,746","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,746,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,746,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,747","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,747,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,747,0,0","type":4,"elements":"to cry. \"That sort of thinking ... it's forbidden, Peeta. Absolutely. You'll only bring down more trouble on yourself ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,747,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,747,1,0","type":4,"elements":"and Katniss.\" \"I have to agree with Effie on this one,\" says Haymitch. Portia and Cinna remain silent, but their ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,747,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,747,2,0","type":4,"elements":"faces are very serious. Of course, they're right. But even though it worries me, I think what he did was amazing. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,747,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,747,3,0","type":4,"elements":"\"I guess this is a bad time to mention I hung a dummy and painted Seneca Crane's name on it,\" I say. This has ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,747,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,747,4,0","type":4,"elements":"the desired effect. After a moment of disbelief, all the disapproval in the room hits me like a ton of bricks. \"You ... ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,747,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,747,5,0","type":4,"elements":"hung ... Seneca Crane?\" says Cinna. \"Yes. I was showing off my new knot-tying skills, and he somehow ended ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,747,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,747,6,0","type":4,"elements":"up at the end of the noose,\" I say. \"Oh, Katniss,\" says Effie in a hushed voice. \"How do you even know about ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,747,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,747,7,0","type":4,"elements":"that?\" \"Is it a secret? President Snow didn't act like it was. In fact, he seemed eager for me to know,\" I say. Effie ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,747,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,747,8,0","type":4,"elements":"leaves the table with her napkin pressed to her face.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,748","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,748,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,748,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Now I've upset Effie. I should have lied and said I shot some arrows.\" \"You'd have thought we planned it,\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,748,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,748,1,0","type":4,"elements":"says Peeta, giving me just the hint of a smile. \"Didn't you?\" asks Portia. Her fingers press her eyelids closed as ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,748,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,748,2,0","type":4,"elements":"if she's warding off a very","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,749","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,749,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,749,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,750","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,750,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,750,0,0","type":4,"elements":"bright light. \"No,\" I say, looking at Peeta with a new sense of appreciation. \"Neither of us even knew what we ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,750,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,750,1,0","type":4,"elements":"were going to do before we went in.\" \"And, Haymitch?\" says Peeta. \"We decided we don't want any other allies ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,750,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,750,2,0","type":4,"elements":"in the arena.\" \"Good. Then I won't be responsible for you killing off any of my friends with your stupidity,\" he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,750,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,750,3,0","type":4,"elements":"says. \"That's just what we were thinking,\" I tell him. We finish the meal in silence, but when we rise to go into ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,750,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,750,4,0","type":4,"elements":"the sitting room, Cinna puts his arm around me and gives me a squeeze. \"Come on and let's go get those ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,750,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,750,5,0","type":4,"elements":"training scores.\" We gather around the television set","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,751","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,751,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,751,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,752","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,752,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,752,0,0","type":4,"elements":"and a red-eyed Effie rejoins us. The tributes' faces come up, district by district, and their scores flash under ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,752,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,752,1,0","type":4,"elements":"their pictures. One through twelve. Predictably high scores for Cashmere, Gloss, Brutus, Enobaria, and Finnick. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,752,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,752,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Low to medium for the rest. \"Have they ever given a zero?\" I ask. \"No, but there's a first time for everything,\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,752,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,752,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Cinna answers. And it turns out he's right. Because when Peeta and I each pull a twelve, we make Hunger ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,752,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,752,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Games history. No one feels like celebrating, though. \"Why did they do that?\" I ask. \"So that the others will have ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,752,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,752,5,0","type":4,"elements":"no choice but to target you,\" says Haymitch flatly. \"Go to bed. I can't stand to look at either one of you.\" Peeta ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,752,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,752,6,0","type":4,"elements":"walks me down to my room in silence, but before he can say good night, I wrap my arms around him and rest ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,752,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,752,7,0","type":4,"elements":"my head against his chest. His hands slide up my back and his cheek leans against my hair. \"I'm sorry if I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,752,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,752,8,0","type":4,"elements":"made things worse,\" I say. \"No worse than I did. Why did you do it,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,753","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,753,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,753,0,0","type":4,"elements":"anyway?\" he says. \"I don't know. To show them that I'm more than just a piece in their Games?\" I say. He ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,753,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,753,1,0","type":4,"elements":"laughs a little, no doubt remembering the night before the Games last year. We were on the roof, neither of us ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,753,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,753,2,0","type":4,"elements":"able to sleep. Peeta had said something of the sort then, but I hadn't understood what he meant. Now I do. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,753,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,753,3,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Me, too,\" he tells me. \"And I'm not saying I'm not going to try. To get you home, I mean. But if I'm perfectly ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,753,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,753,4,0","type":4,"elements":"honest about it ...\" \"If you're perfectly honest about it, you think President Snow has probably given them direct ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,753,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,753,5,0","type":4,"elements":"orders to make sure we die in the arena anyway,\" I say. \"It's crossed my mind,\" says Peeta. It's crossed my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,753,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,753,6,0","type":4,"elements":"mind, too. Repeatedly. But while I know I'll never leave that arena alive, I'm still holding on to the hope that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,753,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,753,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta will. After all, he didn't pull out those berries, I did. No one has ever doubted that Peeta's defiance was ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,753,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,753,8,0","type":4,"elements":"motivated by love. So maybe President Snow will prefer keeping him alive, crushed","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,754","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,754,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,754,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,755","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,755,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,755,0,0","type":4,"elements":"and heartbroken, as a living warning to others. \"But even if that happens, everyone will know we've gone out ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,755,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,755,1,0","type":4,"elements":"fighting, right?\" Peeta asks. \"Everyone will,\" I reply. And for the first time, I distance myself from the personal ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,755,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,755,2,0","type":4,"elements":"tragedy that has consumed me since they announced the Quell. I remember the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,756","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,756,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,756,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,757","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,757,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,757,0,0","type":4,"elements":"old man they shot in District 11, and Bonnie and Twill, and the rumored uprisings. Yes, everyone in the districts ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,757,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,757,1,0","type":4,"elements":"will be watching me to see how I handle this death sentence, this final act of President Snow's dominance. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,757,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,757,2,0","type":4,"elements":"They will be looking for some sign that their battles have not been in vain. If I can make it clear that I'm still ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,757,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,757,3,0","type":4,"elements":"defying the Capitol right up to the end, the Capitol will have killed me ... but not my spirit. What better way to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,757,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,757,4,0","type":4,"elements":"give hope to the rebels? The beauty of this idea is that my decision to keep Peeta alive at","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,758","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,758,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,758,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the expense of my own life is itself an act of defiance. A refusal to play the Hunger Games by the Capitol's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,758,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,758,1,0","type":4,"elements":"rules. My private agenda dovetails completely with my public one. And if I really could save Peeta ... in terms of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,758,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,758,2,0","type":4,"elements":"a revolution, this would be ideal. Because I will be more valuable dead. They can turn me into some kind of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,758,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,758,3,0","type":4,"elements":"martyr for the cause and paint my face on banners, and it will do more to rally people than anything I could do if ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,758,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,758,4,0","type":4,"elements":"I was living. But Peeta would be more valuable alive, and tragic, because he will be able to turn his pain into ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,758,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,758,5,0","type":4,"elements":"words that will transform people. Peeta would lose it if he knew I was thinking any of this, so I only say, \"So ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,758,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,758,6,0","type":4,"elements":"what should we do with our last few days?\" \"I just want to spend every possible minute of the rest of my life with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,758,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,758,7,0","type":4,"elements":"you,\" Peeta replies. \"Come on, then,\" I say, pulling him into my room. It feels like such a luxury, sleeping with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,758,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,758,8,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta again. I didn't realize until now how starved I've been for","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,759","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,759,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,759,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,760","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,760,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,760,0,0","type":4,"elements":"human closeness. For the feel of him beside me in the darkness. I wish I hadn't wasted the last couple of nights ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,760,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,760,1,0","type":4,"elements":"shutting him out. I sink down into sleep, enveloped in his warmth, and when I open my eyes again, daylight's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,760,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,760,2,0","type":4,"elements":"streaming through the windows. \"No nightmares,\" he says. \"No nightmares,\" I confirm. \"You?\" \"None. I'd ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,760,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,760,3,0","type":4,"elements":"forgotten what a real night's sleep feels like,\" he says. We lie there for a while, in no rush to begin the day. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,760,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,760,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Tomorrow night will be the televised interview, so today Effie and Haymitch should be coaching us. More high ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,760,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,760,5,0","type":4,"elements":"heels and sarcastic comments, I think. But then the redheaded Avox girl comes in with a note from Effie saying ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,760,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,760,6,0","type":4,"elements":"that, given our recent tour, both she and Haymitch have agreed we can handle ourselves adequately in public. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,760,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,760,7,0","type":4,"elements":"The coaching sessions have been canceled. \"Really?\" says Peeta, taking the note from my hand and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,760,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,760,8,0","type":4,"elements":"examining it. \"Do you know what this means? We'll have the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,761","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,761,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,761,0,0","type":4,"elements":"whole day to ourselves.\" \"It's too bad we can't go somewhere,\" I say wistfully. \"Who says we can't?\" he asks. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,761,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,761,1,0","type":4,"elements":"The roof. We order a bunch of food, grab some blankets, and head up to the roof for a picnic. A daylong picnic ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,761,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,761,2,0","type":4,"elements":"in the flower garden that tinkles with wind chimes. We eat. We lie in the sun. I snap off hanging vines and use ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,761,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,761,3,0","type":4,"elements":"my newfound knowledge from training to practice knots and weave nets. Peeta sketches me. We make up a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,761,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,761,4,0","type":4,"elements":"game with the force field that surrounds the roof--one of us throws an apple into it and the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,762","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,762,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,762,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,763","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,763,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,763,0,0","type":4,"elements":"other person has to catch it. No one bothers us. By late afternoon, I lie with my head on Peeta's lap, making a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,763,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,763,1,0","type":4,"elements":"crown of flowers while he fiddles with my hair, claiming he's practicing his knots. After a while, his hands go still. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,763,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,763,2,0","type":4,"elements":"\"What?\" I ask. \"I wish I could freeze this moment, right here, right","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,764","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,764,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,764,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,765","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,765,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,765,0,0","type":4,"elements":"now, and live in it forever,\" he says. Usually this sort of comment, the kind that hints of his undying love for me, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,765,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,765,1,0","type":4,"elements":"makes me feel guilty and awful. But I feel so warm and relaxed and beyond worrying about a future I'll never ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,765,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,765,2,0","type":4,"elements":"have, I just let the word slip out. \"Okay.\" I can hear the smile in his voice. \"Then you'll allow it?\" \"I'll allow it,\" I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,765,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,765,3,0","type":4,"elements":"say. His fingers go back to my hair and I doze off, but he rouses me to see the sunset. It's a spectacular yellow ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,765,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,765,4,0","type":4,"elements":"and orange blaze behind the skyline of the Capitol. \"I didn't think you'd want to miss it,\" he says. \"Thanks,\" I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,765,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,765,5,0","type":4,"elements":"say. Because I can count on my fingers the number of sunsets I have left, and I don't want to miss any of them. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,765,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,765,6,0","type":4,"elements":"We don't go and join the others for dinner, and no one summons us. \"I'm glad. I'm tired of making everyone ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,765,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,765,7,0","type":4,"elements":"around me so miserable,\" says Peeta. \"Everybody crying. Or Haymitch ...\" He doesn't need to go on. We stay ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,765,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,765,8,0","type":4,"elements":"on the roof until bedtime and then quietly slip down to my room","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,766","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,766,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,766,0,0","type":4,"elements":"without encountering anyone. The next morning, we're roused by my prep team. The sight of Peeta and me ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,766,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,766,1,0","type":4,"elements":"sleeping together is too much for Octavia, because she bursts into tears right away. \"You remember what Cinna ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,766,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,766,2,0","type":4,"elements":"told us,\" Venia says fiercely. Octavia nods and goes out sobbing. Peeta has to return to his room for prep, and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,766,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,766,3,0","type":4,"elements":"I'm left alone with Venia and Flavius. The usual chatter has been suspended. In fact, there's little talk at all, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,766,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,766,4,0","type":4,"elements":"other than to have me raise my chin or comment on a makeup technique. It's nearly lunch when I feel ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,766,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,766,5,0","type":4,"elements":"something dripping on my shoulder and turn to find Flavius, who's snipping away at my hair with silent tears ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,766,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,766,6,0","type":4,"elements":"running down his face. Venia gives him a look, and he gently sets the scissors on the table and leaves. Then ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,766,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,766,7,0","type":4,"elements":"it's just Venia, whose skin is so pale her tattoos appear to be leaping off it. Almost rigid with determination, she ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,766,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,766,8,0","type":4,"elements":"does my hair and nails and makeup, fingers flying swiftly to compensate for her","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,767","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,767,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,767,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,768","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,768,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,768,0,0","type":4,"elements":"absent teammates. The whole time, she avoids my gaze. It's only when Cinna shows up to approve me and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,768,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,768,1,0","type":4,"elements":"dismiss her that she takes my hands, looks me straight in the eye, and says, \"We would all like you to know ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,768,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,768,2,0","type":4,"elements":"what a ... privilege it has been to make you look your best.\" Then she hastens from the room. My prep team. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,768,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,768,3,0","type":4,"elements":"My foolish, shallow, affectionate pets, with their obsessions with feathers and parties, nearly break my heart ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,768,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,768,4,0","type":4,"elements":"with their good-bye. It's certain from Venia's last words that we all know I won't be returning. Does the whole ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,768,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,768,5,0","type":4,"elements":"world know it? I wonder. I look at Cinna. He knows, certainly. But as he promised, there's no danger of tears ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,768,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,768,6,0","type":4,"elements":"from him. \"So, what am I wearing tonight?\" I ask, eyeing the garment bag that holds","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,769","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,769,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,769,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,770","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,770,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,770,0,0","type":4,"elements":"my dress. \"President Snow put in the dress order himself,\" says Cinna. He unzips the bag, revealing one of the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5