-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,771,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,771,8,0","type":4,"elements":"such a pretty dress\" is all I say. Cinna helps","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,772","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,772,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,772,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,773","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,773,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,773,0,0","type":4,"elements":"me carefully into the gown. As it settles on my shoulders, they can't help giving a shrug of complaint. \"Was it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,773,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,773,1,0","type":4,"elements":"always this heavy?\" I ask. I remember several of the dresses being dense, but this one feels like it weighs a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,773,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,773,2,0","type":4,"elements":"ton. \"I had to make some slight alterations because of the lighting,\" says Cinna. I nod, but I can't see what that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,773,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,773,3,0","type":4,"elements":"has to do with anything. He decks me out in the shoes and the pearl jewelry and the veil. Touches up my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,773,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,773,4,0","type":4,"elements":"makeup. Has me walk. \"You're ravishing,\" he says. \"Now, Katniss, because this bodice is so fitted, I don't want ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,773,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,773,5,0","type":4,"elements":"you raising your arms above your head. Well, not until you twirl, anyway.\" \"Will I be twirling again?\" I ask, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,773,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,773,6,0","type":4,"