 mockingjay, I think,\" I say, giving my wings a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,787,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,787,7,0","type":4,"elements":"small flap. \"It's the bird on the pin I wear as a token.\" A shadow of recognition flickers across Caesar's face, and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,787,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,787,8,0","type":4,"elements":"I can tell he knows that the mockingjay isn't just my token. That it's come","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,788","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,788,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,788,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,789","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,789,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,789,0,0","type":4,"elements":"to symbolize so much more. That what will be seen as a flashy costume change in the Capitol is resonating in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,789,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,789,1,0","type":4,"elements":"an entirely different way throughout the districts. But he makes the best of it. \"Well, hats off to your stylist. I don't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,789,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,789,2,0","type":4,"elements":"think anyone can argue that that's not the most spectacular thing we've ever seen in an interview. Cinna, I think ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,789,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,789,3,0","type":4,"elements":"you better take a bow!\" Caesar gestures for Cinna to rise. He does, and makes a small, gracious bow. And ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,789,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,789,4,0","type":4,"elements":"suddenly I am so afraid for him. What has he done? Something terribly dangerous. An act of rebellion in itself. ","format_i