rough my bones, lets us know ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,802,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,802,5,0","type":4,"elements":"where we stand in the program. I automatically rise and, as I do, I sense Peeta reaching out for me. Tears run ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,802,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,802,6,0","type":4,"elements":"down his face as I take his hand. How real are the tears? Is this an acknowledgment that he has been stalked ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,802,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,802,7,0","type":4,"elements":"by the same fears that I have? That every victor has? Every parent in every district in Panem? I look back to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,802,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,802,8,0","type":4,"elements":"the crowd, but the faces of Rue's mother and father swim before","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,803","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,803,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,803,0,0","type":4,"elements":"my eyes. Their sorrow. Their loss. I turn spontaneously to Chaff and offer my hand. I feel my fingers close ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,803,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,803,1,0","type":4,"elements":"around the stump that now completes his arm and hold fast. And then it happens. Up and down the row, the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,803,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,803,2,0","type":4,"elements":"victors begin to join hands. Some right away, like the morphlings, or Wiress and Beetee. Others unsure but ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,803,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,803,3,0","type":4,"elements":"caught up in the demands of those around them, like Brutus and Enobaria. By the time the anthem plays its ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,803,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,803,4,0","type":4,"elements":"final strains, all twenty-four of us stand in one unbroken line in what must be the first public show of unity ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,803,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,803,5,0","type":4,"elements":"among the districts since the Dark Days. You can see the realization of this as the screens begin to pop into ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,803,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,803,6,0","type":4,"elements":"blackness. It's too late, though. In the confusion they didn't cut us off in time. Everyone has seen. There's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,803,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,803,7,0","type":4,"elements":"disorder on the stage now, too, as the lights go out and we're left to stumble back into the Training Center. I've ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,803,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,803,8,0","type":4,"elements":"lost hold of Chaff, but Peeta guides me","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,804","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,804,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,804,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,805","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,805,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,805,0,0","type":4,"elements":"into an elevator. Finnick and Johanna try to join us, but a harried Peacekeeper blocks their way and we shoot ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,805,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,805,1,0","type":4,"elements":"upward alone. The moment we step off the elevator, Peeta grips my shoulders. \"There isn't much time, so tell ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,805,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,805,2,0","type":4,"elements":"me. Is there anything I have to apologize for?\" \"Nothing,\" I say. It was a big leap to take without my okay, but I'm ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,805,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,805,3,0","type":4,"elements":"just as glad I didn't know, didn't have time to second-guess him, to let any guilt over Gale detract from how I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,805,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,805,4,0","type":4,"elements":"really feel about what Peeta did. Which is empowered. Somewhere, very far off, is a place called District 12, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,805,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,805,5,0","type":4,"elements":"where my mother and sister and friends will have to deal with the fallout from this night. Just a brief hovercraft ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,805,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,805,6,0","type":4,"elements":"ride away is an arena where, tomorrow, Peeta and I and the other tributes will face our own form of punishment. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,805,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,805,7,0","type":4,"elements":"But even if all of us meet terrible ends, something happened on that stage tonight that can't be undone. We ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,805,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,805,8,0","type":4,"elements":"victors staged our own uprising, and maybe,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,806","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,806,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,806,0,0","type":4,"elements":"just maybe, the Capitol won't be able to contain this one. We wait for the others to return, but when the elevator ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,806,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,806,1,0","type":4,"elements":"opens, only Haymitch appears. \"It's madness out there. Everyone's been sent home and they've canceled the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,806,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,806,2,0","type":4,"elements":"recap of the interviews on television.\" Peeta and I hurry to the window and try to make sense of the commotion ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,806,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,806,3,0","type":4,"elements":"far below us on the streets. \"What are they saying?\" Peeta asks. \"Are they asking the president to stop the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,806,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,806,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Games?\" \"I don't think they know themselves what to ask. The whole situation is unprecedented. Even the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,806,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,806,5,0","type":4,"elements":"idea of opposing the Capitol's agenda is a source of confusion for the people here,\" says Haymitch. \"But ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,806,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,806,6,0","type":4,"elements":"there's no way Snow would cancel the Games. You know that, right?\" I do. Of course, he could never back ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,806,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,806,7,0","type":4,"elements":"down now. The only option left to him is to strike back, and strike back hard. \"The others went home?\" I ask. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,806,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,806,8,0","type":4,"elements":"\"They were ordered to. I don't know how much luck they're having","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,807","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,807,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,807,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,808","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,808,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,808,0,0","type":4,"elements":"getting through the mob,\" says Haymitch. \"Then we'll never see Effie again,\" says Peeta. We didn't see her on ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,808,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,808,1,0","type":4,"elements":"the morning of the Games last year. \"You'll give her our thanks.\" \"More than that. Really make it special. It's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,808,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,808,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Effie, after all,\" I say. \"Tell her how appreciative we are and how she was the best escort ever and tell her ... tell ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,808,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,808,3,0","type":4,"elements":"her we send our love.\" For a while we just stand there in silence, delaying the inevitable. Then Haymitch says ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,808,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,808,4,0","type":4,"elements":"it. \"I guess this is where we say our good-byes as well.\" \"Any last words of advice?\" Peeta asks. \"Stay alive,\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,808,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,808,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Haymitch says gruffly. That's almost an old joke with us now. He gives us each a quick embrace, and I can tell ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,808,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,808,6,0","type":4,"elements":"it's all he can stand. \"Go to bed. You need your rest.\" I know I should say a whole bunch of things to Haymitch, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,808,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,808,7,0","type":4,"elements":"but I can't think of anything he doesn't already know, really, and my throat is so tight I doubt anything would ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,808,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,808,8,0","type":4,"elements":"come out, anyway. So, once again, I let Peeta speak for us both. \"You take care,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,809","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,809,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,809,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Haymitch,\" he says. We cross the room, but in the doorway, Haymitch's voice stops us. \"Katniss, when you're","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,810","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,810,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,810,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,811","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,811,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,811,0,0","type":4,"elements":"in the arena,\" he begins. Then he pauses. He's scowling in a way that makes me sure I've already ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,811,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,811,1,0","type":4,"elements":"disappointed him. \"What?\" I ask defensively. \"You just remember who the enemy is,\" Haymitch tells me. \"That's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,811,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,811,2,0","type":4,"elements":"all. Now go on. Get out of here.\"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,812","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,812,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,812,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,813","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,813,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,813,0,0","type":4,"elements":"We walk down the hallway. Peeta wants to stop by his room to shower off the makeup and meet me in a few ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,813,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,813,1,0","type":4,"elements":"minutes, but I won't let him. I'm certain that if a door shuts between us, it will lock and I'll have to spend the night ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,813,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,813,2,0","type":4,"elements":"without him. Besides, I have a shower in my room. I refuse to let go of his hand. Do we sleep? I don't know. We ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,813,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,813,3,0","type":4,"elements":"spend the night holding each other, in some halfway land between","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,814","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,814,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,814,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,815","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,815,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,815,0,0","type":4,"elements":"dreams and waking. Not talking. Both afraid to disturb the other in the hope that we'll be able to store up a few ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,815,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,815,1,0","type":4,"elements":"precious minutes of rest. Cinna and Portia arrive with the dawn, and I know Peeta will have to go. Tributes enter ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,815,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,815,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the arena alone. He gives me a light kiss. \"See you soon,\" he says. \"See you soon,\" I answer. Cinna, who will ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,815,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,815,3,0","type":4,"elements":"help dress me for the Games, accompanies me to the roof. I'm about to mount the ladder to the hovercraft ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,815,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,815,4,0","type":4,"elements":"when I remember. \"I didn't say good- bye to Portia.\" \"I'll tell her,\" says Cinna. The electric current freezes me in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,815,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,815,5,0","type":4,"elements":"place on the ladder until the doctor injects the tracker into my left forearm. Now they will always be able to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,815,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,815,6,0","type":4,"elements":"locate me in the arena. The hovercraft takes off, and I look out the windows until they black out. Cinna keeps ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,815,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,815,7,0","type":4,"elements":"pressing me to eat and, when that fails, to drink. I manage to keep sipping water, thinking of the days of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,815,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,815,8,0","type":4,"elements":"dehydration that almost killed me last year. Thinking of how I will need my","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,816","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,816,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,816,0,0","type":4,"elements":"strength to keep Peeta alive. When we reach the Launch Room at the arena, I shower. Cinna braids my hair ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,816,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,816,1,0","type":4,"elements":"down my back and helps me dress over simple undergarments. This year's tribute outfit is a fitted blue ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,816,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,816,2,0","type":4,"elements":"jumpsuit, made of very sheer material, that zippers up the front. A six-inch-wide padded belt covered in shiny ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,816,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,816,3,0","type":4,"elements":"purple plastic. A pair of nylon shoes with rubber soles. \"What do you think?\" I ask, holding the fabric out for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,816,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,816,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Cinna to examine. He frowns as he rubs the thin stuff between his fingers. \"I don't know. It will offer little in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,816,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,816,5,0","type":4,"elements":"way of protection from cold or water.\" \"Sun?\" I ask, picturing a burning sun over a barren desert. \"Possibly. If it's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,816,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,816,6,0","type":4,"elements":"been treated,\" he says. \"Oh, I almost forgot this.\" He takes my gold mockingjay pin from his pocket and fixes it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,816,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,816,7,0","type":4,"elements":"to the jumpsuit. \"My dress was fantastic last night,\" I say. Fantastic and reckless. But Cinna must know that. \"I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,816,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,816,8,0","type":4,"elements":"thought you might like","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,817","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,817,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,817,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,818","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,818,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,818,0,0","type":4,"elements":"it,\" he says with a tight smile. We sit, as we did last year, holding hands until the voice tells me to prepare for the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,818,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,818,1,0","type":4,"elements":"launch. He walks me over to the circular metal plate and zips up the neck of my jumpsuit securely. \"Remember, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,818,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,818,2,0","type":4,"el