learn that in District Twelve?\" \"We have a big bathtub,\" I answer. \"You must,\" he says. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,831,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,831,4,0","type":4,"elements":"\"You like the arena?\" \"Not particularly. But you should. They must have built it especially for you,\" I say with an ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,831,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,831,5,0","type":4,"elements":"edge of bitterness. It seems like it, anyway, with all the water, when I bet only a handful of the victors can swim. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,831,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,831,6,0","type":4,"elements":"And there was no pool in the Training Center, no chance to learn. Either you came in here a swimmer or you'd ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,831,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,831,7,0","type":4,"elements":"better be a really fast learner. Even participation in the initial bloodbath depends on being able to cover twenty ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,831,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,831,8,0","type":4,"elements":"yards of water. That gives District 4 an","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,832","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,832,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,832,0,0","type":4,"elements":"enormous advantage. For a moment we're frozen, sizing each other up, our weapons, our skill. Then Finnick ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,832,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,832,1,0","type":4,"elements":"suddenly grins. \"Lucky","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,833","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,833,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,833,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,834","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,834,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,834,0,0","type":4,"elements":"thing we're allies. Right?\" Sensing a trap, I'm about to let my arrow fly, hoping it finds his heart before the trident ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,834,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,834,1,0","type":4,"elements":"impales me, when he shifts his hand and something on his wrist catches the sunlight. A solid-gold bangle ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,834,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,834,2,0","type":4,"elements":"patterned with flames. The same one I remember on Haymitch's wrist the morning I began training. I briefly ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,834,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,834,3,0","type":4,"elements":"consider that Finnick could have stolen it to trick me, but somehow I know this isn't the case. Haymitch gave it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,834,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,834,4,0","type":4,"elements":"to him. As a signal to me. An order, really. To trust Finnick. I can hear other footsteps approaching. I must decide ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,834,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,834,5,0","type":4,"elements":"at once. \"Right!\" I snap, because even though Haymitch is my mentor and trying to keep me alive, this angers ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,834,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,834,6,0","type":4,"elements":"me. Why didn't he tell me he'd made this","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,835","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,835,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,835,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,836","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,836,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,836,0,0","type":4,"elements":"arrangement before? Probably because Peeta and I had ruled out allies. Now Haymitch has chosen one on his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,836,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,836,1,0","type":4,"elements":"own. \"Duck!\" Finnick commands in such a powerful voice, so different from his usual seductive purr, that I do. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,836,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,836,2,0","type":4,"elements":"His trident goes whizzing over my head and there's a sickening sound of impact as it finds its target. The man ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,836,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,836,3,0","type":4,"elements":"from District 5, the drunk who threw up on the sword-fighting floor, sinks to his knees as Finnick frees the trident ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,836,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,836,4,0","type":4,"elements":"from his chest. \"Don't trust One and Two,\" Finnick says. There's no time to question this. I work the sheath of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,836,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,836,5,0","type":4,"elements":"arrows free. \"Each take one side?\" I say. He nods, and I dart around the pile. About four spokes apart, Enobaria ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,836,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,836,6,0","type":4,"elements":"and Gloss are just reaching land. Either they're slow swimmers or they thought the water might be laced with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,836,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,836,7,0","type":4,"elements":"other dangers, which it might well be. Sometimes it's not good to consider too many scenarios. But now that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,836,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,836,8,0","type":4,"elements":"they're on the sand, they'll be here in a matter of seconds.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,837","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,837,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,837,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Anything useful?\" I hear Finnick shout. I quickly scan the pile on my side and find maces, swords, bows and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,837,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,837,1,0","type":4,"elements":"arrows, tridents, knives, spears, axes, metallic objects I have no name for ... and nothing else. \"Weapons!\" I call ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,837,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,837,2,0","type":4,"elements":"back. \"Nothing but weapons!\" \"Same here,\" he confirms. \"Grab what you want and let's go!\" I shoot an arrow at ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,837,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,837,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Enobaria, who's gotten in too close for comfort, but she's expecting it and dives back into the water before it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,837,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,837,4,0","type":4,"elements":"can find its mark. Gloss isn't quite as swift, and I sink an arrow into his calf as he plunges into the waves. I sling ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,837,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,837,5,0","type":4,"elements":"an extra bow and a second sheath of arrows over my body, slide two long knives and an awl into my belt, and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,837,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,837,6,0","type":4,"elements":"meet up with Finnick at the front of the pile. \"Do something about that, would you?\" he says. I see Brutus ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,837,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,837,7,0","type":4,"elements":"barreling toward us. His belt is undone and he has it stretched between his hands as a kind of shield. I shoot at ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,837,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,837,8,0","type":4,"elements":"him and he manages to block the arrow with his belt before it","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,838","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,838,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,838,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,839","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,839,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,839,0,0","type":4,"elements":"can skewer his liver. Where it punctures the belt, a purple liquid spews forth, coating his face. As I reload, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,839,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,839,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Brutus flattens on the ground, rolls the few feet to the water, and submerges. There's a clang of metal falling ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,839,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,839,2,0","type":4,"elements":"behind me. \"Let's clear out,\" I say to Finnick. This last altercation has given Enobaria and Gloss time to reach ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,839,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,839,3,0","type":4,"elements":"the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,840","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,840,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,840,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,841","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,841,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,841,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Cornucopia. Brutus is within shooting distance and somewhere, certainly, Cashmere is nearby, too. These four ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,841,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,841,1,0","type":4,"elements":"classic Careers will no doubt have a prior alliance. If I had only my own safety to consider, I might be willing to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,841,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,841,2,0","type":4,"elements":"take them on with Finnick by my side. But it's Peeta I'm thinking about. I spot him now, still stranded on his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,841,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,841,3,0","type":4,"elements":"metal plate. I take off and Finnick follows without question, as if knowing this will be my next move. When I'm as ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,841,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,841,4,0","type":4,"elements":"close as I can get, I start removing knives from my belt, preparing to swim out","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,842","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,842,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,842,0,0","type":4,"elements":"to reach him and somehow bring him in. Finnick drops a hand on my shoulder. \"I'll get him.\" Suspicion flickers ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,842,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,842,1,0","type":4,"elements":"up inside me. Could this all just be a ruse? For Finnick to win my trust and then swim out and drown Peeta? \"I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,842,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,842,2,0","type":4,"elements":"can,\" I insist. But Finnick has dropped all his weapons to the ground. \"Better not exert yourself. Not in your ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,842,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,842,3,0","type":4,"elements":"condition,\" he says, and reaches down and pats my abdomen. Oh, right. I'm supposed to be pregnant, I think. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,842,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,842,4,0","type":4,"elements":"While I'm trying to think what that means and how I should act--maybe throw up or something--Finnick has ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,842,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,842,5,0","type":4,"elements":"positioned himself at the edge of the water. \"Cover me,\" he says. He disappears with a flawless dive.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,843","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,843,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,843,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,844","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,844,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,844,0,0","type":4,"elements":"I raise my bow, warding off any attackers from the Cornucopia, but no one seems interested in pursuing us. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,844,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,844,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Sure enough, Gloss, Cashmere, Enobaria, and Brutus have","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,845","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,845,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,845,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,846","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,846,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,846,0,0","type":4,"elements":"gathered, their pack formed already, picking over the weapons. A quick survey of the rest of the arena shows ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,846,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,846,1,0","type":4,"elements":"that most of the tributes are still trapped on their plates. Wait, no, there's someone standing on the spoke to my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,846,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,846,2,0","type":4,"elements":"left, the one opposite Peeta. It's Mags. But she neither heads for the Cornucopia nor tries to flee. Instead she ","format_id":"9