? Right at the last second? You ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,875,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,875,8,0","type":4,"elements":"started to give a warning.\" I nod. \"How did you know?\" I hesitate. To","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,876","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,876,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,876,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,877","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,877,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,877,0,0","type":4,"elements":"reveal that I know Beetee and Wiress's trick of recognizing a force field could be dangerous. I don't know if the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,877,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,877,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Gamemakers made note of that moment during training when the two pointed it out to me or not. One way or ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,877,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,877,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the other, I have a very valuable piece of information. And if they know I have it, they might do something to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,877,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,877,3,0","type":4,"elements":"alter the force field so I can't see the aberration anymore. So I lie. \"I don't know. It's almost as if I could hear it. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,877,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,877,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Listen.\" We all become still. There's the sound of insects, birds, the breeze in the foliage. \"I don't hear ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,877,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,877,5,0","type":4,"elements":"anything,\" says Peeta. \"Yes,\" I insist, \"it's like when the fence around District Twelve is on, only much, much ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,877,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,877,6,0","type":4,"elements":"quieter.\" Everyone listens again intently. I do, too, although there's nothing to hear. \"There!\" I say. \"Can't you ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,877,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,877,7,0","type":4,"elements":"hear","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,878","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,878,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,878,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,879","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,879,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,879,0,0","type":4,"elements":"it? It's coming from right where Peeta got shocked.\" \"I","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,880","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,880,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,880,0,0","type":4,"elements":"don't hear it, either,\" says Finnick. \"But if you do, by all means, take the lead.\" I decide to play this for all it's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,880,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,880,1,0","type":4,"elements":"worth. \"That's weird,\" I say. I turn my head from side to side as if puzzled. \"I can only hear it out of my left ear.\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,880,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,880,2,0","type":4,"elements":"\"The one the doctors reconstructed?\" asks Peeta. \"Yeah,\" I say, then give a shrug. \"Maybe they did a better job ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,880,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,880,3,0","type":4,"elements":"than they thought. You know, sometimes I do hear funny things on that side. Things you wouldn't ordinarily ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,880,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,880,4,0","type":4,"elements":"think have a sound. Like insect wings. Or snow hitting the ground.\" Perfect. Now all the attention will turn to the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,880,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,880,5,0","type":4,"elements":"surgeons who fixed my deaf ear after the Games last year, and they'll have to explain why I can hear like a bat. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,880,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,880,6,0","type":4,"elements":"\"You,\" says Mags, nudging me forward, so I take the lead. Since we're to be moving slowly, Mags prefers to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,880,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,880,7,0","type":4,"elements":"walk with the aid of a branch Finnick quickly fashions into a cane for her. He makes a staff for Peeta as well, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,880,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,880,8,0","type":4,"elements":"which is good because, despite his protestations, I think all Peeta","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,881","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,881,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,881,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,882","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,882,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,882,0,0","type":4,"elements":"really wants to do is lie down. Finnick brings up the rear, so at least someone alert has our backs. I walk with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,882,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,882,1,0","type":4,"elements":"the force field on my left, because that's supposed to be the side with my superhuman ear. But since that's all ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,882,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,882,2,0","type":4,"elements":"made up, I cut down a bunch of hard nuts that hang like grapes from a nearby tree and toss them ahead of me ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,882,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,882,3,0","type":4,"elements":"as I go. It's good I do, too, because I have a feeling I'm missing the patches that indicate the force field more ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,882,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,882,4,0","type":4,"elements":"often than I'm spotting them. Whenever a nut hits the force field, there's a puff of smoke before the nut lands, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,882,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,882,5,0","type":4,"elements":"blackened and with a cracked shell, on the ground at my feet. After a few minutes I become aware of a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,882,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,882,6,0","type":4,"elements":"smacking sound behind me and turn to see Mags peeling the shell off one of the nuts and popping it in her ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,882,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,882,7,0","type":4,"elements":"already-full mouth. \"Mags!\" I cry. \"Spit that out. It could be poisonous.\" She mumbles something and ignores ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,882,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,882,8,0","type":4,"elements":"me, licking her lips with apparent relish. I look to Finnick for help but he just laughs.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,883","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,883,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,883,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"I guess we'll find out,\" he says. I go forward, wondering about Finnick, who saved old Mags but will let her eat ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,883,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,883,1,0","type":4,"elements":"strange nuts. Who Haymitch has stamped with his seal of approval. Who brought Peeta back from the dead. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,883,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,883,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Why didn't he just let him die? He would have been blameless. I never would have guessed it was in his power ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,883,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,883,3,0","type":4,"elements":"to revive him. Why could he possibly have wanted to save Peeta? And why was he so determined to team up ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,883,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,883,4,0","type":4,"elements":"with me? Willing to kill me, too, if it comes to that. But leaving the choice of if we fight to me. I keep walking, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,883,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,883,5,0","type":4,"elements":"tossing my nuts, sometimes catching a glimpse of the force field, trying to press to the left to find a spot where ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,883,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,883,6,0","type":4,"elements":"we can break through, get away from the Cornucopia, and hopefully find water. But after another hour or so of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,883,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,883,7,0","type":4,"elements":"this I realize it's futile. We're not making any progress to the left. In fact, the force field seems to be herding us ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,883,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,883,8,0","type":4,"elements":"along a curved path. I stop and look back at","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,884","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,884,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,884,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,885","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,885,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,