f the jungle is tinged a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,887,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,887,7,0","type":4,"elements":"uniform pink. And I think I can make out one or two of those wavy squares,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,888","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,888,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,888,0,0","type":4,"elements":"chinks in the armor, Wiress and Beetee called them, because they reveal what was meant to be hidden and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,888,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,888,1,0","type":4,"elements":"are therefore a weakness. Just to make absolutely sure, I shoot an arrow into the empty space above the tree ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,888,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,888,2,0","type":4,"elements":"line. There's a spurt of light, a flash of real blue sky, and the arrow's thrown back into the jungle. I climb down to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,888,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,888,3,0","type":4,"elements":"give the others the bad news. \"The force field has us trapped in a circle. A dome, really. I don't know how high it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,888,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,888,4,0","type":4,"elements":"goes. There's the Cornucopia, the sea, and then the jungle all around. Very exact. Very symmetrical. And not ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,888,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,888,5,0","type":4,"elements":"very large,\" I say. \"Did you see any water?\" asks Finnick. \"Only the saltwater where we started the Games,\" I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,888,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,888,6,0","type":4,"elements":"say. \"There must be some other source,\" says Peeta, frowning. \"Or we'll all be dead in a matter of days.\" \"Well, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,888,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,888,7,0","type":4,"elements":"the foliage is thick. Maybe there are ponds or springs somewhere,\" I say doubtfully. I instinctively feel the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,888,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,888,8,0","type":4,"elements":"Capitol might want these unpopular Games over as soon as possible.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,889","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,889,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,889,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,890","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,890,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,890,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Plutarch Heavensbee might have already been given orders to knock us off. \"At any rate, there's no point in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,890,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,890,1,0","type":4,"elements":"trying to find out what's over the edge of this hill, because the answer is nothing.\" \"There must be drinkable ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,890,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,890,2,0","type":4,"elements":"water between the force field and the wheel,\" Peeta insists. We all know what this means. Heading back down. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,890,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,890,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Heading back to the Careers and the bloodshed. With Mags hardly able to walk and Peeta too weak to fight. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,890,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,890,4,0","type":4,"elements":"We decide to move down the slope a few hundred yards and continue circling. See if maybe there's some ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,890,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,890,5,0","type":4,"elements":"water at that level. I stay in the lead, occasionally chucking a nut to my left, but we're well out of range of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,890,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,890,6,0","type":4,"elements":"force field now. The sun beats down on us, turning the air to steam, playing tricks on our eyes. By ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,890,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,890,7,0","type":4,"elements":"midafternoon, it's clear Peeta and Mags can't go on. Finnick chooses a campsite about ten yards below the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,890,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,890,8,0","type":4,"elements":"force field, saying we can use it as a weapon by deflecting our enemies into it if attacked. Then","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,891","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,891,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,891,0,0","type":4,"elements":"he and Mags pull blades of the sharp grass that grows in five-foot-high tufts and begin to weave them together ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,891,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,891,1,0","type":4,"elements":"into mats. Since Mags seems to have no ill effects from the nuts, Peeta collects bunches of them","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,892","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,892,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,892,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,893","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,893,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,893,0,0","type":4,"elements":"and fries them by bouncing them off the force field. He methodically peels off the shells, piling the meats on a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,893,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,893,1,0","type":4,"elements":"leaf. I stand guard, fidgety and hot and raw with the emotions of the day. Thirsty. I am so thirsty. Finally I can't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,893,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,893,2,0","type":4,"elements":"stand it anymore. \"Finnick, why don't you stand guard and I'll hunt around some more for water,\" I say. No one's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,893,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,893,3,0","type":4,"elements":"thrilled with the idea of me going off alone, but the threat of dehydration hangs over us. \"Don't worry, I won't go ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,893,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,893,4,0","type":4,"elements":"far,\" I promise Peeta. \"I'll go, too,\" he says. \"No, I'm going to do some hunting if I can,\" I tell him. I don't add, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,893,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,893,5,0","type":4,"elements":"\"And you can't come because you're too loud.\" But it's implied. He would both scare off","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,894","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,894,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,894,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,895","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,895,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,895,0,0","type":4,"elements":"prey and endanger me with his heavy tread. \"I won't be long.\" I move stealthily through the trees, happy to find ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,895,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,895,1,0","type":4,"elements":"that the ground lends itself to soundless footsteps. I work my way down at a diagonal, but I find nothing except ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,895,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,895,2,0","type":4,"elements":"more lush, green plant life. The sound of the cannon brings me to a halt. The initial bloodbath at the Cornucopia ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,895,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,895,3,0","type":4,"elements":"must be over. The death toll of the tributes is now available. I count the shots, each representing one dead ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,895,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,895,4,0","type":4,"elements":"victor. Eight. Not as many as last year. But it seems like more since I know most of their names. Suddenly ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,895,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,895,5,0","type":4,"elements":"weak, I lean against a tree to rest, feeling the heat draw the moisture from my body like a sponge. Already, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,895,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,895,6,0","type":4,"elements":"swallowing is difficult and fatigue is creeping up on me. I try rubbing my hand across my belly, hoping some ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,895,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,895,7,0","type":4,"elements":"sympathetic pregnant woman will become my sponsor and Haymitch can send in some water. No luck. I sink to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,895,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,895,8,0","type":4,"elements":"the ground. In my stillness, I begin to notice the animals:","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,896","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,896,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,896,0,0","type":4,"elements":"strange birds with brilliant plumage, tree lizards with flickering blue tongues, and something that looks like a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,896,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,896,1,0","type":4,"elements":"cross between a rat and a possum clinging on the branches close to the trunk. I shoot one of the latter out of a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,896,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,896,2,0","type":4,"elements":"tree to get a closer look. It's ugly, all right, a big rodent with a fuzz of mottled gray fur and two wicked-looking ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,896,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,896,3,0","type":4,"elements":"gnawing teeth protruding over its lower lip. As I'm gutting and skinning it, I notice something else. Its muzzle is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,896,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,896,4,0","type":4,"elements":"wet. Like an animal that's been drinking from a stream. Excited, I start at its home tree and move slowly out in a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,896,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,896,5,0","type":4,"elements":"spiral. It can't be far, the creature's water source. Nothing. I find nothing. Not so much as a dewdrop. Eventually, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,896,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,896,6,0","type":4,"elements":"because I know Peeta will be worried about me, I head back to the camp, hotter and more frustrated than ever. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,896,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,896,7,0","type":4,"elements":"When I arrive, I see the others have transformed the place. Mags and Finnick have created a hut of sorts out of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,896,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,896,8,0","type":4,"elements":"the grass mats, open on one side but with","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,897","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,897,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,897,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,898","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,898,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,898,0,0","type":4,"elements":"three walls, a floor, and a roof. Mags has also plaited several bowls that Peeta has filled with roasted nuts. Their ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,898,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,898,1,0","type":4,"elements":"faces turn to me hopefully, but I give my head a shake. \"No. No water. It's out there, though. He knew where it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,898,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,898,2,0","type":4,"elements":"was,\" I say, hoisting the skinned rodent up for all to see. \"He'd been drinking recently when I shot him out of a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,898,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,898,3,0","type":4,"elements":"tree, but I couldn't find his source. I swear, I covered every","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,899","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,899,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,899,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,900","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,900,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,900,0,0","type":4,"elements":"inch of ground in a thirty-yard radius.\" \"Can we eat him?\" Peeta asks. \"I don't know for sure. But his meat ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,900,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,900,1,0","type":4,"elements":"doesn't look that different from a squirrel's. He ought to be cooked... .\" I hesitate as I think of trying to start a fire ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,900,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,900,2,0","type":4,"elements":"out here from complete scratch. Even if I succeed, there's the smoke to think about. We're all so close together ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,900,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,900,3,0","type":4,"elements":"in this arena, there's no chance of hiding it. Peeta has another idea. He takes a cube of rodent meat, skewers it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,900,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,900,4,0","type":4,"elements":"on the tip of a pointed stick,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,901","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,901,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,901,0,0","type":4,"elements":"and lets it fall into the force field. There's a sharp sizzle and the stick flies back. The chunk of meat is blackened ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,901,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,901,1,0","type":4,"elements":"on the outside but well cooked inside. We give him a round of applause, then quickly stop, remembering where ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,901,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,901,2,0","type":4,"elements":"we are.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,902","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,902,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,902,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,903","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,903,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,903,0,0","type":4,"elements":"The white sun sinks in the rosy sky as we gather in the hut. I'm still leery about the nuts, but Finnick says Mags ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,903,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,903,1,0","type":4,"elements":"recognized them from another Games. I didn't bother spending time at the edible-plants station in training ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,903,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,903,2,0","type":4,"elements":"because it was so effortless for me last year. Now I wish I had. For surely there would have been some of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,903,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,903,3,0","type":4,"elements":"unfamiliar plants surrounding me. And I might have guessed a bit more about where I was headed. Mags ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,903,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,903,4,0","type":4,"elements":"seems fine, though, and she's been eating the nuts for hours. So I pick one up and take a small bite. It has a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,903,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,903,5,0","type":4,"elements":"mild, slightly sweet flavor that reminds me of a chestnut. I decide it's all right. The rodent's strong and","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,904","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,904,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,904,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,905","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,905,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,905,0,0","type":4,"elements":"gamey but surprisingly juicy. Really, it's not a bad meal for our first night in the arena. If only we had something ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,905,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,905,1,0","type":4,"elements":"to wash it down with. Finnick asks a lot of questions about the rodent, which we decide to call a tree rat. How ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,905,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,905,2,0","type":4,"elements":"high was it, how long did I watch it before I shot, and what was it doing? I don't remember it doing much of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,905,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,905,3,0","type":4,"elements":"anything. Snuffling around for insects or something. I'm dreading the night. At least the tightly woven grass ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,905,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,905,4,0","type":4,"elements":"offers some protection from whatever slinks across the jungle floor after hours. But a short time before the sun ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,905,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,905,5,0","type":4,"elements":"slips below the horizon, a pale white moon rises, making things just visible enough. Our conversation trails off ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,905,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,905,6,0","type":4,"elements":"because we know what's coming. We position ourselves in a line at the mouth of the hut and Peeta slips his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,905,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,905,7,0","type":4,"elements":"hand into mine. The sky brightens when the seal of the Capitol appears as if floating in space. As I listen to the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,905,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,905,8,0","type":4,"elements":"strains of the anthem I think, It will be harder","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,906","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,906,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,906,0,0","type":4,"elements":"for Finnick and Mags. But it turns out to be plenty hard for me as well. Seeing the faces of the eight dead victors ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,906,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,906,1,0","type":4,"elements":"projected into the sky. The man from District 5, the one Finnick took out with his trident, is the first to appear. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,906,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,906,2,0","type":4,"elements":"That means that all the tributes in 1 through 4 are alive -- the four Careers, Beetee and Wiress, and, of course, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,906,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,906,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Mags and Finnick. The man from District 5 is followed by the male morphling from 6, Cecelia and Woof from 8, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,906,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,906,4,0","type":4,"elements":"both from 9, the woman from 10, and Seeder from 11. The Capitol seal is back with a final bit of music and then ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,906,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,906,5,0","type":4,"elements":"the sky goes dark except for the moon. No one speaks. I can't pretend I knew any of them well. But I'm thinking ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,906,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,906,6,0","type":4,"elements":"of those three kids hanging on to Cecelia when they took her away. Seeder's kindness to me at our meeting. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,906,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,906,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Even the thought of the glazed-eyed morphling painting my cheeks with yellow flowers gives me a pang. All ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,906,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,906,8,0","type":4,"elements":"dead. All gone. I don't know how long we might have sat here","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,907","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,907,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,907,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,908","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,908,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,908,0,0","type":4,"elements":"if it weren't for the arrival of the silver parachute, which glides down through the foliage to land before us. No ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,908,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,908,1,0","type":4,"elements":"one reaches for it. \"Whose is it, do you think?\" I say finally. \"No telling,\" says Finnick. \"Why don't we let Peeta ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,908,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,908,2,0","type":4,"elements":"claim it, since he died today?\" Peeta unties the cord and flattens out the circle of silk. On the parachute sits a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,908,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,908,3,0","type":4,"elements":"small metal object that I can't place. \"What is it?\" I ask. No one knows. We","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,909","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,909,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,909,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,910","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,910,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,910,0,0","type":4,"elements":"pass it from hand to hand, taking turns examining it. It's a hollow metal tube, tapered slightly at one end. On the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,910,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,910,1,0","type":4,"elements":"other end a small lip curves downward. It's vaguely familiar. A part that could have fallen off a bicycle, a curtain ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,910,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,910,2,0","type":4,"elements":"rod, anything, really. Peeta blows on one end to see if it makes a sound. It doesn't. Finnick slides his pinkie into ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,910,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,910,3,0","type":4,"elements":"it, testing it out as a weapon. Useless. \"Can you fish with it, Mags?\" I ask. Mags, who can fish with almost ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,910,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,910,4,0","type":4,"elements":"anything, shakes her head","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,911","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,911,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,911,0,0","type":4,"elements":"and grunts. I take it and roll it back and forth on my palm. Since we're allies, Haymitch will be working with the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,911,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,911,1,0","type":4,"elements":"District 4 mentors. He had a hand in choosing this gift. That means it's valuable. Lifesaving, even. I think back ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,911,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,911,2,0","type":4,"elements":"to last year, when I wanted water so badly, but he wouldn't send it because he knew I could find it if I tried. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,911,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,911,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Haymitch's gifts, or lack thereof, carry weighty messages. I can almost hear him growling at me, Use your brain ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,911,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,911,4,0","type":4,"elements":"if you have one. What is it? I wipe the sweat from my eyes and hold the gift out in the moonlight. I move it this ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,911,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,911,5,0","type":4,"elements":"way and that, viewing it from different angles, covering portions and then revealing them. Trying to make it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,911,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,911,6,0","type":4,"elements":"divulge its purpose to me. Finally, in frustration, I jam one end into the dirt. \"I give up. Maybe if we hook up with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,911,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,911,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Beetee or Wiress they can figure it out. I stretch out, pressing my hot cheek on the grass mat, staring at the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{