once, the piece of metal half buried in the black earth has a name. \"A spile!\" I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,913,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,913,7,0","type":4,"elements":"exclaim, sitting bolt upright. \"What?\" asks Finnick. I wrestle the thing from the ground and brush it clean. Cup ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,913,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,913,8,0","type":4,"elements":"my hand around the tapered end, concealing it,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,914","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,914,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,914,0,0","type":4,"elements":"and look at the lip. Yes, I've seen one of these before. On a cold, windy day long ago, when I was out in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,914,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,914,1,0","type":4,"elements":"woods with my father. Inserted snugly into a hole drilled in the side of a maple. A pathway for the sap to follow ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,914,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,914,2,0","type":4,"elements":"as it flowed into our bucket. Maple syrup could make even our dull bread a treat. After my father died, I didn't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,914,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,914,3,0","type":4,"elements":"know what happened to the handful of spiles he had. Hidden out in the woods somewhere, probably. Never to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,914,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,914,4,0","type":4,"elements":"be found. \"It's a spile. Sort of like a faucet. You put it in a tree and sap comes out.\" I look at the sinewy green ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,914,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,914,5,0","type":4,"elements":"trunks around me. \"Well, the right","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,915","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,915,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,915,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,916","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,916,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,916,0,0","type":4,"elements":"sort of tree.\" \"Sap?\" asks Finnick. They don't have the right kind of trees by the sea, either. \"To make syrup,\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,916,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,916,1,0","type":4,"elements":"says Peeta. \"But there must be something else inside these trees.\" We're all on our feet at once. Our thirst. The ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,916,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,916,2,0","type":4,"elements":"lack of springs. The tree rat's sharp front teeth and wet muzzle. There can","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,917","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,917,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,917,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,918","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,918,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,918,0,0","type":4,"elements":"only be one thing worth having inside these trees. Finnick goes to hammer the spile into the green bark of a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,918,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,918,1,0","type":4,"elements":"massive tree with a rock, but I stop him. \"Wait. You might damage it. We need to drill a hole first,\" I say. There's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,918,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,918,2,0","type":4,"elements":"nothing to drill with, so Mags offers her awl and Peeta drives it straight into the bark, burying the spike two ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,918,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,918,3,0","type":4,"elements":"inches deep. He and Finnick take turns opening up the hole with the awl and the knives until it can hold the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,918,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,918,4,0","type":4,"elements":"spile. I wedge it in carefully and we all stand back in anticipation. At first nothing happens. Then a drop of water ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,918,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,918,5,0","type":4,"elements":"rolls down the lip and lands in Mags's palm. She licks it off and holds out her hand for more. By wiggling and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,918,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,918,6,0","type":4,"elements":"adjusting the spile, we get a thin stream running out. We take turns holding our mouths under the tap, wetting ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,918,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,918,7,0","type":4,"elements":"our parched tongues. Mags brings over a basket, and the grass is so tightly woven it holds water. We fill the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,918,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,918,8,0","type":4,"elements":"basket and pass it around, taking deep gulps and, later,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,919","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,919,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,919,0,0","type":4,"elements":"luxuriously, splashing our faces clean. Like everything here, the water's on the warm side, but this is no time to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,919,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,919,1,0","type":4,"elements":"be picky. Without our thirst to distract us, we're all aware of how exhausted we are and make preparations for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,919,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,919,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the night. Last year, I always tried to have my gear ready in case I had to make a speedy retreat in the night. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,919,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,919,3,0","type":4,"elements":"This year, there's no backpack to prepare. Just my weapons, which won't leave my grasp, anyway. Then I think ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,919,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,919,4,0","type":4,"elements":"of the spile and wrest it from the tree trunk. I strip a tough vine of its leaves, thread it through the hollow center, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,919,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,919,5,0","type":4,"elements":"and tie the spile securely to my belt. Finnick offers to take the first watch and I let him, knowing it has to be one ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,919,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,919,6,0","type":4,"elements":"of the two of us until Peeta's rested up. I lie down beside Peeta on the floor of the hut, telling Finnick to wake ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,919,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,919,7,0","type":4,"elements":"me when he's tired. Instead I find myself jarred from sleep a few hours later by what seems to be the tolling of a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,919,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,919,8,0","type":4,"elements":"bell. Bong! Bong! It's not exactly like the one they","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,920","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,920,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,920,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,921","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,921,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,921,0,0","type":4,"elements":"ring in the Justice Building on New Year's but close enough for me to recognize it. Peeta and Mags sleep ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,921,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,921,1,0","type":4,"elements":"through it, but Finnick has the same look of attentiveness I feel. The tolling stops. \"I counted twelve,\" he says. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,921,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,921,2,0","type":4,"elements":"nod. Twelve. What does that signify? One ring for each district? Maybe. But why? \"Mean anything, do you ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,921,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,921,3,0","type":4,"elements":"think?\" \"No idea,\" he says. We wait for further instructions, maybe a message from Claudius Templesmith. An ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,921,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,921,4,0","type":4,"elements":"invitation to a feast. The only thing of note appears in the distance. A dazzling bolt of electricity strikes a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,921,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,921,5,0","type":4,"elements":"towering tree and then a lightning storm begins. I guess it's an indication of rain, of a water source for those ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,921,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,921,6,0","type":4,"elements":"who don't have mentors as smart as Haymitch. \"Go to sleep, Finnick. It's my","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,922","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,922,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,922,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,923","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,923,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,923,0,0","type":4,"elements":"turn to watch, anyway,\" I say. Finnick hesitates, but no one can stay awake forever. He settles down at the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,923,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,923,1,0","type":4,"elements":"mouth of","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,924","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,924,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,924,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the hut, one hand gripped around a trident, and drifts into a restless sleep. I sit with my bow loaded, watching ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,924,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,924,1,0","type":4,"elements":"the jungle, which is ghostly pale and green in the moonlight. After an hour or so, the lightning stops. I can hear ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,924,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,924,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the rain coming in, though, pattering on the leaves a few hundred yards away. I keep waiting for it to reach us ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,924,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,924,3,0","type":4,"elements":"but it never does. The sound of the cannon startles me, although it makes little impression on my sleeping ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,924,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,924,4,0","type":4,"elements":"companions. There's no point in awakening them for this. Another victor dead. I don't even allow myself to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,924,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,924,5,0","type":4,"elements":"wonder who it is. The elusive rain shuts off suddenly, like the storm did last year in the arena. Moments after it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,924,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,924,6,0","type":4,"elements":"stops, I see the fog sliding softly in from the direction of the recent downpour. Just a reaction. Cool rain on the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,924,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,924,7,0","type":4,"elements":"steaming ground, I think. It continues to approach at a steady pace. Tendrils reach forward and then curl like ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,924,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,924,8,0","type":4,"elements":"fingers, as if they are pulling the rest behind them. As I","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,925","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,925,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,925,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,926","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,926,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,926,0,0","type":4,"elements":"watch, I feel the hairs on my neck begin to rise. Something's wrong with this fog. The progression of the front ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,926,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,926,1,0","type":4,"elements":"line is too uniform to be natural. And if it's not natural ... A sickeningly sweet odor begins to invade my nostrils ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,926,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,926,2,0","type":4,"elements":"and I reach for the others, shouting for them to wake up. In the few seconds it takes to rouse them, I begin to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,926,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,926,3,0","type":4,"elements":"blister. Tiny, searing stabs. Wherever the droplets of mist touch my skin. \"Run!\" I scream at the others. \"Run!\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,926,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,926,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick snaps awake instantly, rising to counter an enemy. But when he sees the wall of fog, he tosses a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,926,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,926,5,0","type":4,"elements":"still-sleeping Mags onto his back and takes off. Peeta is on his feet but not as alert. I grab his arm and begin to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,926,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,926,6,0","type":4,"elements":"propel him through the jungle after Finnick. \"What is it? What is it?\" he says in bewilderment. \"Some kind of fog. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,926,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,926,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Poisonous gas. Hurry, Peeta!\" I urge. I can tell that however much he denied it during the day, the aftereffects of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,926,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,926,8,0","type":4,"elements":"hitting the force field have been significant. He's slow, much","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,927","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,927,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,927,0,0","type":4,"elements":"slower than usual. And the tangle of vines and undergrowth, which unbalance me occasionally, trip him at every ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,927,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,927,1,0","type":4,"elements":"step. I look back at the wall of fog extending in a straight line as far as I can see in either direction. A terrible ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,927,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,927,2,0","type":4,"elements":"impulse to flee, to abandon Peeta and save myself, shoots through me. It would be so simple, to run full out, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,927,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,927,3,0","type":4,"elements":"perhaps to even climb a tree above the fog line, which seems to top out at about forty feet. I remember how I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,927,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,927,4,0","type":4,"elements":"did just this when the muttations appeared in the last Games. Took off and only thought of Peeta when I'd ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,927,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,927,5,0","type":4,"elements":"reached the Cornucopia. But this time, I trap my terror, push it down, and stay by his side. This time my survival ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,927,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,927,6,0","type":4,"elements":"isn't the goal. Peeta's is. I think of the eyes glued to the television screens in the districts, seeing if I will run, as ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,927,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,927,7,0","type":4,"elements":"the Capitol wishes, or hold my ground. I lock my fingers tightly into his and say, \"Watch my feet. Just try to step ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,927,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,927,8,0","type":4,"elements":"where I","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,928","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,928,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,928,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,929","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,929,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,929,0,0","type":4,"elements":"step.\" It helps. We seem to move a little faster, but never enough to afford a rest, and the mist continues to lap ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,929,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,929,1,0","type":4,"elements":"at our heels. Droplets spring free of the body of vapor. They burn, but not like fire. Less a sense of heat and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,929,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,929,2,0","type":4,"elements":"more of intense pain as the chemicals find our flesh, cling to it, and burrow down through the layers of skin. Our ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,929,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,929,3,0","type":4,"elements":"jumpsuits are no help at all. We may as well be dressed in tissue paper, for all the protection they give. Finnick, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,929,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,929,4,0","type":4,"elements":"who bounded off initially, stops when he realizes we're having problems. But this is not a thing you can fight, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,929,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,929,5,0","type":4,"elements":"only evade. He shouts encouragement, trying to move us along, and the sound of his voice acts as a guide, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,929,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,929,6,0","type":4,"elements":"though little more. Peeta's artificial leg catches in a knot of creepers and he sprawls forward before I can catch ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,929,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,929,7,0","type":4,"elements":"him. As I help him up, I become aware of something scarier than the blisters, more debilitating than the burns. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,929,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,929,8,0","type":4,"elements":"The left side of his face has sagged, as if every","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,930","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,930,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,930,0,0","type":4,"elements":"muscle in it has died. The lid droops, almost concealing his eye. His mouth","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,931","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,931,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,931,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,932","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,932,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,932,0,0","type":4,"elements":"twists in an odd angle toward the ground. \"Peeta--\" I begin. And that's when I feel the spasms run up my arm. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,932,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,932,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Whatever chemical laces the fog does more than burn -- it targets our nerves. A whole new kind of fear shoots ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,932,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,932,2,0","type":4,"elements":"through me and I yank Peeta forward, which only causes him to stumble again. By the time I get him to his feet, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,932,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,932,3,0","type":4,"elements":"both of my arms are twitching uncontrollably. The fog has moved in on us, the body of it less than a yard away. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,932,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,932,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Something is wrong with Peeta's legs; he's trying to walk but they move in a spastic, puppetlike fashion. I feel ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,932,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,932,5,0","type":4,"elements":"him lurch forward and realize Finnick has come back for us and is hauling Peeta along. I wedge my shoulder, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,932,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,932,6,0","type":4,"elements":"which still seems under my control, under Peeta's arm and do my best to keep up with","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,933","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,933,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,933,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,934","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,934,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,934,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick's rapid pace. We put about ten yards between us and the fog when Finnick stops. \"It's no good. I'll ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,934,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,934,1,0","type":4,"elements":"have to carry him. Can you take Mags?\" he asks me. \"Yes,\" I say stoutly, although my heart sinks. It's true that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,934,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,934,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Mags can't weigh more than about seventy pounds, but I'm not very big myself. Still, I'm sure I've carried ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,934,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,934,3,0","type":4,"elements":"heavier loads. If only my arms would stop jumping around. I squat down and she positions herself over my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,934,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,934,4,0","type":4,"elements":"shoulder, the way she rides on Finnick. I slowly straighten my legs and, with my knees locked, I can manage ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,934,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,934,5,0","type":4,"elements":"her. Finnick has Peeta slung across his back now and we move forward, Finnick leading, me following in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,934,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,934,6,0","type":4,"elements":"trail he breaks through the vines. On the fog comes, silent and steady and flat, except for the grasping tendrils. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,934,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,934,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Although my instinct is to run directly away from it, I realize Finnick is moving at a diagonal down the hill. He's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,934,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,934,8,0","type":4,"elements":"trying to keep a distance from the gas while steering us","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,935","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,935,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,935,0,0","type":4,"elements":"toward the water that surrounds the Cornucopia. Yes, water, I think as the acid droplets bore deeper into me. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,935,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,935,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Now I'm so thankful I didn't kill Finnick, because how would I have gotten Peeta out of here alive? So thankful ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,935,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,935,2,0","type":4,"elements":"to have someone else on my side, even if it's only temporarily. It's not Mags's fault when I begin falling. She's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,935,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,935,3,0","type":4,"elements":"doing everything she can to be an easy passenger, but the fact is, there is only so much weight I can handle. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,935,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,935,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Especially now that my right leg seems to be going stiff. The first two times I crash to the ground, I manage to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,935,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,935,5,0","type":4,"elements":"make it back on my feet, but the third time, I cannot get my leg to cooperate. As I struggle to get up, it gives out ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,935,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,935,6,0","type":4,"elements":"and Mags rolls off onto the ground before me. I flail around, trying to use vines and trunks to right myself. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,935,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,935,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick's back by my side, Peeta hanging over him. \"It's no use,\" I say. \"Can you take them both? Go on ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,935,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,935,8,0","type":4,"elements":"ahead, I'll catch up.\" A somewhat doubtful proposal, but I say it with as much","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,936","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,936,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,936,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,937","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,937,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,937,0,0","type":4,"elements":"surety as I can muster. I can see Finnick's eyes, green in the moonlight. I can see them as clear as day. Almost ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,937,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,937,1,0","type":4,"elements":"like a cat's, with a strange reflective quality. Maybe because they are shiny with tears. \"No,\" he says. \"I can't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,937,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,937,2,0","type":4,"elements":"carry them both. My arms aren't working.\" It's true. His arms jerk uncontrollably at his","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,938","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,938,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,938,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,939","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,939,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,939,0,0","type":4,"elements":"sides. His hands are empty. Of his three tridents, only one remains, and it's in Peeta's hands. \"I'm sorry, Mags. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,939,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,939,1,0","type":4,"elements":"can't do it.\" What happens next is so fast, so senseless, I can't even move to stop it. Mags hauls herself up, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,939,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,939,2,0","type":4,"elements":"plants a kiss on Finnick's lips, and then hobbles straight into the fog. Immediately, her body is seized by wild ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,939,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,939,3,0","type":4,"elements":"contortions and she falls to the ground in a horrible dance. I want to scream, but my throat is on fire. I take one ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,939,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,939,4,0","type":4,"elements":"futile step in her direction when I hear the cannon blast, know her heart has stopped,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,940","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,940,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,940,0,0","type":4,"elements":"that she is dead. \"Finnick?\" I call out hoarsely, but he has already turned from the scene, already continued his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,940,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,940,1,0","type":4,"elements":"retreat from the fog. Dragging my useless leg behind me, I stagger after him, having no idea what else to do. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,940,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,940,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Time and space lose meaning as the fog seems to invade my brain, muddling my thoughts, making everything ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,940,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,940,3,0","type":4,"elements":"unreal. Some deep-rooted animal desire for survival keeps me stumbling after Finnick and Peeta, continuing to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,940,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,940,4,0","type":4,"elements":"move, although I'm probably dead already. Parts of me are dead, or clearly dying. And Mags is dead. This is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,940,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,940,5,0","type":4,"elements":"something I know, or maybe just think I know, because it makes no sense at all. Moonlight glinting on Finnick's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,940,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,940,6,0","type":4,"elements":"bronze hair, beads of searing pain peppering me, a leg turned to wood. I follow Finnick until he collapses on the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,940,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,940,7,0","type":4,"elements":"ground, Peeta still on top of him. I seem to have no ability to stop my own forward motion and simply propel ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,940,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,940,8,0","type":4,"elements":"myself onward until I trip over their prone bodies,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,941","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,941,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,941,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,942","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,942,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,942,0,0","type":4,"elements":"just one more on the heap. This is where and how and when we all die, I think. But the thought is abstract and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,942,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,942,1,0","type":4,"elements":"far less alarming than the current agonies of my body. I hear Finnick groan and manage to drag myself off the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,942,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,942,2,0","type":4,"elements":"others. Now I can see the wall of fog, which has taken on a pearly white quality. Maybe it's my eyes playing ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,942,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,942,3,0","type":4,"elements":"tricks, or the moonlight, but the fog seems to be transforming. Yes, it's becoming thicker, as if it has pressed up ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,942,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,942,4,0","type":4,"elements":"against a glass window and is being forced to condense. I squint harder and realize the fingers no longer ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,942,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,942,5,0","type":4,"elements":"protrude from it. In fact, it has stopped moving forward entirely. Like other horrors I have witnessed in the arena, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,942,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,942,6,0","type":4,"elements":"it has reached the end of its territory. Either that or the Gamemakers have decided not to kill us just yet. \"It's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,942,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,942,7,0","type":4,"elements":"stopped,\" I try to say, but only an awful croaking sound comes from my swollen mouth. \"It's stopped,\" I say ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,942,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,942,8,0","type":4,"elements":"again, and this time I must be clearer,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,943","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,943,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,943,0,0","type":4,"elements":"because both Peeta and Finnick turn their heads to the fog. It begins to rise upward now, as if being slowly ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,943,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,943,1,0","type":4,"elements":"vacuumed into the sky. We watch until it has all been sucked away and not the slightest wisp remains. Peeta ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,943,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,943,2,0","type":4,"elements":"rolls off Finnick, who turns over onto his back. We lie there gasping, twitching, our minds and bodies invaded ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,943,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,943,3,0","type":4,"elements":"by the poison. After a few minutes pass, Peeta vaguely gestures upward. \"Mon-hees.\" I look up and spot a pair ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,943,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,943,4,0","type":4,"elements":"of what I guess are monkeys. I have never seen a live monkey-- there's nothing like that in our woods at home. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,943,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,943,5,0","type":4,"elements":"But I must have seen a","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,944","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,944,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,944,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,945","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,945,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,945,0,0","type":4,"elements":"picture, or one in the Games, because when I see the creatures, the same word comes to my mind. I think ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,945,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,945,1,0","type":4,"elements":"these have orange fur, although it's hard to tell, and are about half the size of a full-grown human. I take the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,945,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,945,2,0","type":4,"elements":"monkeys for a good sign. Surely they would not hang around if the air was","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,946","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,946,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,946,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,947","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,947,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,947,0,0","type":4,"elements":"deadly. For a while, we quietly observe one another, humans and monkeys. Then Peeta struggles to his knees ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,947,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,947,1,0","type":4,"elements":"and crawls down the slope. We all crawl, since walking now seems as remarkable a feat as flying; we crawl ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,947,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,947,2,0","type":4,"elements":"until the vines turn to a narrow strip of sandy beach and the warm water that surrounds the Cornucopia laps our ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,947,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,947,3,0","type":4,"elements":"faces. I jerk back as if I've touched an open flame. Rubbing salt in a wound. For the first time I truly appreciate ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,947,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,947,4,0","type":4,"elements":"the expression, because the salt in the water makes the pain of my wounds so blinding I nearly black out. But ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,947,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,947,5,0","type":4,"elements":"there's another sensation, of drawing out. I experiment by gingerly placing only my hand in the water. Torturous, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,947,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,947,6,0","type":4,"elements":"yes, but then less so. And through the blue layer of water, I see a milky substance leaching out of the wounds ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,947,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,947,7,0","type":4,"elements":"on my skin. As the whiteness diminishes, so does the pain. I unbuckle my belt and strip off my jumpsuit, which ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,947,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,947,8,0","type":4,"elements":"is little more than a perforated rag. My shoes and","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,948","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,948,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,948,0,0","type":4,"elements":"undergarments are inexplicably unaffected. Little by little, one small portion of a limb at a time, I soak the poison ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,948,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,948,1,0","type":4,"elements":"out of my wounds. Peeta seems to be doing the same. But Finnick backed away from the water at first touch ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,948,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,948,2,0","type":4,"elements":"and lies facedown on the sand, either unwilling or unable to purge himself. Finally, when I have survived the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,948,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,948,3,0","type":4,"elements":"worst, opening my eyes underwater, sniffing water into my sinuses and snorting it out, and even gargling ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,948,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,948,4,0","type":4,"elements":"repeatedly to wash out my throat, I'm functional enough to help Finnick. Some feeling has returned to my leg, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,948,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,948,5,0","type":4,"elements":"but my arms are still riddled with spasms. I can't drag Finnick into the water, and possibly the pain would kill ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,948,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,948,6,0","type":4,"elements":"him, anyway. So I scoop up shaky handfuls and empty them on his fists. Since he's not underwater, the poison ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,948,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,948,7,0","type":4,"elements":"comes out of his wounds just as it went in, in wisps of fog that I take great care to steer clear of. Peeta recovers ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,948,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,948,8,0","type":4,"elements":"enough to help me. He cuts away Finnick's jumpsuit.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,949","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,949,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,949,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,950","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,950,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,950,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Somewhere he finds two shells that work much better than our hands do. We concentrate on soaking Finnick's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,950,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,950,1,0","type":4,"elements":"arms first, since they have been so badly damaged, and even though a lot of white stuff pours out of them, he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,950,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,950,2,0","type":4,"elements":"doesn't notice. He just lies there, eyes shut, giving an occasional moan. I look around with growing awareness ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,950,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,950,3,0","type":4,"elements":"of how dangerous a position we're in. It's night, yes, but this moon gives off too much light for concealment. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,950,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,950,4,0","type":4,"elements":"We're lucky no one's attacked us yet. We could see them coming from the Cornucopia, but if all four Careers ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,950,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,950,5,0","type":4,"elements":"attacked, they'd overpower us. If they didn't spot us at first, Finnick's moans would give us away soon. \"We've ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,950,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,950,6,0","type":4,"elements":"got to get more of him into the water,\" I whisper. But we can't put him in face-first, not while he's in this condition. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,950,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,950,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta nods to Finnick's feet. We","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,951","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,951,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,951,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,952","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,952,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,952,0,0","type":4,"elements":"each take one, pull him one hundred and eighty","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,953","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,953,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,953,0,0","type":4,"elements":"degrees around, and start to drag him into the saltwater. Just a few inches at a time. His ankles. Wait a few ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,953,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,953,1,0","type":4,"elements":"minutes. Up to his midcalf. Wait. His knees. Clouds of white swirl out from his flesh and he groans. We continue ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,953,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,953,2,0","type":4,"elements":"to detoxify him, bit by bit. What I find is that the longer I sit in the water, the better I feel. Not just my skin, but my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,953,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,953,3,0","type":4,"elements":"brain and muscle control continue to improve. I can see Peeta's face beginning to return to normal, his eyelid ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,953,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,953,4,0","type":4,"elements":"opening, the grimace leaving his mouth. Finnick slowly begins to revive. His eyes open, focus on us, and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,953,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,953,5,0","type":4,"elements":"register awareness that he's being helped. I rest his head on my lap and we let him soak about ten minutes ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,953,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,953,6,0","type":4,"elements":"with everything immersed from the neck down. Peeta and I exchange a smile as Finnick lifts his arms above ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,953,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,953,7,0","type":4,"elements":"the seawater. \"There's just your head left, Finnick. That's the worst part, but you'll feel much better after, if you ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,953,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,953,8,0","type":4,"elements":"can bear it,\" Peeta says. We help him to sit up and let him","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,954","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,954,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,954,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,955","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,955,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,955,0,0","type":4,"elements":"grip our hands as he purges his eyes and nose and mouth. His throat is still too raw to speak. \"I'm going to try ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,955,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,955,1,0","type":4,"elements":"to tap a tree,\" I say. My fingers fumble at my belt and find the spile still hanging from its vine. \"Let me make the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,955,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,955,2,0","type":4,"elements":"hole first,\" says Peeta. \"You stay with him. You're the healer.\" That's a joke, I think. But I don't say it out loud, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,955,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,955,3,0","type":4,"elements":"since Finnick has enough to deal with. He got the worst of the fog, although I'm not sure why. Maybe because ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,955,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,955,4,0","type":4,"elements":"he's the biggest or maybe because he had to exert himself the most. And then, of course, there's Mags. I still ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,955,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,955,5,0","type":4,"elements":"don't understand what happened there. Why he essentially abandoned her to carry Peeta. Why she not only ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,955,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,955,6,0","type":4,"elements":"didn't question it, but ran straight to her death without a moment's hesitation. Was it because she was so old ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,955,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,955,7,0","type":4,"elements":"that her days were numbered, anyway? Did they think that Finnick would stand a better chance of winning if he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,955,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,955,8,0","type":4,"elements":"had Peeta and me as allies? The haggard look on Finnick's face","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,956","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,956,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,956,0,0","type":4,"elements":"tells me that now is not the moment to ask. Instead I try to put myself back together. I rescue my mockingjay pin ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,956,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,956,1,0","type":4,"elements":"from my ruined jumpsuit and pin it to the strap of my undershirt. The flotation belt must be acid resistant, since it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,956,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,956,2,0","type":4,"elements":"looks as good as new. I can swim, so the flotation belt's not really necessary, but Brutus blocked my arrow with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,956,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,956,3,0","type":4,"elements":"his, so I buckle it back on, thinking it might offer some protection. I undo my hair and comb it with my fingers, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,956,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,956,4,0","type":4,"elements":"thinning it out considerably since the fog droplets damaged it. Then I braid back what's left of it. Peeta has ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,956,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,956,5,0","type":4,"elements":"found a good tree about ten yards from the narrow strip of beach. We can hardly see him, but the sound of his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,956,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,956,6,0","type":4,"elements":"knife against the wooden trunk is crystal clear. I wonder what happened to the awl. Mags must've either ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,956,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,956,7,0","type":4,"elements":"dropped it or taken it into the fog with her. Anyway, it's gone. I have moved out a bit farther into the shallows, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,956,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,956,8,0","type":4,"elements":"floating alternately on my belly and back. If the seawater","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,957","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,957,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,957,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,958","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,958,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,958,0,0","type":4,"elements":"healed Peeta and me, it seems to be transforming","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,959","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,959,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,959,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,960","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,960,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,960,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick altogether. He begins to move slowly, just testing his limbs, and gradually begins to swim. But it's not ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,960,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,960,1,0","type":4,"elements":"like me swimming, the rhythmic strokes, the even pace. It's like watching some strange sea animal coming ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,960,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,960,2,0","type":4,"elements":"back to life. He dives and surfaces, spraying water out of his mouth, rolls over and over in some bizarre ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,960,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,960,3,0","type":4,"elements":"corkscrew motion that makes me dizzy even to watch. And then, when he's been underwater so long I feel ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,960,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,960,4,0","type":4,"elements":"certain he's drowned, his head pops up right next to me and I start. \"Don't do that,\" I say. \"What? Come up or ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,960,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,960,5,0","type":4,"elements":"stay under?\" he says. \"Either. Neither. Whatever. Just soak in the water and behave,\" I say. \"Or if you feel this ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,960,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,960,6,0","type":4,"elements":"good, let's go help Peeta.\" In just the short time it takes to cross to the edge of the jungle, I become aware of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,960,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,960,7,0","type":4,"elements":"the change. Put it down to years of hunting, or maybe my","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,961","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,961,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,961,0,0","type":4,"elements":"reconstructed ear does work a little better than anyone intended. But I sense the mass of warm bodies poised ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,961,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,961,1,0","type":4,"elements":"above us. They don't need to chatter or scream. The mere breathing of so many is enough. I touch Finnick's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,961,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,961,2,0","type":4,"elements":"arm and he follows my gaze upward. I don't know how they arrived so silently. Perhaps they didn't. We've all ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,961,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,961,3,0","type":4,"elements":"been absorbed in restoring our bodies. During that time they've assembled. Not five or ten but scores of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,961,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,961,4,0","type":4,"elements":"monkeys weigh down the limbs of the jungle trees. The pair we spotted when we first escaped the fog felt like a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,961,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,961,5,0","type":4,"elements":"welcoming committee. This crew feels ominous. I arm my bow with two arrows and Finnick adjusts the trident in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,961,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,961,6,0","type":4,"elements":"his hand. \"Peeta,\" I say as calmly as possible. \"I need your help with something.\" \"Okay, just a minute. I think ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,961,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,961,7,0","type":4,"elements":"I've just about got it,\" he says, still occupied with the tree. \"Yes, there. Have you got the spile?\" \"I do. But we've ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,961,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,961,8,0","type":4,"elements":"found something you'd better take a look at,\"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,962","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,962,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,962,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,963","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,963,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,963,0,0","type":4,"elements":"I continue in a measured voice. \"Only move toward us quietly, so you don't startle it.\" For some","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,964","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,964,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,964,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,965","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,965,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,965,0,0","type":4,"elements":"reason, I don't want him to notice the monkeys, or even glance their way. There are creatures that interpret ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,965,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,965,1,0","type":4,"elements":"mere eye contact as aggression. Peeta turns to us, panting from his work on the tree. The tone of my request is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,965,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,965,2,0","type":4,"elements":"so odd that it's alerted him to some irregularity. \"Okay,\" he says casually. He begins to move through the jungle, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,965,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,965,3,0","type":4,"elements":"and although I know he's trying hard to be quiet, this has never been his strong suit, even when he had two ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,965,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,965,4,0","type":4,"elements":"sound legs. But it's all right, he's moving, the monkeys are holding their positions. He's just five yards from the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,965,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,965,5,0","type":4,"elements":"beach when he senses them. His eyes only dart up for a second, but it's as if he's triggered a bomb. The ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,965,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,965,6,0","type":4,"elements":"monkeys explode into a shrieking mass of orange fur and converge on him. I've never seen any","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,966","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,966,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,966,0,0","type":4,"elements":"animal move so fast. They slide down the vines as if the things were greased. Leap impossible distances from ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,966,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,966,1,0","type":4,"elements":"tree to tree. Fangs bared, hackles raised, claws shooting out like switchblades. I may be unfamiliar with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,966,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,966,2,0","type":4,"elements":"monkeys, but animals in nature don't act like this. \"Mutts!\" I spit out as Finnick and I crash into the greenery. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,966,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,966,3,0","type":4,"elements":"know every arrow must count, and they do. In the eerie light, I bring down monkey after monkey, targeting eyes ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,966,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,966,4,0","type":4,"elements":"and hearts and throats, so that each hit means a death. But still it wouldn't be enough without Finnick spearing ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,966,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,966,5,0","type":4,"elements":"the beasts like fish and flinging them aside, Peeta slashing away with his knife. I feel claws on my leg, down my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,966,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,966,6,0","type":4,"elements":"back, before someone takes out the attacker. The air grows heavy with trampled plants, the scent of blood, and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,966,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,966,7,0","type":4,"elements":"the musty stink of the monkeys. Peeta and Finnick and I position ourselves in a triangle, a few yards apart, our ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,966,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,966,8,0","type":4,"elements":"backs to one another. My heart sinks as my","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,967","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,967,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,967,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,968","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,968,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,968,0,0","type":4,"elements":"fingers draw back my last arrow. Then I remember Peeta has a sheath, too. And he's not shooting, he's hacking ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,968,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,968,1,0","type":4,"elements":"away with that knife. My own knife is out now, but the monkeys are quicker, can spring in and out so fast you ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,968,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,968,2,0","type":4,"elements":"can barely react. \"Peeta!\" I shout. \"Your arrows!\" Peeta turns to see my predicament and is sliding off his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,968,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,968,3,0","type":4,"elements":"sheath when it happens. A monkey lunges out of a tree for his chest. I have no arrow, no way to shoot. I can ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,968,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,968,4,0","type":4,"elements":"hear the thud of Finnick's trident finding another mark and know his weapon is occupied. Peeta's knife arm is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,968,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,968,5,0","type":4,"elements":"disabled as he tries to remove the sheath. I throw my knife at the oncoming mutt but the creature somersaults, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,968,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,968,6,0","type":4,"elements":"evading the blade, and stays on its trajectory. Weaponless, defenseless, I do the only thing I can think of. I run ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,968,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,968,7,0","type":4,"elements":"for Peeta, to knock him to the ground, to protect his body with mine, even though I know I won't make it in time. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,968,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,968,8,0","type":4,"elements":"She does, though. Materializing, it seems,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,969","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,969,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,969,0,0","type":4,"elements":"from thin air. One moment nowhere, the next reeling in front of Peeta. Already bloody, mouth open in a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,969,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,969,1,0","type":4,"elements":"high-pitched scream, pupils enlarged so her eyes seem like black holes. The insane morphling from District 6 ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,969,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,969,2,0","type":4,"elements":"throws up her skeletal arms as if to embrace the monkey, and it sinks its fangs into her chest. Peeta drops the ","format_