y lifts up the morphling and carries her the last few yards to the beach while Finnick and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,973,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,973,1,0","type":4,"elements":"I keep our weapons at the ready. But except for the orange carcasses on the ground, the monkeys are gone. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,973,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,973,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta lays the morphling on the sand. I cut away the material over her chest, revealing the four deep puncture ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,973,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,973,3,0","type":4,"elements":"wounds. Blood slowly trickles from them, making them look far less deadly than they are. The real damage is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,973,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,973,4,0","type":4,"elements":"inside. By the position of the openings, I feel certain the beast ruptured something vital, a lung, maybe even her ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,973,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,973,5,0","type":4,"elements":"heart. She lies on the sand, gasping like a fish out of water. Sagging skin, sickly green, her ribs as prominent as ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,973,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,973,6,0","type":4,"elements":"a child's dead of starvation. Surely she could afford food, but turned to the morphling just as Haymitch turned to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,973,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,973,7,0","type":4,"elements":"drink, I guess. Everything about her speaks of waste--her body, her life, the vacant look in her eyes. I hold one ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,973,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,973,8,0","type":4,"elements":"of her twitching hands, unclear whether it","format_id":"93e3f29c-09