l wet with monkey blood. He drops them beside me on the sand. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,979,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,979,5,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Thought you might want these.\" \"Thanks,\" I say. I wade into the water and wash off the gore, from my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,979,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,979,6,0","type":4,"elements":"weapons, my wounds. By the time I return to the jungle to gather some moss to dry them, all the monkeys' ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,979,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,979,7,0","type":4,"elements":"bodies have vanished. \"Where did they go?\" I ask. \"We don't know exactly. The vines shifted and they were ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,979,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,979,8,0","type":4,"elements":"gone,\" says Finnick. We stare at the jungle, numb and exhausted. In the quiet, I notice that","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,980","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,980,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,980,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,981","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,981,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,981,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the spots where the fog droplets touched my skin have scabbed over. They've stopped hurting and begun to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,981,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,981,1,0","type":4,"elements":"itch. Intensely. I try to think of this as a good sign. That they are healing. I glance over at Peeta, at Finnick, and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,981,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,981,2,0","type":4,"elements":"see they're both scratching at their damaged faces. Yes, even Finnick's beauty has been marred by this night. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,981,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,981,3,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Don't scratch,\" I say, wanting badly to scratch myself. But I know it's the advice my mother would give. \"You'll ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,981,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,981,4,0","type":4,"elements":"only bring infection. Think it's safe to try for the water again?\" We make our way back to the tree Peeta was ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,981,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,981,5,0","type":4,"elements":"tapping. Finnick and I stand with our weapons poised while he works the spile in, but no threat appears. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,981,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,981,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta's found a good vein and the water begins to gush from the spile. We slake our thirst, let the warm water ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,981,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,981,7,0","type":4,"elements":"pour over our itching bodies. We fill a handful of shells with drinking water and go back to the beach. It's still ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,981,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,981,8,0","type":4,"elements":"night, though dawn can't be too many hours away. Unless the Gamemakers want","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,982","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,982,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,982,0,0","type":4,"elements":"it to be. \"Why don't you two get some rest?\" I say. \"I'll watch for a while.\" \"No, Katniss, I'd rather,\" says Finnick. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,982,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,982,1,0","type":4,"elements":"look in his eyes, at his face, and realize he's barely holding back tears. Mags. The least I can do is give him the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,982,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,982,2,0","type":4,"elements":"privacy to mourn her. \"All right, Finnick, thanks,\" I say. I lie down on the sand with Peeta, who drifts off at once. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,982,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,982,3,0","type":4,"elements":"stare into the night, thinking of what a difference a day makes. How yesterday morning, Finnick was on my kill ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,982,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,982,4,0","type":4,"elements":"list, and now I'm willing to sleep with him as my guard. He saved Peeta and let Mags die and I don't know why. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,982,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,982,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Only that I can never settle the balance owed between us. All I can do at the moment is go to sleep and let him","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,983","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,983,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,983,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,984","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,984,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,984,0,0","type":4,"elements":"grieve in peace. And so I do. It's midmorning when I open my eyes again. Peeta's still out beside me. Above us, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,984,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,984,1,0","type":4,"elements":"a mat of grass suspended on branches shields our faces from","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,985","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,985,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,985,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,986","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,986,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,986,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the sunlight. I sit up and see that Finnick's hands have not been idle. Two woven bowls are filled with fresh ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,986,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,986,1,0","type":4,"elements":"water. A third holds a mess of shellfish. Finnick sits on the sand, cracking them open with a stone. \"They're ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,986,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,986,2,0","type":4,"elements":"better fresh,\" he says, ripping a chunk of flesh from a shell and popping it into his mouth. His eyes are still puffy ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,986,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,986,3,0","type":4,"elements":"but I pretend not to notice. My stomach begins to growl at the smell of food and I reach for one. The sight of my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,986,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,986,4,0","type":4,"elements":"fingernails, caked with blood, stops me. I've been scratching my skin raw in my sleep. \"You know, if you scratch ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,986,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,986,5,0","type":4,"elements":"you'll bring on infection,\" says Finnick. \"That's what I've heard,\" I say. I go into the saltwater and wash off the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,986,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,986,6,0","type":4,"elements":"blood, trying to decide which I hate more, pain or itching. Fed up, I stomp back onto the beach, turn my face ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,986,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,986,7,0","type":4,"elements":"upward, and snap, \"Hey, Haymitch, if you're not too drunk, we could use a little something for our skin.\" It's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,986,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,986,8,0","type":4,"elements":"almost funny how quickly the parachute appears above me.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,987","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,987,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,987,0,0","type":4,"elements":"I reach up and the tube lands squarely in my open hand. \"About time,\" I say, but I can't keep the scowl on my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,987,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,987,1,0","type":4,"elements":"face. Haymitch. What I wouldn't give for five minutes of conversation with him. I plunk down on the sand next to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,987,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,987,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick and screw the lid off the tube. Inside is a thick, dark ointment with a pungent smell, a combination of tar ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,987,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,987,3,0","type":4,"elements":"and pine needles. I wrinkle my nose as I squeeze a glob of the medicine onto my palm and begin to massage it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,987,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,987,4,0","type":4,"elements":"into my leg. A sound of pleasure slips out of my mouth as the stuff eradicates my itching. It also stains my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,987,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,987,5,0","type":4,"elements":"scabby skin a ghastly gray-green. As I start on the second leg I toss the tube to Finnick, who eyes me ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,987,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,987,6,0","type":4,"elements":"doubtfully. \"It's like you're decomposing,\" says Finnick. But I guess the itching wins out, because after a minute ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,987,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,987,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick begins to treat his own skin, too. Really, the combination of the scabs and the ointment looks hideous. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,987,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,987,8,0","type":4,"elements":"can't help enjoying his distress. \"Poor","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,988","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,988,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,988,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,989","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,989,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,989,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick. Is this the first time in your life you haven't looked pretty?\" I say. \"It must be. The sensation's completely ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,989,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,989,1,0","type":4,"elements":"new. How have you managed it all these years?\" he asks. \"Just avoid mirrors. You'll forget about it,\" I say. \"Not ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,989,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,989,2,0","type":4,"elements":"if I keep looking at you,\" he says. We slather ourselves down, even taking turns rubbing the ointment into each ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,989,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,989,3,0","type":4,"elements":"other's backs where the undershirts don't protect our skin. \"I'm going to wake Peeta,\" I say. \"No, wait,\" says ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,989,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,989,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick. \"Let's do it together. Put our faces right in front of his.\" Well, there's so little opportunity for fun left in my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,989,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,989,5,0","type":4,"elements":"life, I agree. We position ourselves on either side of Peeta, lean over until our faces are inches from his nose, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,989,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,989,6,0","type":4,"elements":"and give him a shake. \"Peeta. Peeta, wake up,\" I say in a soft, singsong voice. His eyelids flutter open and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,989,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,989,7,0","type":4,"elements":"then he jumps like we've stabbed him. \"Aa!\" Finnick and I fall back in the sand,laughing our heads off. Every ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,989,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,989,8,0","type":4,"elements":"time we try to stop, we look at Peeta's attempt to maintain a disdainful expression and it sets us off again. By ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,989,9","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,989,9,0","type":4,"elements":"the time we pull ourselves together, I'm thinking that maybe Finnick Odair is all right. At least not as vain or ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,989,10","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,989,10,0","type":4,"elements":"self-important as I'd thought. Not so bad at all,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,990","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,990,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,990,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,991","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,991,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,991,0,0","type":4,"elements":"really. And just as I've come to this conclusion, a parachute lands next to us with a fresh loaf of bread. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,991,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,991,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Remembering from last year how Haymitch's gifts are often timed to send a message, I make a note to myself. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,991,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,991,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Be friends with Finnick. You'll get food. Finnick turns the bread over in his hands, examining the crust. A bit too ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,991,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,991,3,0","type":4,"elements":"possessively. It's not necessary. It's got that green tint from seaweed that the bread from District 4 always has. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,991,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,991,4,0","type":4,"elements":"We all know it's his. Maybe he's just realized how precious it is, and that he may never see another loaf again. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,991,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,991,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Maybe some memory of Mags is","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,992","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,992,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,992,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,993","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,993,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,993,0,0","type":4,"elements":"associated with the crust. But all he says is, \"This will go well with the shellfish.\" While I help Peeta coat his skin ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,993,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,993,1,0","type":4,"elements":"with the ointment, Finnick deftly cleans the meat from the shellfish. We gather round and eat the delicious ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,993,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,993,2,0","type":4,"elements":"sweet flesh with the salty bread from District 4. We all look monstrous--the ointment seems to be causing some ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,993,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,993,3,0","type":4,"elements":"of the scabs to peel -- but I'm glad for the medicine. Not just because it gives relief from the itching, but also ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,993,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,993,4,0","type":4,"elements":"because it acts as protection from that blazing white sun in the pink sky. By its position, I estimate it must be ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,993,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,993,5,0","type":4,"elements":"going on ten o'clock, that we've been in the arena for about a day. Eleven of us are dead. Thirteen alive. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,993,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,993,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Somewhere in the jungle, ten are concealed. Three or four are the Careers. I don't really feel like trying to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,993,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,993,7,0","type":4,"elements":"remember who the others are. For me, the jungle has quickly evolved from a place of protection to a sinister ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,993,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,993,8,0","type":4,"elements":"trap. I know at some point we'll be forced to reenter","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,994","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,994,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,994,0,0","type":4,"elements":"its depths, either to hunt or be hunted, but for right now I'm planning to stick to our little beach. And I don't hear ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,994,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,994,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta or Finnick suggesting we do otherwise. For a while the jungle seems almost static, humming, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,994,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,994,2,0","type":4,"elements":"shimmering, but not flaunting its dangers. Then, in the distance, comes screaming. Across from us, a wedge of ","f