e":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1001,6,0","type":4,"elements":"knife in the back at the Cornucopia. And her--\" We all look over at Wiress, who's circling around, coated in dried ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1001,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1001,7,0","type":4,"elements":"blood, and murmuring, \"Tick, tock. Tick, tock.\" \"Yeah, we know. Tick, tock. Nuts is in shock,\" says Johanna. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1001,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1001,8,0","type":4,"elements":"This seems to draw Wiress in her direction and she","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1002","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1002,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1002,0,0","type":4,"elements":"careens into Johanna, who harshly shoves her to the beach. \"Just stay down, will you?\" \"Lay off her,\" I snap. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1002,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1002,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Johanna narrows her brown eyes at me in hatred. \"Lay off her?\" she hisses. She steps forward before I can ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1002,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1002,2,0","type":4,"elements":"react and slaps me so hard I see stars. \"Who do you think got them out of that bleeding jungle for you? You--\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1002,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1002,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick tosses her writhing body over his shoulder and carries her out into the water and repeatedly dunks her ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1002,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1002,4,0","type":4,"elements":"while she screams a lot of really insulting things at me. But I don't shoot. Because she's with Finnick and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1002,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1002,5,0","type":4,"elements":"because of what she said, about getting them for me. \"What did she mean? She got them for me?\" I ask Peeta. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1002,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1002,6,0","type":4,"elements":"\"I don't know. You did want them originally,\" he","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1003","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1003,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1003,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1004","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1004,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1004,0,0","type":4,"elements":"reminds me. \"Yeah, I did. Originally.\" But that answers nothing. I look down at Beetee's inert body. \"But I won't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1004,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1004,1,0","type":4,"elements":"have them long unless we do something.\" Peeta lifts Beetee up in","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1005","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1005,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1005,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1006","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1006,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1006,0,0","type":4,"elements":"his arms and I take Wiress by the hand and we go back to our little beach camp. I sit Wiress in the shallows so ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1006,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1006,1,0","type":4,"elements":"she can get washed up a bit, but she just clutches her hands together and occasionally mumbles, \"Tick, tock.\" I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1006,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1006,2,0","type":4,"elements":"unhook Beetee's belt and find a heavy metal cylinder attached to the side with a rope of vines. I can't tell what it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1006,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1006,3,0","type":4,"elements":"is, but if he thought it was worth saving, I'm not going to be the one who loses it. I toss it up on the sand. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1006,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1006,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Beetee's clothes are glued to him with blood, so Peeta holds him in the water while I loosen them. It takes ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1006,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1006,5,0","type":4,"elements":"some time to get the jumpsuit off, and then we find his undergarments are saturated with blood as well. There's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1006,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1006,6,0","type":4,"elements":"no choice but to strip him naked to get him clean, but I have to say this doesn't make much of an impression on ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1006,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1006,7,0","type":4,"elements":"me anymore. Our kitchen table's been full of so many naked men this year. You kind of get used to it after a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1006,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1006,8,0","type":4,"elements":"while. We put down Finnick's mat and lay Beetee on his","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1007","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1007,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1007,0,0","type":4,"elements":"stomach so we can examine his back. There's a gash about six inches long running from his shoulder blade to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1007,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1007,1,0","type":4,"elements":"below his ribs. Fortunately it's not too deep. He's lost a lot of blood, though--you can tell by the pallor of his skin ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1007,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1007,2,0","type":4,"elements":"-- and it's still oozing out of the wound. I sit back on my heels, trying to think. What do I have to work with? ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1007,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1007,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Seawater? I feel like my mother when her first line of defense for treating everything was snow. I look over at ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1007,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1007,4,0","type":4,"elements":"the jungle. I bet there's a whole pharmacy in there if I knew how to use it. But these aren't my plants. Then I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1007,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1007,5,0","type":4,"elements":"think about the moss Mags gave me to blow my nose. \"Be right back,\" I tell Peeta. Fortunately the stuff seems ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1007,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1007,6,0","type":4,"elements":"to be pretty common in the jungle. I rip an armful from the nearby trees and carry it back to the beach. I make a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1007,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1007,7,0","type":4,"elements":"thick pad out of the moss, place it on Beetee's cut, and secure it by tying vines around his body. We get some ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1007,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1007,8,0","type":4,"elements":"water into him and then pull him into the shade at the edge of the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1008","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1008,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1008,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1009","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,0,0","type":4,"elements":"jungle. \"I think that's all we can do,\" I say. \"It's good. You're good with this healing stuff,\" he says. \"It's in your ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,1,0","type":4,"elements":"blood.\" \"No,\" I say, shaking my head. \"I got my father's blood.\" The kind that quickens during a hunt, not an ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,2,0","type":4,"elements":"epidemic. \"I'm going to see about Wiress.\" I take a handful of the moss to use as a rag and join Wiress in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,3,0","type":4,"elements":"shallows. She doesn't resist as I work off her clothing, scrub the blood from her skin. But her eyes are dilated ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,4,0","type":4,"elements":"with fear, and when I speak, she doesn't respond except to say with ever-increasing urgency, \"Tick, tock.\" She ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,5,0","type":4,"elements":"does seem to be trying to tell me something, but with no Beetee to explain her thoughts, I'm at a loss. \"Yes, tick, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,6,0","type":4,"elements":"tock. Tick, tock,\" I say. This seems to calm her down a little. I wash out her jumpsuit until there's hardly a trace ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,7,0","type":4,"elements":"of blood, and help her back into it. It's not damaged like ours were. Herbelt's fine, so I fasten that on, too. Then I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,8,0","type":4,"elements":"pin her undergarments, along with Beetee's, under some rocks and let them soak. By the time I've rinsed out ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,9","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,9,0","type":4,"elements":"Beetee's jumpsuit, a shiny clean Johanna and peeling Finnick have joined us. For a while, Johanna gulps ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,10","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,10,0","type":4,"elements":"water and stuffs herself with shellfish while I try to coax something into Wiress. Finnick tells about the fog and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,11","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,11,0","type":4,"elements":"the monkeys in a detached, almost clinical voice, avoiding the most important detail of the story. Everybody ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,12","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,12,0","type":4,"elements":"offers to guard while the others rest, but in the end, it's Johanna and I who stay up. Me because I'm really ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,13","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,13,0","type":4,"elements":"rested, she because she simply refuses to lie down. The two of us sit in silence on the beach until the others ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,14","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,14,0","type":4,"elements":"have gone to sleep. Johanna glances over at Finnick, to be sure, then turns to me. \"How'd you lose Mags?\" \"In ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,15","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,15,0","type":4,"elements":"the fog. Finnick had Peeta. I had Mags for a while. Then I couldn't lift her. Finnick said he couldn't take them ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1009,16","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1009,16,0","type":4,"elements":"both. She kissed him and walked right","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1010","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1010,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1010,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1011","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1011,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1011,0,0","type":4,"elements":"into the poison,\" I say. \"She was Finnick's mentor, you know,\" Johanna says accusingly. \"No, I didn't,\" I say. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1011,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1011,1,0","type":4,"elements":"\"She was half his family,\" she says a few moments later, but there's less venom behind it. We watch the water ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1011,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1011,2,0","type":4,"elements":"lap up over the undergarments. \"So what were you doing with Nuts and Volts?\" I ask. \"I told you -- I got them for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1011,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1011,3,0","type":4,"elements":"you. Haymitch said if we were to be allies I had to bring them to you,\" says Johanna. \"That's what you told him, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1011,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1011,4,0","type":4,"elements":"right?\" No, I think. But I nod my head in assent. \"Thanks. I appreciate it.\" \"I hope so.\" She gives me a look filled ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1011,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1011,5,0","type":4,"elements":"with loathing, like I'm the biggest drag possible on her life. I wonder if this is what it's like to have an older sister ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1011,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1011,6,0","type":4,"elements":"who really hates you. \"Tick, tock,\" I hear behind me. I turn and see Wiress has crawled over. Her eyes are ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1011,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1011,7,0","type":4,"elements":"focused on the jungle. \"Oh, goody, she's back. Okay, I'm going to sleep. You and Nuts can guard together,\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1011,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1011,8,0","type":4,"elements":"Johanna says. She goes over and flings herself down beside Finnick.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1012","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1012,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1012,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Tick, tock,\" whispers Wiress. I guide her in front of me and get her to lie down, stroking her arm to soothe her. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1012,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1012,1,0","type":4,"elements":"She drifts off, stirring restlessly, occasionally sighing out her phrase. \"Tick, tock.\" \"Tick, tock,\" I agree softly. \"It's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1012,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1012,2,0","type":4,"elements":"time for bed. Tick, tock. Go to sleep.\" The sun rises in the sky until it's directly over us. It must be noon, I think ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1012,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1012,3,0","type":4,"elements":"absently. Not that it matters. Across the water, off to the right, I see the enormous flash as the lightning bolt hits ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1012,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1012,4,0","type":4,"elements":"the tree and the electrical storm begins again. Right in the same area it did last night. Someone must have ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1012,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1012,5,0","type":4,"elements":"moved into its range, triggered the attack. I sit for a while watching the lightning, keeping Wiress calm, lulled into ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1012,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1012,6,0","type":4,"elements":"a sort of peacefulness by the lapping of the water. I think of last night, how the lightning began just after the bell ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1012,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1012,7,0","type":4,"elements":"tolled. Twelve bongs. \"Tick, tock,\" Wiress says, surfacing to consciousness for a moment and then going back ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1012,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1012,8,0","type":4,"elements":"under. Twelve bongs last night. Like it was","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1013","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1013,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1013,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1014","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1014,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1014,0,0","type":4,"elements":"midnight. Then lightning. The sun","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1015","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1015,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1015,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1016","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1016,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1016,0,0","type":4,"elements":"overhead now. Like it's noon. And lightning. Slowly I rise up and survey the arena. The lightning there. In the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1016,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1016,1,0","type":4,"elements":"next pie wedge over came the blood rain, where Johanna, Wiress, and Beetee were caught. We would have ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1016,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1016,2,0","type":4,"elements":"been in the third section, right next to that, when the fog appeared. And as soon as it was sucked away, the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1016,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1016,3,0","type":4,"elements":"monkeys began to gather in the fourth. Tick, tock. My head snaps to the other side. A couple of hours ago, at ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1016,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1016,4,0","type":4,"elements":"around ten, that wave came out of the second section to the left of where the lightning strikes now. At","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1017","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1017,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1017,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1018","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1018,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1018,0,0","type":4,"elements":"noon. At midnight. At noon. \"Tick, tock,\" Wiress says in her sleep. As the lightning ceases and the blood rain ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1018,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1018,1,0","type":4,"elements":"begins just to the right of it, her words suddenly make sense. \"Oh,\" I","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1019","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1019,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1019,0,0","type":4,"elements":"say under my breath. \"Tick, tock.\" My eyes sweep around the full circle of the arena and I know she's right. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1019,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1019,1,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Tick, tock. This is a clock.\" A clock. I can almost see the hands ticking around the twelve-sectioned face of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1019,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1019,2,0","type":4,"elements":"arena. Each hour begins a new horror, a new Gamemaker weapon, and ends the previous. Lightning, blood ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1019,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1019,3,0","type":4,"elements":"rain, fog, monkeys -- those are the first four hours on the clock. And at ten, the wave. I don't know what ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1019,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1019,4,0","type":4,"elements":"happens in the other seven, but I know Wiress is right. At present, the blood rain's falling and we're on the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1019,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1019,5,0","type":4,"elements":"beach below the monkey segment, far too close to the fog for my liking. Do the various attacks stay within the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1019,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1019,6,0","type":4,"elements":"confines of the jungle? Not necessarily. The wave didn't. If that fog leaches out of the jungle, or the monkeys ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1019,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1019,7,0","type":4,"elements":"return ... \"Get up,\" I order, shaking Peeta and Finnick and Johanna awake. \"Get up--we have to move.\" There's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1019,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1019,8,0","type":4,"elements":"enough time, though, to explain the clock theory to them. About Wiress's","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1020","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1020,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1020,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1021","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1021,0","type":3,"elements":[{