t do, die?\" asks Johanna. \"It","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1033","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1033,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1033,0,0","type":4,"elements":"stops singing first. That's when you should get out. But if the air's too bad, it dies, yes. And so do you.\" I don't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1033,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1033,1,0","type":4,"elements":"want to talk about dying songbirds. They bring up thoughts of my father's death and Rue's death and Maysilee ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1033,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1033,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Donner's death and my mother inheriting her songbird. Oh, great, and now I'm thinking of Gale, deep down in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1033,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1033,3,0","type":4,"elements":"that horrible mine, with President Snow's threat hanging over his head. So easy to make it look like an accident ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1033,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1033,4,0","type":4,"elements":"down there. A silent canary, a spark, and nothing more. I go back to imagining killing the president. Despite her ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1033,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1033,5,0","type":4,"elements":"annoyance at Wiress, Johanna's as happy as I've seen her in the arena. While I'm adding to my stock of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1033,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1033,6,0","type":4,"elements":"arrows, she pokes around until she comes up with a pair of lethal-looking axes. It seems an odd choice until I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1033,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1033,7,0","type":4,"elements":"see her throw one with such force it sticks in the sun-softened gold of the Cornucopia. Of course. Johanna ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1033,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1033,8,0","type":4,"elements":"Mason. District 7. Lumber. I bet she's been tossing around axes since she","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1034","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1034,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1034,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1035","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1035,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1035,0,0","type":4,"elements":"could toddle. It's like Finnick with his trident. Or Beetee with his wire. Rue with her knowledge of plants. I realize ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1035,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1035,1,0","type":4,"elements":"it's just another disadvantage the District 12 tributes have faced over the years. We don't go down in the mines ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1035,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1035,2,0","type":4,"elements":"until we're eighteen. It looks like","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1036","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1036,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1036,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1037","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1037,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1037,0,0","type":4,"elements":"most of the other tributes learn something about their trades early on. There are things you do in a mine that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1037,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1037,1,0","type":4,"elements":"could come in handy in the Games. Wielding a pick. Blowing things up. Give you an edge. The way my hunting ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0