han we knew this morning, anyway.\" We all nod in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1040,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1040,3,0","type":4,"elements":"agreement, and that's when I notice it. The silence. Our canary has stopped singing. I don't wait. I load an ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1040,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1040,4,0","type":4,"elements":"arrow as I twist and get a glimpse of a dripping-wet Gloss letting Wiress slide to the ground, her throat slit open ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1040,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1040,5,0","type":4,"elements":"in a bright red smile. The point of my arrow disappears into his right temple, and in the instant it takes to reload, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1040,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1040,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Johanna has buried an ax blade in Cashmere's chest. Finnick knocks away a spear Brutus throws at Peeta ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1040,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1040,7,0","type":4,"elements":"and takes Enobaria's knife in his thigh. If there wasn't a Cornucopia to duck behind, they'd be dead, both of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1040,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1040,8,0","type":4,"elements":"tributes from District 2. I spring forward in pursuit. Boom! Boom! Boom!","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1041","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1041,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1041,0,0","type":4,"elements":"The cannon confirms there's no way to help Wiress, no need to finish off Gloss or Cashmere. My allies and I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1041,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1041,1,0","type":4,"elements":"are rounding the horn, starting to give chase to Brutus and Enobaria, who 