p onto the sand and pull myself from the water, her ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1048,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1048,6,0","type":4,"elements":"body's gone. But I can still taste her blood mingled with the sea salt. I walk back to the Cornucopia. Finnick's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1048,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1048,7,0","type":4,"elements":"gotten Beetee back alive, although a little waterlogged, sitting up and snorting out water. He had the good ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1048,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1048,8,0","type":4,"elements":"sense to hang on to his glasses, so at least he can see. I","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1049","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1049,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1049,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1050","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1050,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1050,0,0","type":4,"elements":"place the reel of wire on his lap. It's sparkling clean, no blood left at all. He unravels a piece of the wire and runs ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1050,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1050,1,0","type":4,"elements":"it through his fingers. For the first time I see it, and it's unlike any wire I know. A pale golden color and as fine as ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1050,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1050,2,0","type":4,"elements":"a piece of hair. I wonder how long it is. There must be miles of the stuff to fill the large spool. But I don't ask, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1050,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1050,3,0","type":4,"elements":"because I know he's thinking of Wiress. I look at the others' sober faces. Now Finnick, Johanna, and Beetee ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1050,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1050,4,0","type":4,"elements":"have all lost their district partners. I cross to Peeta and wrap my arms around him, and for a while we all stay ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1050,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1050,5,0","type":4,"elements":"silent. \"Let's get off this stinking island,\" Johanna says finally. There's only the matter of our weapons now, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1050,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1050,6,0","type":4,"elements":"which we've largely retained. Fortunately the vines here are strong and the spile and tube of medicine wrapped ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1050,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1050,7,0","type":4,"elements":"in the parachute are still secured to my belt. Finnick strips off his undershirt and ties it around the wound ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1050,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1050,8,0","type":4,"elements":"Enobaria's knife made in his thigh; it's not deep. Beetee thinks","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1051","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1051,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1051,0,0","type":4,"elements":"he can walk now, if we go slowly, so I help him up. We decide to head to the beach at twelve o'clock. That ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1051,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1051,1,0","type":4,"elements":"should provide hours of calm and keep us clear of any poisonous residue. And then Peeta, Johanna, and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1051,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1051,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick head off in","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1052","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"