id":"0,1061,4,0","type":4,"elements":"to choose him over myself? Certainly he is brave, but we have all been brave enough to survive a Games. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1061,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1061,5,0","type":4,"elements":"There is that quality of goodness that's hard to overlook, but still ... and then I think of it, what Peeta can do so ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1061,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1061,6,0","type":4,"elements":"much better than the rest of us. He can use words. He obliterated the rest of the field at both interviews. And ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1061,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1061,7,0","type":4,"elements":"maybe it's because of that underlying goodness that he can move a crowd--no, a country--to his side with the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1061,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1061,8,0","type":4,"elements":"turn of a simple sentence. I remember thinking that was the gift the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1062","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1062,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1062,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1063","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1063,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1063,0,0","type":4,"elements":"leader of our revolution should have. Has Haymitch convinced the others of this? That Peeta's tongue would ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1063,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1063,1,0","type":4,"elements":"have far greater power against the Capitol than any physical strength the rest of us could claim? I don't know. It ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1063,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1063,2,0","type":4,"elements":"still seems like a really long leap for some of the tributes. I mean, we're talking about Johanna Mason here. But ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1063,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1063,3,0","type":4,"elements":"what other explanation can there be for their decided efforts to keep him alive? \"Katniss, got that spile?\" Finnick ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1063,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1063,4,0","type":4,"elements":"asks, snapping me back to reality. I cut the vine that ties the spile to my belt and hold the metal tube out to him. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1063,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1063,5,0","type":4,"elements":"That's when I hear the scream. So full of fear and pain it ices my blood. And so familiar. I drop the spile, forget ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1063,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1063,6,0","type":4,"elements":"where I am or what lies ahead, only know I must reach her, protect her. I run wildly in the direction of the voice, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1063,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1063,7,0","type":4,"elements":"heedless of danger, ripping through vines and branches, through anything that keeps me from reaching her. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1063,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1063,8,0","type":4,"elements":"From reaching my little sister. Where is","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1064","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1064,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1064,0,0","type":4,"elements":"she? What are they doing to her? \"Prim!\" I cry out. \"Prim!\" Only another agonized scream answers me. How did ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1064,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1064,1,0","type":4,"elements":"she get here? Why is she part of the Games? \"Prim!\" Vines cut into my face and arms, creepers grab my feet. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1064,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1064,2,0","type":4,"elements":"But I am getting closer to her. Closer. Very close now. Sweat pours down my face, stinging the healing acid ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1064,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1064,3,0","type":4,"elements":"wounds. I pant, trying to get some use out of the warm, moist air that seems empty of oxygen. Prim makes a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1064,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1064,4,0","type":4,"elements":"sound -- such a lost, irretrievable sound--that I can't even imagine what they have done to evoke it. \"Prim!\" I rip ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1064,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1064,5,0","type":4,"elements":"through a wall of green into a small clearing and the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1065","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1065,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1065,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1066","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1066,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1066,0,0","type":4,"elements":"sound repeats directly above me. Above me? My head whips back. Do they have her up in the trees? I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1066,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1066,1,0","type":4,"elements":"desperately search the branches but see nothing. \"Prim?\" I say pleadingly. I hear her but can't see her. Her ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1066,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1066,2,0","type":4,"elements":"next wail rings","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1067","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,106