eck for good measure. Then I hurl the revolting thing into the jungle. No degree of hunger would ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1068,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1068,8,0","type":4,"elements":"ever tempt me to eat it. It wasn't real, I tell myself. The same","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1069","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1069,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1069,0,0","type":4,"elements":"way the muttation wolves last year weren't really the dead tributes. It's just a sadistic trick of the Gamemakers. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1069,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1069,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick crashes into the clearing to find me wiping my arrow clean with some moss. \"Katniss?\" \"It's okay. I'm ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1069,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1069,2,0","type":4,"elements":"okay,\" I say, although I don't feel okay at all. \"I thought I heard my sister but--\" The piercing shriek cuts me off. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1069,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1069,3,0","type":4,"elements":"It's another voice, not Prim's, maybe a young woman's. I don't recognize it. But the effect on Finnick is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1069,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1069,4,0","type":4,"elements":"instantaneous. The color vanishes from his face and I can actually see his pupils dilate in fear. \"Finnick, wait!\" I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1069,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1069,5,0","type":4,"elements":"say, reaching out to reassure him, but he's bolted away. Gone off in pursuit of the victim, as mindlessly as I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1069,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1069,6,0","type":4,"elements":"pursued Prim. \"Finnick!\" I call, but I know he won't turn back and wait for me to give a rational explanation. So ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1069,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1069,7,0","type":4,"elements":"all I can do is follow him. It's no effort to track him, even though he's moving so fast, since he leaves a clear, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1069,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1069,8,0","type":4,"elements":"trampled path in his wake. But the bird is at least a quarter mile away, most of","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1070","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1070,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1070,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1071","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1071,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1071,0,0","type":4,"elements":"it uphill, and by the time I reach him, I'm winded. He's circling around a giant tree. The trunk must be four feet in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1071,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1071,1,0","type":4,"elements":"diameter and the limbs don't even begin until twenty feet up. The woman's shrieks emanate from somewhere in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1071,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1071,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the foliage, but the jabberjay's concealed. Finnick's screaming as well, over and over. \"Annie! Annie!\" He's in a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1071,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1071,3,0","type":4,"elements":"state of panic and completely unreachable, so I do what I would do anyway. I scale an adjacent tree, locate the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1071,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1071,4,0","type":4,"elements":"jabberjay, and take it out with an arrow. It falls straight down, landing right at Finnick's feet. He picks it up, slowly ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1071,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1071,5,0","type":4,"elements":"making the connection, but when I slide down to join him, he looks more despairing than ever. \"It's all right, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1071,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1071,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick. It's just a jabberjay. They're playing a trick on us,\" I say. \"It's not real. It's not your ... Annie.\" \"No,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1072","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1072,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1072,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1073","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1073,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1073,0,0","type":4,"elements":"it's not Annie. But the voice was hers. Jabberjays","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1074","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1074,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1074,0,0","type":4,"elements":"mimic what they hear. Where did they get those screams, Katniss?\" he says. I can feel my own cheeks grow ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1074,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1074,1,0","type":4,"elements":"pale as I understand his meaning. \"Oh, Finnick, you don't think they ...\" \"Yes. I do. That's exactly what I think,\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1074,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1074,2,0","type":4,"elements":"he says. I have an image of Prim in a white room, strapped to a table, while masked, robed figures elicit those ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1074,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1074,3,0","type":4,"elements":"sounds from her. Somewhere they are torturing 