ter?\" I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1092,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1092,7,0","type":4,"elements":"ask. \"I mean, her mind?\" \"I don't know. I don't remember ever seeing her at the Games again. But she didn't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1092,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1092,8,0","type":4,"elements":"look too stable during the reaping this year,\" says Peeta. So that's who","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1093","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1093,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1093,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1094","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1094,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1094,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick loves, I think. Not his string of fancy lovers in the Capitol. But a poor, mad girl back home. A cannon ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1094,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1094,1,0","type":4,"elements":"blast brings us all together on the beach. A hovercraft appears in what we estimate to be the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1094,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1094,2,0","type":4,"elements":"six-to-seven-o'clock zone. We watch as the claw dips down five different times to retrieve the pieces of one ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1094,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1094,3,0","type":4,"elements":"body, torn apart. It's impossible to tell who it was. Whatever happens at six o'clock, I never want to know. Peeta ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1094,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1094,4,0","type":4,"elements":"draws a new map on a leaf, adding a JJ for jabberjays in the four-to-five-o'clock section and simply writing ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1094,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1094,5,0","type":4,"elements":"beast in the one where we saw the tribute collected in pieces. We now have a good idea of what seven of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1094,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1094,6,0","type":4,"elements":"hours will bring. And if there's any positive to the jabberjay attack, it's that it let us know where we are on the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1094,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1094,7,0","type":4,"elements":"clock face again. Finnick weaves yet another water basket and a net for fishing. I take a quick swim and put ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1094,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1094,8,0","type":4,"elements":"more ointment on my skin. Then I sit at the edge of the water, cleaning the fish","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1095","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1095,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1095,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick catches and watching the sun drop below the horizon. The bright moon is already on the rise, filling the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1095,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1095,1,0","type":4,"elements":"arena with that strange twilight. We're about to settle down to our meal of raw fish when the anthem begins. And ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1095,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1095,2,0","type":4,"elements":"then the faces ... Cashmere. Gloss. Wiress. Mags. The woman from District 5. The morphling who gave her life ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1095,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1095,3,0","type":4,"elements":"for Peeta. Blight. The man from 10. Eight dead. Plus eight from the first night. Two-thirds of us gone in a day ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1095,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1095,4,0","type":4,"elements":"and a half. That must be some kind of record. \"They're really burning through us,\" says Johanna. \"Who's left? ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1095,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1095,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Besides us five and District Two?\" asks Finnick. \"Chaff,\" says Peeta, without needing to think about it. Perhaps ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1095,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1095,6,0","type":4,"elements":"he's been keeping an eye out for him because of Haymitch. A parachute comes down with a pile of bite-sized ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1095,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1095,7,0","type":4,"elements":"square-shaped rolls. \"These are from your district, right, Beetee?\" Peeta asks. \"Yes, from District Three,\" he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1095,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1095,8,0","type":4,"elements":"says. \"How many are there?\" Finnick counts","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1096","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1096,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1096,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1097","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1097,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1097,0,0","type":4,"elements":"them, turning each one over in his hands before he sets it in a neat configuration. I don't know what it is with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1097,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1097,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick and bread, but he seems obsessed with handling it. \"Twenty-four,\" he says. \"An even two dozen, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1097,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1097,2,0","type":4,"elements":"then?\" says Beetee. \"Twenty-four on the nose,\" says Finnick. \"How should we divide them?\" \"Let's each have ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1097,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1097,3,0","type":4,"elements":"three, and whoever is still alive at breakfast can take a vote on the rest,\" says Johanna. I don't know why this ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1097,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1097,4,0","type":4,"elements":"makes me laugh a little. I guess because it's true. When I do, Johanna gives me a look that's almost approving. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1097,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1097,5,0","type":4,"elements":"No, not approving. But maybe slightly pleased. We wait until the giant wave has flooded out of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1097,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1097,6,0","type":4,"elements":"ten-to-eleven-o'clock section, wait for the water to recede, and then go to that beach to make camp. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1097,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1097,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Theoretically, we should have a full twelve hours of safety from the jungle. There's an unpleasant chorus of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1097,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1097,8,0","type":4,"elements":"clicking, probably from some evil type of insect, coming from the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1098","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1098,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1098,0,0","type":4,"elements":"eleven-to-twelve-o'clock wedge. But whatever is making the sound stays within the confines of the jungle and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1098,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1098,1,0","type":4,"elements":"we keep off that part of the beach in case they're just waiting for a carelessly placed footfall to swarm out. I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1098,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1098,2,0","type":4,"elements":"don't know how Johanna's still on her feet. She's only had about an hour of sleep since the Games started. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1098,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1098,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta and I volunteer for the first watch because we're better rested, and because we want some time alone. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1098,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1098,4,0","type":4,"elements":"The others go out immediately, although Finnick's sleep is restless. Every now and then I hear him murmuring ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1098,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1098,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Annie's name. Peeta and I sit on the damp sand, facing away from each other, my right shoulder and hip ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1098,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1098,6,0","type":4,"elements":"pressed against his. I watch the water as he watches the jungle, which is better for me. I'm still haunted by the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1098,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1098,7,0","type":4,"elements":"voices of the jabberjays, which unfortunately the insects can't drown out. After a while I rest my head against ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1098,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1098,8,0","type":4,"elements":"his shoulder. Feel his hand caress my hair. \"Katniss,\" he says","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1099","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1099,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1099,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1100","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1100,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1100,0,0","type":4,"elements":"softly, \"it's no use pretending we don't know what the other one is trying to do.\" No, I guess there isn't, but it's no ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1100,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1100,1,0","type":4,"elements":"fun discussing it, either. Well, not for us, anyway. The Capitol viewers will be glued to their sets so they don't ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1100,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1100,2,0","type":4,"elements":"miss one wretched word. \"I don't know what kind of deal you think you've made with Haymitch, but you should ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1100,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1100,3,0","type":4,"elements":"know he made me promises as well.\" Of course, I know this, too. He told Peeta they could keep me alive so ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1100,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1100,4,0","type":4,"elements":"that he wouldn't be suspicious. \"So I think we can assume he was lying to one of us.\" This gets my attention. A ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1100,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1100,5,0","type":4,"elements":"double deal. A double promise. With only Haymitch knowing which one is real. I raise my head, meet Peeta's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1100,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1100,6,0","type":4,"elements":"eyes. \"Why are you saying this now?\"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1101","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1101,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1101,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1102","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1102,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1102,0,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Because I don't want you forgetting how different our circumstances are. If you die, and I live, there's no life for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1102,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1102,1,0","type":4,"elements":"me at all back in District Twelve. You're my whole life,\" he","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1103","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1103,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1103,0,0","type":4,"elements":"says. \"I would never be happy again.\" I start to object but he puts a finger to my lips. \"It's different for you. I'm ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1103,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1103,1,0","type":4,"elements":"not saying it wouldn't be hard. But there are other people who'd make your life worth living.\" Peeta pulls the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1103,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1103,2,0","type":4,"elements":"chain with the gold disk from around his neck. He holds it in the moonlight so I can clearly see the mockingjay. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1103,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1103,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Then his thumb slides along a catch I didn't notice before and the disk pops open. It's not solid, as I had ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1103,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1103,4,0","type":4,"elements":"thought, but a locket. And within the locket are photos. On the right side, my mother and Prim, laughing. And on ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1103,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1103,5,0","type":4,"elements":"the left, Gale. Actually smiling. There is nothing in the world that could break me faster at this moment than ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1103,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1103,6,0","type":4,"elements":"these three faces. After what I heard this afternoon ... it is the perfect weapon. \"Your family needs you, Katniss,\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1103,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1103,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta says. My family. My mother. My sister. And my pretend cousin Gale. But Peeta's intention is clear. That ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1103,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1103,8,0","type":4,"elements":"Gale really is my family, or will be one day, if I live.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1104","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1104,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1104,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1105","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1105,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1105,0,0","type":4,"elements":"That I'll marry him. So Peeta's giving me his life and Gale at the same time. To let me know I shouldn't ever ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1105,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1105,1,0","type":4,"elements":"have doubts about it. Everything. That's what Peeta wants me to take from him. I wait for him to mention the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1105,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1105,2,0","type":4,"elements":"baby, to play to the cameras, but he doesn't. And that's how I know that none of this is part of the Games. That ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1105,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1105,3,0","type":4,"elements":"he is telling me the truth about what he feels. \"No one really needs me,\" he says, and there's no self-pity in his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1105,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1105,4,0","type":4,"elements":"voice. It's true his family doesn't need him. They will mourn 