 there is nothing but us to interrupt ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1106,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1106,4,0","type":4,"elements":"us. And after a few attempts, Peeta gives up on talking. The sensation inside me grows warmer and spreads ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1106,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1106,5,0","type":4,"elements":"out from my chest, down through my body, out along my arms and legs, to the tips of my being. Instead of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1106,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1106,6,0","type":4,"elements":"satisfying me, the kisses have the opposite effect, of making my need greater. I thought I was something of an ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1106,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1106,7,0","type":4,"elements":"expert on hunger, but this is an entirely new kind. It's the first crack of the lightning","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1107","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1107,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1107,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1108","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1108,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1108,0,0","type":4,"elements":"storm--the bolt hitting the tree at midnight--that brings us to our senses. It rouses Finnick as well. He sits up with ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1108,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1108,1,0","type":4,"elements":"a sharp cry. I see his fingers digging into the sand as he reassures himself that whatever nightmare he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1108,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1108,2,0","type":4,"elements":"inhabited wasn't real. \"I can't sleep anymore,\" he says. \"One of you should rest.\" Only then does he seem to ","format_id":"