me on. I'll teach you how to swim.\" I need to get him away from the others where we can discuss breaking ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1114,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1114,6,0","type":4,"elements":"away. It will be tricky, because once they realize we're severing the alliance, we'll be instant","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1115","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1115,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1115,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1116","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1116,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1116,0,0","type":4,"elements":"targets. If I was really teaching him to swim, I'd make him take off the belt since it keeps him afloat, but what ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1116,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1116,1,0","type":4,"elements":"does it matter now? So I just show him the basic stroke and let him practice going back and forth in waist-high ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1116,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1116,2,0","type":4,"elements":"water. At first, I notice Johanna keeping a careful eye on us, but eventually she loses interest and goes to take ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1116,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1116,3,0","type":4,"elements":"a nap. Finnick's weaving a new net out of vines and Beetee plays with his wire. I know the time has come. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1116,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1116,4,0","type":4,"elements":"While Peeta has been swimming, I've discovered something. My remaining scabs are starting to peel off. By ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1116,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1116,5,0","type":4,"elements":"gently rubbing a handful of sand up and down my arm, I clean off the rest of the scales, revealing fresh new ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1116,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1116,6,0","type":4,"elements":"skin underneath. I stop Peeta's practice, on the pretext of showing him how to rid himself of the itchy scabs, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1116,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1116,7,0","type":4,"elements":"and as we scrub ourselves, I bring up our escape. \"Look, the pool is down to eight. I think it's time we took off,\" I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1116,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1116,8,0","type":4,"elements":"say under my breath, although I doubt any of the tributes","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1117","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1117,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1117,0,0","type":4,"elements":"can hear me. Peeta nods, and I can see him considering my proposition. Weighing if the odds will be in our ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1117,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1117,1,0","type":4,"elements":"favor. \"Tell you what,\" he says. \"Let's stick around until Brutus and Enobaria are dead. I think Beetee's trying to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1117,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1117,2,0","type":4,"elements":"put together some kind of trap for them now. Then, I promise, we'll go.\" I'm not entirely convinced. But if we ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1117,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1117,3,0","type":4,"elements":"leave now, we'll have two sets of adversaries after us. Maybe three, because who knows what Chaff's up to? ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1117,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1117,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Plus the clock to contend with. And then there's Beetee to think of. Johanna only brought him for me, and if we ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1117,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1117,5,0","type":4,"elements":"leave she'll surely kill him. Then I remember. I can't protect Beetee, too. There can only be one victor and it has ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1117,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1117,6,0","type":4,"elements":"to be Peeta. I must accept this. I must make decisions based on his survival only. \"All right,\" I say. \"We'll stay ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1117,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1117,7,0","type":4,"elements":"until the Careers are dead. But that's the end of it.\" I turn and wave to Finnick. \"Hey, Finnick, come on in! We ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1117,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1117,8,0","type":4,"elements":"figured out how to make you pretty again!\" The three of us scour all","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1118","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1118,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1118,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1119","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1119,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1119,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the scabs from our bodies, helping with the others' backs, and come out the same pink as the sky. We apply ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1119,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1119,1,0","type":4,"elements":"another round of medicine because the skin seems too delicate for the sunlight, but it doesn't look half as bad ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1119,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1119,2,0","type":4,"elements":"on smooth skin and will be good camouflage in the jungle.","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1120","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1120,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1120,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1121","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1121,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1121,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Beetee calls us over, and it turns out that during all those hours of fiddling with wire, he has indeed come up ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1121,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1121,1,0","type":4,"elements":"with a plan. \"I think we'll all agree our next job is to kill Brutus and Enobaria,\" he says mildly. \"I doubt they'll ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1121,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1121,2,0","type":4,"elements":"attack us openly again, now that they're so outnumbered. We could track them down, I suppose, but it's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1121,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1121,3,0","type":4,"elements":"dangerous, exhausting work.\" \"Do you think they've figured out about the clock?\" I ask. \"If they haven't, they'll ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1121,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1121,4,0","type":4,"elements":"figure it out soon enough. Perhaps not as specifically as we have. But they must know that at least some of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1121,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1121,5,0","type":4,"elements":"zones are wired for attacks and that they're","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1122","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1122,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1122,0,0","type":4,"elements":"reoccurring in a circular fashion. Also, the fact that our last fight was cut off by Gamemaker intervention will not ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1122,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1122,1,0","type":4,"elements":"have gone unnoticed by them. We know it was an attempt to disorient us, but they must be asking themselves ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1122,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1122,2,0","type":4,"elements":"why it was done, and this, too, may lead them to the realization that the arena's a clock,\" says Beetee. \"So I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1122,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1122,3,0","type":4,"elements":"think our best bet will be setting our own trap.\" \"Wait, let me get Johanna up,\" says Finnick. \"She'll be rabid if ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1122,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1122,4,0","type":4,"elements":"she thinks she missed something this important.\" \"Or not,\" I mutter, since she's always pretty much rabid, but I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1122,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1122,5,0","type":4,"elements":"don't stop him, because I'd be angry myself if I was excluded from a plan at this point. When she's joined us, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1122,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1122,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Beetee shoos us all back a bit so he can have room to work in the sand. He swiftly draws a circle and divides it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1122,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1122,7,0","type":4,"elements":"into twelve wedges. It's the arena, not rendered in-Peeta's precise strokes but in the rough lines of a man ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1122,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1122,8,0","type":4,"elements":"whose mind is occupied by other, far more complex things. \"If you were","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1123","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1123,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1123,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1124","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1124,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1124,0,0","type":4,"elements":"Brutus and Enobaria, knowing what you do now about the jungle, where would you feel safest?\" Beetee asks. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1124,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1124,1,0","type":4,"elements":"There's nothing patronizing in his voice, and yet I can't help thinking he reminds me of a schoolteacher about to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1124,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1124,2,0","type":4,"elements":"ease children into a lesson. Perhaps it's the age difference, or simply that Beetee is probably about a million ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1124,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1124,3,0","type":4,"elements":"times smarter than the rest of us. \"Where we are now. On the beach,\" says Peeta. \"It's the safest place.\" \"So ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1124,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1124,4,0","type":4,"elements":"why aren't they on the beach?\" says Beetee. \"Because we're here,\" says Johanna impatiently. \"Exactly. We're ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1124,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1124,5,0","type":4,"elements":"here, claiming the beach. Now where would you go?\" says Beetee. I think about the deadly jungle, the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1124,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1124,6,0","type":4,"elements":"occupied beach. \"I'd hide just at the edge of the jungle. So I could escape if an attack came. And so I could spy ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1124,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1124,7,0","type":4,"elements":"on us.\" \"Also to eat,\" Finnick says. \"The jungle's full of strange creatures and plants. But by watching us, I'd ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1124,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1124,8,0","type":4,"elements":"know the seafood's safe.\" Beetee smiles at us as if we've exceeded his","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1125","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1125,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1125,0,0","type":4,"elements":"expectations. \"Yes, good. You do see. Now here's what I propose: a twelve o'clock strike. What happens ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1125,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1125,1,0","type":4,"elements":"exactly at noon and at midnight?\" \"The lightning bolt hits the tree,\" I say. \"Yes. So what I'm suggesting is that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1125,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1125,2,0","type":4,"elements":"after the bolt hits at noon, but before it hits at midnight, we run my wire from that tree all the way down into the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1125,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1125,3,0","type":4,"elements":"saltwater, which is, of course, highly conductive. When the bolt strikes, the electricity will travel","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1126","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1126,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1126,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1127","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1127,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1127,0,0","type":4,"elements":"down the wire and into not only the water but also the surrounding beach, which will still be damp from the ten ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1127,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1127,1,0","type":4,"elements":"o'clock wave. Anyone in contact with those surfaces at that moment will be electrocuted,\" says Beetee. There's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1127,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1127,2,0","type":4,"elements":"a long pause while we all digest Beetee's plan. It seems a bit fantastical to me, impossible even. But why? I've ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1127,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1127,3,0","type":4,"elements":"set thousands of snares. Isn't this just a larger snare with a more","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1128","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1128,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1128,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1129","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1129,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1129,0,0","type":4,"elements":"scientific component? Could it work? How can we even question it, we tributes trained to gather fish and lumber ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1129,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1129,1,0","type":4,"elements":"and coal? What do we know about harnessing power from the sky? Peeta takes a stab at it. \"Will that wire ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1129,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1129,2,0","type":4,"elements":"really be able to conduct that much power, Beetee? It looks so fragile, like it would just burn up.\" \"Oh, it will. But ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1129,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1129,3,0","type":4,"elements":"not until the current has passed through it. It will act something like a fuse, in fact. Except the electricity will ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1129,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1129,4,0","type":4,"elements":"travel along it,\" says Beetee. \"How do you know?\" asks Johanna, clearly not convinced. \"Because I invented ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1129,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1129,5,0","type":4,"elements":"it,\" says Beetee, as if slightly surprised. \"It's not actually wire in the usual sense. Nor is the lightning natural ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1129,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1129,6,0","type":4,"elements":"lightning nor the tree a real tree. You","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1130","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1130,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1130,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1131","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1131,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1131,0,0","type":4,"elements":"know trees better than any of us, Johanna. It would be destroyed by now, wouldn't it?\" \"Yes,\" she says glumly. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1131,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1131,1,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Don't worry about the wire -- it will do just what I say,\" Beetee","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1132","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1132,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1132,0,0","type":4,"elements":"assures us. \"And where will we be when this happens?\" asks Finnick. \"Far enough up in the jungle to be safe,\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1132,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1132,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Beetee replies. \"The Careers will be safe, too, then, unless they're in the vicinity of the water,\" I point out. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1132,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1132,2,0","type":4,"elements":"\"That's right,\" says Beetee. \"But all the seafood will be cooked,\" says Peeta. \"Probably more than cooked,\" ","format_id":"93e3f2