,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1135,0,0","type":4,"elements":"us too lost. Besides, I can do a lot more damage with a sheath of arrows than she can with two axes, so I'm the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1135,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1135,1,0","type":4,"elements":"best one to bring up the rear. The dense, muggy air weighs on me. There's been no break from it since the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1135,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1135,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Games began. I wish Haymitch would stop sending us that District 3 bread and get us some more of that ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1135,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1135,3,0","type":4,"elements":"District 4 stuff, because I've sweated out buckets in the last two days, and even though I've had the fish, I'm ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1135,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1135,4,0","type":4,"elements":"craving salt. A piece of ice would be another good idea. Or a cold drink of water. I'm grateful for the fluid from the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1135,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1135,5,0","type":4,"elements":"trees, but it's the same temperature as the seawater and the air and the other tributes and me. We're all just ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1135,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1135,6,0","type":4,"elements":"one big, warm stew. As we near the tree, Finnick suggests I take the lead. \"Katniss can hear the force field,\" he ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1135,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1135,7,0","type":4,"elements":"explains to Beetee and Johanna. \"Hear it?\" asks Beetee. \"Only with","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1136","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1136,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1136,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1137","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1137,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1137,0,0","type":4,"elements":"the ear the Capitol reconstructed,\" I say. Guess who","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1138","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1138,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1138,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1139","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1139,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1139,0,0","type":4,"elements":"I'm not fooling with that story? Beetee. Because surely he remembers that he showed me how to spot a force ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1139,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1139,1,0","type":4,"elements":"field, and probably it's impossible to hear force fields, anyway. But, for whatever reason, he doesn't question my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1139,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1139,2,0","type":4,"elements":"claim. \"Then by all means, let Katniss go first,\" he says, pausing a moment to wipe the steam off his glasses. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1139,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1139,3,0","type":4,"elements":"\"Force fields are nothing to play around with.\" The lightning tree's unmistakable as it towers so high above the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1139,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1139,4,0","type":4,"elements":"others. I find a bunch of nuts and make everybody wait while I move slowly up the slope, tossing the nuts ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1139,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1139,5,0","type":4,"elements":"ahead of me. But I see the force field almost immediately, even before a nut hits it, because it's only about ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1139,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1139,6,0","type":4,"elements":"fifteen yards away. My eyes, which are sweeping the greenery before me, catch sight of the rippled square high ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1139,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1139,7,0","type":4,"elements":"up and to my right. I throw a nut directly in front of me and hear it sizzle in confirmation. \"Just stay below the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1139,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1139,8,0","type":4,"elements":"lightning tree,\" I tell the others. We divide up","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1140","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1140,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1140,0,0","type":4,"elements":"duties. Finnick guards Beetee while he examines the tree, Johanna taps for water, Peeta gathers nuts, and I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1140,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1140,1,0","type":4,"elements":"hunt nearby. The tree rats don't seem to have any fear of humans, so I take down three easily. The sound of ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1140,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1140,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the ten o'clock wave reminds me I should get back, and I return to the others and clean my kill. Then I draw a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1140,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1140,3,0","type":4,"elements":"line in the dirt a few feet from the force field as a reminder to keep back, and Peeta and I settle down to roast ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1140,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1140,4,0","type":4,"elements":"nuts and sear cubes of rat. Beetee is still messing around the tree, doing I don't know what, taking ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1140,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1140,5,0","type":4,"elements":"measurements and such. At one point he snaps off a sliver of bark, joins us, and throws it against the force ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1140,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1140,6,0","type":4,"elements":"field. It bounces back and lands on the ground, glowing. In a few moments it returns to its original color. \"Well, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1140,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1140,7,0","type":4,"elements":"that explains a lot,\" says Beetee. I look at Peeta and can't help biting my lip to keep from laughing since it ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1140,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1140,8,0","type":4,"elements":"explains absolutely nothing to anyone but Beetee. About this time we","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1141","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1141,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1141,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1142","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1142,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1142,0,0","type":4,"elements":"hear the sound of clicks rising from the sector adjacent to us. That means it's eleven o'clock. It's far louder in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1142,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1142,1,0","type":4,"elements":"the jungle than it was on the beach last night. We all listen intently. \"It's not mechanical,\" Beetee says decidedly. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1142,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1142,2,0","type":4,"elements":"\"I'd guess insects,\" I say. \"Maybe beetles.\" \"Something with pincers,\" adds Finnick. The sound swells, as if ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1142,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1142,3,0","type":4,"elements":"alerted by our quiet words to the proximity of live flesh. Whatever is making that clicking, I bet it could strip us to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1142,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1142,4,0","type":4,"elements":"the bone in seconds. \"We should get out of here, anyway,\" says Johanna. \"There's less than an hour before ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1142,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1142,5,0","type":4,"elements":"the lightning starts.\" We don't go that far, though. Only to the identical tree in the blood-rain section. We have a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1142,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1142,6,0","type":4,"elements":"picnic of sorts, squatting on the ground, eating our jungle food, waiting for the bolt that signals noon. At ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1142,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1142,7,0","type":4,"elements":"Beetee's request, I climb up into the canopy as the clicking begins to fade out. When the lightning strikes, it's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1142,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1142,8,0","type":4,"elements":"dazzling, even from here, even in this bright sunlight. It","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1143","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1143,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1143,0,0","type":4,"elements":"completely encompasses the distant tree, making it glow a","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1144","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1144,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1144,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1145","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1145,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1145,0,0","type":4,"elements":"hot blue-white and causing the surrounding air to crackle with electricity. I swing down and report my findings to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1145,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1145,1,0","type":4,"elements":"Beetee, who seems satisfied, even if I'm not terribly scientific. We take a circuitous route back to the ten o'clock ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1145,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1145,2,0","type":4,"elements":"beach. The sand is smooth and damp, swept clean by the recent wave. Beetee essentially gives us the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1145,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1145,3,0","type":4,"elements":"afternoon off while he works with the wire. Since it's his weapon and the rest of us have to defer to his ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1145,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1145,4,0","type":4,"elements":"knowledge so entirely, there's the odd feeling of being let out of school early. At first we take turns having naps ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1145,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1145,5,0","type":4,"elements":"in the shadowy edge of the jungle, but by late afternoon everyone is awake and restless. We decide, since this ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1145,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1145,6,0","type":4,"elements":"might be our last chance for seafood, to make a sort of feast of it. Under Finnick's guidance we spear fish and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1145,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1145,7,0","type":4,"elements":"gather shellfish, even dive for oysters. I like this last part","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1146","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1146,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1146,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1147","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1147,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1147,0,0","type":4,"elements":"best, not because I have any great appetite for oysters. I only ever tasted them once, in the Capitol, and I ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1147,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1147,1,0","type":4,"elements":"couldn't get around the sliminess. But it's lovely, deep down under the water, like being in a different world. The ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1147,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1147,2,0","type":4,"elements":"water's very clear, and schools of bright-hued fish and strange sea flowers decorate the sand floor. Johanna ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1147,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1147,3,0","type":4,"elements":"keeps watch while Finnick, Peeta, and I clean and lay out the seafood. Peeta's just pried open an oyster when ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1147,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1147,4,0","type":4,"elements":"I hear him give a laugh. \"Hey, look at this!\" He holds up a glistening, perfect pearl about the size of a pea. \"You ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1147,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1147,5,0","type":4,"elements":"know, if you put enough pressure on coal it turns to pearls,\" he says earnestly to Finnick. \"No, it doesn't,\" says ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1147,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1147,6,0","type":4,"elements":"Finnick dismissively. But I crack up, remembering that's how a clueless Effie Trinket presented us to the people ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1147,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1147,7,0","type":4,"elements":"of the Capitol last year, before anyone knew us. As coal pressured into pearls by our weighty existence. Beauty ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1147,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1147,8,0","type":4,"elements":"that arose out of pain. Peeta rinses the pearl off in the water and hands it to","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1148","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1148,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1148,0,0","type":4,"elements":"me. \"For you.\" I hold it out on my palm and examine its iridescent surface in the sunlight. Yes, I will keep it. For ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1148,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1148,1,0","type":4,"elements":"the few remaining hours of my life I will keep it close. This last gift from Peeta. The only one I can really accept. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1148,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1148,2,0","type":4,"elements":"Perhaps it will give me strength in the final moments. \"Thanks,\" I say, closing my fist around it. I look coolly into ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1148,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1148,3,0","type":4,"elements":"the blue eyes of the person who is now my greatest opponent, the person who would keep me alive at his own ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1148,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1148,4,0","type":4,"elements":"expense. And I promise myself I will defeat his plan. The laughter drains from those eyes, and they are staring ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1148,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1148,5,0","type":4,"elements":"so intensely into mine, it's like they can read my thoughts. \"The locket didn't work, did it?\" Peeta says, even ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1148,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1148,6,0","type":4,"elements":"though Finnick is right there. Even though everyone can hear him. \"Katniss?\" \"It worked,\" I say. \"But not the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1148,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1148,7,0","type":4,"elements":"way I wanted it to,\" he says, averting his glance. After that he will look at nothing but oysters. Just as we're ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1148,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1148,8,0","type":4,"elements":"about to eat, a parachute appears bearing two supplements to our","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1149","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1149,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1149,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1150","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1150,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1150,0,0","type":4,"elements":"meal. A small pot of spicy red sauce and yet another round of rolls from District 3. Finnick, of course, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1150,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1150,1,0","type":4,"elements":"immediately counts them. \"Twenty-four again,\" he says. Thirty-two rolls,","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1151","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1151,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1151,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1152","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1152,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1152,0,0","type":4,"elements":"then. So we each take five, leaving seven, which will never divide equally. It's bread for only one. The salty fish ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1152,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1152,1,0","type":4,"elements":"flesh, the succulent shellfish. Even the oysters seem tasty, vastly improved by the sauce. We gorge ourselves ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1152,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1152,2,0","type":4,"elements":"until no one can hold another bite, and even then there are leftovers. They won't keep, though, so we toss all ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1152,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1152,3,0","type":4,"elements":"the remaining food back into the water so the Careers won't get it when we leave. No one bothers about the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1152,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1152,4,0","type":4,"elements":"shells. The wave should clear those away. There's nothing to do now but wait. Peeta and I sit at the edge of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1152,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1152,5,0","type":4,"elements":"water, hand in hand, wordless. He gave his speech last night but it didn't change my mind, and nothing I can ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1152,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1152,6,0","type":4,"elements":"say will change his. The time for persuasive","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1153","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1153,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1153,0,0","type":4,"elements":"gifts is over. I have the pearl, though, secured in a parachute with the spile and the medicine at my waist. I hope ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1153,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1153,1,0","type":4,"elements":"it makes it back to District 12. Surely my mother and Prim will know to return it to Peeta before they bury my ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1153,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1153,2,0","type":4,"elements":"body. The anthem begins, but there are no faces in the sky tonight. The audience will be restless, thirsting for ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1153,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1153,3,0","type":4,"elements":"blood. Beetee's trap holds enough promise, though, that the Gamemakers haven't sent in other attacks. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1153,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1153,4,0","type":4,"elements":"Perhaps they are simply curious to see if it will work. At what Finnick and I judge to be about nine, we leave our ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1153,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1153,5,0","type":4,"elements":"shell-strewn camp, cross to the twelve o'clock beach, and begin to quietly hike up to the lightning tree in the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1153,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1153,6,0","type":4,"elements":"light of the moon. Our full stomachs make us more uncomfortable and breathless than we were on the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1153,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1153,7,0","type":4,"elements":"morning's climb. I begin to regret those last dozen oysters. Beetee asks Finnick to assist him, and the rest of us ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1153,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1153,8,0","type":4,"elements":"stand guard. Before he even attaches any wire to the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1154","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1154,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1154,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1155","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1155,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1155,0,0","type":4,"elements":"tree, Beetee unrolls yards and yards of the stuff. He has Finnick secure it tightly around a broken branch and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1155,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1155,1,0","type":4,"elements":"lay it on the ground. Then they stand on either side of the tree, passing the spool back and forth as they wrap ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1155,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1155,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the wire around and around the trunk. At first it seems arbitrary, then I see a pattern, like an intricate maze, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1155,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1155,3,0","type":4,"elements":"appearing in the moonlight on Beetee's side. I wonder if it makes any difference how the wire's placed, or if this ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1155,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1155,4,0","type":4,"elements":"is merely to add to the speculation of the audience. I bet most of them know as much about electricity as I do. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1155,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1155,5,0","type":4,"elements":"The work on the trunk's completed just as we hear the wave begin. I've never really worked out at what point in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1155,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1155,6,0","type":4,"elements":"the ten o'clock hour it erupts. There must be some buildup, then the wave itself, then the aftermath of the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1155,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1155,7,0","type":4,"elements":"flooding. But the sky tells me ten-thirty. This is when Beetee reveals the rest of the plan. Since we move most ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1155,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1155,8,0","type":4,"elements":"swiftly through the trees, he wants Johanna and","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1156","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1156,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1156,0,0","type":4,"elements":"me to take the coil down through the jungle, unwinding the wire as we go. We are to lay it across the twelve ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1156,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1156,1,0","type":4,"elements":"o'clock beach and drop the metal spool, with whatever is left, deep into the water, making sure it sinks. Then ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1156,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1156,2,0","type":4,"elements":"run for the jungle. If we go now, right now, we should make it to safety. \"I want to go with them as a guard,\" ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1156,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1156,3,0","type":4,"elements":"Peeta says immediately. After the moment with the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1157","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1157,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1157,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1158","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1158,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1158,0,0","type":4,"elements":"pearl, I know he's less willing than ever to let me out of his sight. \"You're too slow. Besides, I'll need you on this ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1158,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1158,1,0","type":4,"elements":"end. Katniss will guard,\" says Beetee. \"There's no time to debate this. I'm sorry. If the girls are to get out of there ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1158,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1158,2,0","type":4,"elements":"alive, they need to move now.\" He hands the coil to Johanna. I don't like the plan any more than Peeta does. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1158,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1158,3,0","type":4,"elements":"How can I protect him at a distance? But Beetee's right. With his leg, Peeta is too slow to make it down the ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1158,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1158,4,0","type":4,"elements":"slope in time. Johanna and I are the","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1159","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1159,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1159,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1160","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1160,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1160,0,0","type":4,"elements":"fastest and most sure-footed on the jungle floor. I can't think of any alternative. And if I trust anyone here ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1160,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1160,1,0","type":4,"elements":"besides Peeta, it's Beetee. \"It's okay,\" I tell Peeta. \"We'll just drop the coil and come straight back up.\" \"Not into ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1160,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1160,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the lightning zone,\" Beetee reminds me. \"Head for the tree in the one-to-two-o'clock sector. If you find you're ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1160,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1160,3,0","type":4,"elements":"running out of time, move over one more. Don't even think about going back on the beach, though, until I can ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1160,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1160,4,0","type":4,"elements":"assess the damage.\"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1161","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1161,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1161,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1162","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1162,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1162,0,0","type":4,"elements":"I take Peeta's face in my hands. \"Don't worry. I'll see you at midnight.\" I give him a kiss and, before he can ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1162,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1162,1,0","type":4,"elements":"object any further, I let go and turn to Johanna. \"Ready?\" \"Why not?\" says Johanna with a shrug. She's clearly ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1162,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1162,2,0","type":4,"elements":"no happier about being teamed up than I am. But we're all caught up in Beetee's trap. \"You guard, I'll unwind. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1162,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1162,3,0","type":4,"elements":"We can trade off later.\" Without further discussion, we head down the slope. In fact","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1163","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1163,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1163,0,0","type":4,"elements":"there's very little discussion between us at all. We move at a pretty good clip, one manning the coil, the other ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1163,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1163,1,0","type":4,"elements":"keeping watch. About halfway down, we hear the clicking beginning to rise, indicating it's after eleven. \"Better ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1163,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1163,2,0","type":4,"elements":"hurry,\" Johanna says. \"I want to put a lot of distance between me and that water before the lightning hits. Just in ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1163,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1163,3,0","type":4,"elements":"case Volts miscalculated something.\" \"I'll take the coil for a while,\" I say. It's harder work laying out the wire than ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1163,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1163,4,0","type":4,"elements":"guarding, and 