creased their clicking until it's a continuous roar in my ears. No, wait. Maybe my ears ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1173,14","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1173,14,0","type":4,"elements":"are actually ringing from the hit. Until the insects shut up, it will be impossible to tell. But when the insects go ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1173,15","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1173,15,0","type":4,"elements":"silent, the lightning will start. I have to move faster. I have to get to Peeta. The boom of a cannon pulls me up ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1173,16","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1173,16,0","type":4,"elements":"short. Someone has died. I know that with everyone running around armed and scared right now, it","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1174","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1174,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1174,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1175","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1175,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1175,0,0","type":4,"elements":"could be anybody. But whoever it is, I believe the death will trigger a kind of free-for-all out here in the night. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1175,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1175,1,0","type":4,"elements":"People will kill first and wonder about their motives later. I force my legs into a run. Something snags my feet ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1175,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1175,2,0","type":4,"elements":"and I sprawl out on the ground. I feel it wrapping around me, entwining me in sharp fibers. A net! This must be ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1175,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1175,3,0","type":4,"elements":"one of Finnick's fancy nets, positioned to trap me, and he must be nearby, trident in hand. I flail around for a ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1175,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1175,4,0","type":4,"elements":"moment, only working the web more tightly around me, and then I catch a glimpse of it in the moonlight. ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1175,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1175,5,0","type":4,"elements":"Confused, I lift my arm and see it's entangled in shimmering golden threads. It's not one of Finnick's nets at all, ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1175,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1175,6,0","type":4,"elements":"but Beetee's wire. I carefully rise to my feet and find I'm in a patch of the stuff that caught on a trunk on its way ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1175,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1175,7,0","type":4,"elements":"back to the lightning tree. Slowly I disengage myself from the wire, step out of its reach, and continue uphill. On ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1175,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1175,8,0","type":4,"elements":"the good side, I'm on the right path and","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1176","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1176,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1176,0,0","type":4,"elements":"have not been so disoriented by the head injury as to lose my sense of direction. On the bad side, the wire has ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1176,1","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1176,1,0","type":4,"elements":"reminded me of the oncoming lightning storm. I can still hear the insects, but are they starting to fade? I keep ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1176,2","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1176,2,0","type":4,"elements":"the loops of wire a few feet to my left as a guide as I run but take great care not to touch them. If those insects ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1176,3","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1176,3,0","type":4,"elements":"are fading and the first bolt is about to strike the tree, then all its power will come surging down that wire and ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1176,4","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1176,4,0","type":4,"elements":"anyone in contact with it will die. The tree swims into view, its trunk festooned with gold. I slow down, try to ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1176,5","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1176,5,0","type":4,"elements":"move with some stealth, but I'm really just lucky to be upright. I look for a sign of the others. No one. No one is ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1176,6","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1176,6,0","type":4,"elements":"there. \"Peeta?\" I call softly. \"Peeta?\" A soft moan answers me and I whip around to find a figure lying higher up ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1176,7","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1176,7,0","type":4,"elements":"on the ground. \"Beetee!\" I exclaim. I hurry and kneel beside him. The moan must have been involuntary. He's ","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]},{"id":"0,1176,8","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1176,8,0","type":4,"elements":"not conscious, although I can see no wound except a","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1177","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1177,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1177,0,0","type":4,"elements":"","format_id":"93e3f29c-098d-4872-9ef8-405c14e5a29d"}]}],"format_name":"Text body"},{"id":"0,1178","type":2,"elements":[{"id":"0,1178,0","type":3,"elements":[{"id":"0,1178,0,0","type":4,"elements":"gash below the crook of his elbow. I grab a nearby handful of moss and clumsily wrap it while I try to rouse him.","format_id":"93e